<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Leewwito</para>
  <para style="toc1">Leewwitotikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Leewwitotikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lew.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Leewwitotikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kunni Leewwitoti Seerik maxaaf bire Isra'eeli'n hexxemmaxxa magenoonfachchotixxa aadanna amanatike seeruwwixxeeten; iittanni konnee seeruwwa hujete'n hosiisatee baallooma affe'eemmaxxee qeesexxee haaso'aan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Konne maxaafik umi yaadi: Mageniinxe qullummaxxee haaso'eeken; iittanni Mageniink ardi konne wooyyichcha kade'eeke Isra'eelika Mageninni welt shiqqoxxa muttumma afaashsha hitta hedheek orinni magenooffachcho insa'ne hassissaaxxa barrisaan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Konne maxaafi giddo yo'oshsha ege'nemeek ajaji, Yessuussi langake lumoke ajajan hiyyexxi kuleeke ajaji 19:18 afemaaken; isinna «manjo duuchcha ifike umishsha eeyyi» hiyyaaken.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Uwwatikanna Tolchiinka Seera <char style="ior"><ref loc="LEV 1:1-7:38">1:1—7:38</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Aarooninna isixxe labbaxxe oosexxa Qeesummatixxa Hariirema <char style="ior"><ref loc="LEV 8:1-10:20">8:1—10:20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ca'itte kaadeexxanna ca'itte kadeebaaxxe yaaneka, iittanni luqqi hiyyatika Seera <char style="ior"><ref loc="LEV 11:1-15:33">11:1—15:33</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cubbo Biratixxa Barra <char style="ior"><ref loc="LEV 16:1-34">16:1-34</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Woyyummatixxe Hedhoka Seeranna Magenoonfachchotika Seera <char style="ior"><ref loc="LEV 17:1-27:34">17:1—27:34</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ciincatika Tolcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootti ulfinnik leellammake duunkaana'n Mageni Muuse ye'eexi konnechchi butta hedheeka ajaje iso'n hiyye kulee qici: <verse eid="LEV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:2" />«Isira'eelik ardi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolcha shiqishaa wodda: lali giddii'n, gedhebi giddii'n, yookaan re'e giddii'n kadowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3" />« ‹Kunni ciincatik tolchi horiinke kadoole fayyaka jibichcha kadowwaal. Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo adhdhemeeke tolcha kadaashsha Mageni ulfinnik leellammake dunkaanixxe hula edo shiqishowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4" />Cubbo isixxa biraake tolcha kadaashsha anga isixxa ookkone horike umi hana uggowaal. <verse eid="LEV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5" />Manjichchikinna jibichcha ookkonee Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo gorra'owwaal; Aaroonike minixxi qeese ookkone jibichchixxa munde Mageni edo shiqishowwaal. Mageni ulfinnik leellammake duunkaanixxe hula edo hedheeke tolchimalchiinke shooliinge kasuwwa duuchcha'n qeese munde fiffixxowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 1:6" />Isinna ookkonee jibichcha duleexxi mikita mikita'n woxe fulchowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 1:7" />Qeesichchi Aaroonixxi labbaxxi oose tolchiinxa haqqe tolchimalchoke'n tuuldeexxi giiratanna itti ha'ishshowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 1:8" />Aaroonixxi qeese oose ookkone horika uminna ha'yo kukkutemeemmake maalinninni welti tolchimalchoke'n ha'yita'neexxe haqqe hana dalchitowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 1:9" />Iikkinni manjichchi godobi giddiranna manne anshowaal. Qeesichchikinna tolchake shiqemmachcho duuchcha tolchimalchoke'n ciincesowwaal. Ciincatik foolinna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachchiisaan.<verse eid="LEV 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 1:10" />«‹Ciincatike tolchi'a re'etenaa'n yookaan gedhebokenaa'n shiqisha'noole fayyakenna labbake kadowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 1:11" />Tolchimalchoke'n middi darre'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo ookkone korbeessa gorra'owwaal; qeese Aaroonixxi oose munde ookkone horixxa aaxxeexi tolchimalchiinke shooliniinge kasa'n fifixxowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 1:12" />Iikinni manjichchi gorra'eeka hore mikita mikitake'ni woxe fulcheechchi uduma qeesichchi ookkene horka maala duuchcha uminna ha'yo gattebaangi tolchimalchoke'n dalchendeexxi ha'yita'neexxe haqqe'n uggowaal. <verse eid="LEV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 1:13" />Manjichchikinna tolchemeeke horika godobi giddiiranna manne wodi'iki anshowwaal; qeesichchikinna tolchakee shiqemmachcho duuchcha Magenoke tolchimalchoke'n ciinceesowwaal; Iitta hedheeki ciincatiki fooli Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachchiisaan.<verse eid="LEV 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 1:14" />« ‹Manjichikinna tolchiinxe ciinca'a shiqisho'a haseexxi uwwa ci'atenaa'nite kaddoole guugenjo yookaan shiixxoxxe guugenjo kaddowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 1:15" />Qeesichikinna ci'a tolcha shiqishemmakenaa'n aadhe tolchimalchoke'n ci'a eetteneka gooba micciirowwaal; tolchimalchoke'n hexxeexxe giira'n umo isekanna ciincesowwaal; munde eettene ci'axxanna tolchimalchiinke qarqara'ni coccossowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 1:16" />Guchchuwwatanna godobi giddiira tolchimalchokenaa'n boroti darre'n bululi huneemmammaxxe bakka'n hunowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 1:17" />Ci'atika keeluwwa abide gargar hissoqe'e; yaane kinni maala kukkuteexxi qeesichchi tolchimalchoke'n hexxeexxe giira'n ciincesowwaal; iitta hedheeki ciincixxi fishshe Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachiisaaken.<verse eid="LEV 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LEV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Midhatixxa Uwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 2:1" />« ‹Huuni manjinna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a midhatixxa uwwa shiqishaa wodda eettene midhixxa shaqqaxxa bulle shiqishowwaal; bullete'ninna ejeersiinxa zayite itti cossowwaal; hixaanakanna itti lebowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 2:2" />Qeese Aaroonixxe oosebaa iyyedagowwaal; insa'ne giddii'n mitti qeesichchi shiqqeexxa zayitenna eettene shaqqaxxe bulleenaa'n mitte oobo aadheexxi hixaana duuchcha Magenokee shiqisha'neexa qaabachisatee tolchimalchoke'ni ciincesowwaal; iitta hedheeki medhatixxe ciincaki fooli Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachiisan. <verse eid="LEV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 2:3" />Gatteexi midhatixxi uwwa Aarooni'aanna labbaxxe isixxe oose'a uwwendowwaal; Magenokee shiqqeexxe midhatixxe uwwanaa'n gatteexxe kaddemmaxxee hara woyyoondeexxen.<verse eid="LEV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 2:4" />« ‹Midhatixxi uwwanna giirate'n ra'eexxe kebbo kaddoole gamaami tuqebaaxxe kaddowwaal; isenna zayite karsende giissineexe yookaan zayite itti hana buurrendeeke shaqqaxxe bulleke xalta kadowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 2:5" />Iitti midhatixxa uwwanna she'late'n ra'isendeexxe kaddoole shaqqaxxe bulle'n ejeersiinxi zayite karsendeexxi giissendeexxenna gamami tuqeebaaxxe kaddowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 2:6" />Shiqqeexxa kebbonna shashate'e ejeersiinxa zayite hana buurteetexxi midhatixxe uwwa assite shiqishshaton. <verse eid="LEV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 2:7" />Midhatixxi uwwa hubbuqitte sibiliinxe sha'lan ra'isendeexxe kaddoole shaqqiteexe bulle'n ejeersiinxi zayite karsende qushshinde ra'isindeexxe kaddowaal. <verse eid="LEV 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 2:8" />Midhatixxi uwwa Magenoke uwweendeexxe tolcha assite'e qeesichchoke'n uuwwtaton; qeesichchikinna eettene uwwa tolchimalchiibaa shiqishaan. <verse eid="LEV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 2:9" />Qeesichchikinna shiqqeexxe uwwa duuchchanaa'n aadheexxi Magenoke shiqqeexxe kaddeexxa qaabachiisatee tolchimalchoke'n ciinceesaan; iita hexxeexxe midhatixxe ciincaxxi fishshe Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachchiisaan. <verse eid="LEV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 2:10" />Gatteexxi midhatixxi uwwa qeesetee uwwendowwaal; isenna Magenokee uwwendeexxe uwwanaa'n gatteexxe kaddemmaxxee hara woyyoondeexxen.<verse eid="LEV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 2:11" />« ‹Ciincessatee Magenokee shiqqaaxxe midhatixxe uwwanni welti shiqqaaxxa lebele yookaan malebo giirate'n ciincesitoxxe'e; tennexxee Magenokee shiqqaaxxi midhatixxi uwwa duuchcha gamaami tuqebaaxxe kaddowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 2:12" />Wogga wogga'ni aassexxinaaxxe midhanaa'n umo Magenokee iyyedagginaan; tenne umo utinemmaxxa midhixxi fishshe gammachchisaashsha tolchimalchoke'n ciinceesemoqqe'e. <verse eid="LEV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 2:13" />Midhatixxe uwwa duuchcha'n maxine lebi; atike Magenixxa kakoxxa maxine deetoxxe'e; tennexxee midhatixxe uwwa duuchcha'n maxine leba hassissaan.<verse eid="LEV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 2:14" />« ‹Sirete'ni haandatoxxe midhaka umo Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uutato wodda soqemeexxi giirate'n ayemeeke tisha kadowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 2:15" />Tinni midhatixxe uwwa kaddemmaxxee ejeersiinxa zayitenna hixaana itti lebi; <verse eid="LEV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 2:16" />Qeesichchikinna eettene midhatixxe uwwanaa'ni aadheexxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uwwendeexxe kaddeexxa qaabachisatee zayitenna hixaana eettene midhanni welti ciinceesaan.<verse eid="LEV 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LEV 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mittoomiixxa Uwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 3:1" />« ‹Ayyinna lalokenaa'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a mittoomiixxa uwwa shiqishaa wodda fayyaka jibichcha yookaan fayyaaxxa saayya file iyyedagowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 3:2" />Hore shiqishaak manji shiqishammake horiinke umi hana anga ifixxa uggeexxi Mageni ulfinik leellammake duunkaanixxe hula bira gorra'owwaal; qeese Aaroonixxi labbaxxi oose munde ookkone horixxa aaxxeexxi tolchimalchiinke shooliinge kasa'n fiffixxowaal. <verse eid="LEV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 3:3" />Mittoomiinke tolchi'naa'n Duuchchi Woddike Goottti'a giirate'n shiqaake tolcha asseexxi shishowwaal; godobi giddira buqaaki mooro'o, godobi giddira'n hedheeka mooro'o duuchcha, <verse eid="LEV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 3:4" />Lame kalattuwwa, tenne kalatuwwa hananna ciinachchuwwiinke qarqara'n hedheeka mooro'o, iittan tidhoti hana hedheeka saapha kalatuwwati welti fulchowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 3:5" />Kunni ciincatike tolcha kademmaxxee Aaroonixxi labbaxxi oose tolchimalchoke'n giiratixxe haqqe hana ciincesitowwaal; konne tolchixxi fishshe Duuchchi Woddike Gootta gammachchiissaan.<verse eid="LEV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 3:6" />« ‹Mittomakee shiqaaki tolchi gedhebokenaa'n yookaan re'etenaa'ni kadoole, fayyakenna labbake yookaan meyyake kadowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 3:7" />Ayyinna shiqishaak tolchi buruusa gedhebiinke kadoole Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo shiqishowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 3:8" />Anga ifixxanna buruusa ookkoneke umi hana uggeexxi Mageni ulfinniki leellammake duunkaan edo ookkonee buruusa gorra'owwaal; Aaroonixxi labbaxxi oose ookkone buruusixxa munde aaxxe tolchimalchiinke shooliinge kasa'n fiffixxowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 3:9" />Magenoke ciincatike tolcha kadeexxi ookkone shiqeemake mittoomiinke tolchinaa'n ciincatike tolcha kadeexxi shiqaachchuwwi: ookkone horik ha'yinna duugunguurii qico'n fulchendeexxi duba duuchcha, godobi giddira buqeek mooro'i duuchchi, godobi giddiirinni welti abidemeek mooro'i duuchchi, <verse eid="LEV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 3:10" />Lame kalattuwwa, tenne kalattuwwa hananna ciinachuwwiinke qarqara'n hedheeke mooro'o, iittanni tidhoti hana hedheeka saapha kalattuwwandinni welti fulchowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 3:11" />Qeesichchikinna konnee duuchcha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqeeke itatike tolcha asse tolchimalchoke'n ciincesaan.<verse eid="LEV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 3:12" />« ‹Ayyinna Magenoke shiqishaaki tolchi re'ete kaddoole Mageni edo shiqishowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 3:13" />Anga ifixxanna ookkone recciinke umi hana uggeexxi duunkaan edo gorra'owwaal; Aaroonixxi labbaxxi oosenna munde eettenee aaxxeexi tolchimalchiinke shooliniinge kasa'n fiffixxowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 3:14" />Ookkone recciinke maalanaa'n Duuchchi Woddik Gootti'a itatike tolcha assine shiqinshaaki: godobi giddira buqamake mooro'o, godobi giddiirinni welti abidemeeka mooro'o duuchcha, <verse eid="LEV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 3:15" />Lame kalattuwwa, tenne kalatuwwa hananna ciinaachuwwiinke qarqara'n hedheeka mooro'o, iittanni tidhoti hana hedheeka saapha kalatuwwandinni fulchowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 3:16" />Qeesichchikinna tennee ita duuchcha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a gammachchiissaaxxe fishshe kaddaashsha tolchimalchoke'n ciincesowwaal; ha'yo duuchcha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a foyendeexe kaddowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 3:17" />« ‹Isira'eelike manjonaa'n ha'yo afeeka maalanna horiinxa munde itaaki hedhoqqe'e; tinninna Isira'eeliki ardi hedhaake baro duuchcha'ninna booncho duuchcha'n heqqendeexxi hexxaaxxe aada kaddowwaal.› »<verse eid="LEV 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LEV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Haakitik Hujendeexxe Cubboka Tolcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 4:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse, <verse eid="LEV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 4:2" />«Isira'eelixxe oose'ni kuldattoxi: ‹ayyinna dedhiki cubbo hujoole yookaan haakitiki Duuchchi Woddik Gootti uwweeke ajajuwanaa'n mitte sa'oole konnechchi butta hexxeexxa aada muuxowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 4:3" />« ‹Qeesetiki sooreessi cubbo hujee'naa itti cubbo arda duuchcha daaffaaxe kaddoole, fayyaka jibichcha iyyedagowwaal; cubbo isixxa biratee Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolcha shiqishowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 4:4" />Jibichchakanna Mageni ulfiniki leellammake duunkaaniinxe hulaba iyyedage anga isixxanna jibichchiinke umi hana ugge Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo gorra'owaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 4:5" />Ookkonchchi uduma hariiremeeki qeesetik sooreessi, jibichchiinxe mundenaa'n shiixxoxxa aadheexi duunkaani giddi'a e'yati, <verse eid="LEV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 4:6" />Munde eettene giddo qubichcho isika cuupha'n Mageni ulfiniki leellammake seemmati giissinemake fooqike golo'ni torbaanele fixowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 4:7" />Umi qeesichchi eettene mundenaa'n shiixxooxa aadheexxi duunkaani giddo Magenoke hixaana gunbamalcho'ni issowwaal; gatteexxa munde kinni duunkaanibaa e'yatixxe huddume'ni ciincatika tolchimalchi hunda dunowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 4:8" />Cubbotike tolchi'a shiqqeexxa Jibichiinxa ha'yonna godobi giddira buqaaka mooro'o, <verse eid="LEV 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 4:9" />Lame kalattuwwa, tenne kalatuwwa hananna ciinachuwwinke qarqara'n hedheeke mooro'o, iittan tidhoti hana hedheeka saapha kalatuwwati welti fulchowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 4:10" />Qeesichchi tenne ha'yo duuchcha aadhe tolcha ciincesinamma tolchimalcho'n ciincesowwaal; konne tolchiik seeri muuxemaa qici mittoomiinke tolchi'a shiqammake horenaa'n ha'yo aa'ne ciincesinammake seershsha kadowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 4:11" />Yaane kinni goga, maala duuchcha, umo, ha'yonna lukuwwa, madhumatanna godobi giddiira duuchcha, <verse eid="LEV 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 4:12" />Olla'akenaa'n bayyise bululo hunnaaba batto'ebaake boonchiba mare'e haqqe bukki asse'e giira ha'isheexxi gubowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 4:13" />« ‹Isira'eelik ardi haakitik cubbo hujoole, cubbo ittinna arda duuchchanaa'n sho'ondoole, tinninna Duuchchi Woddike Goottike seeruwwanaa'ni mitte sa'atixxe cubbo kaddoole, <verse eid="LEV 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 4:14" />Hujendeexxi cubbo ege'nendeenge hirba'ni ardi cubbo biratee kadaaka mitte jibichcha iyyedagowwaal; isoonna Mageni ulfinnik leellammake duunkaani edo shiqinshowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 4:15" />Ardiinxi hayyoolenna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo, anga insa'nexxa jibichchiinke umo'n hana uggiteexxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo gorraatowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 4:16" />Qeesetiki sooreessi jibichchiinxa munde shiixxoxxa aadheexxi duunkaani giddi'a e'yowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 4:17" />Munde ettene'n qubuchcho cuupha'n Mageni ulfiniki leellamake seemmat giissinemmake fooqike goli edo torbaanele fixowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 4:18" />Iittann shiixxooxxa munde aadheexxi Mageni ulfinniki leellammake duunkaani edo hedheeke hixaaniinke gubemalchike cunnuchuwwa'n issowaal; okkoo'n gatteexxa munde kinni duunkaanibaa e'yatixxe huddume'n tolchimalchi hunda dunowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 4:19" />Ookkoo'n itti aanche'e konne jibichchixxa ha'yo duuchcha aadheexxi tolchimalchoke'n ciincesowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 4:20" />Tolcha konnee muuxati seerinna cubbo biratee shiqinshammaka jibichcha tolchinammake seerishsha kaduun; konne qicinni ardiinxe cubbo'a tolcha tolchinaan; ardikinna cubbo isixxe gattowaalii alfaan. <verse eid="LEV 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 4:21" />Ookkoneechchi udumanna jibichcha olla'akennaa'n bayyiseexxi ifixxe cubo'a shiqishemmaka jibichcha assemashan konneena gubowwaal; kunnina ardiinxa cubbo biraake tolcha kadaan.<verse eid="LEV 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 4:22" />« ‹Cubbo haakitik huje Duuchchi Woddike Goottika ifike Mageniinka seera sa'eeki ardiinke hayyichcha kadoole balleesanjoken. <verse eid="LEV 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 4:23" />Cubbo hujeexxa ege'neenge hirba'n fayyaka recco cubbo biratike tolchchi'a iyyedagowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 4:24" />Anga isixxanna recciinke umi hana ugge, tolchinammake boonchibaa'n middi darre'n ciincatike tolchi'a iyyedangaaka hore gorranammaba Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo gorra'owwaal; kunninna cubbo biraake tolcha kadaan. <verse eid="LEV 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 4:25" />Qeesichchikinna cubbo biratee shiqemmake horixxe munde'n qubichcho cuupha'n tolchimalchinke shooliinge kasike cunichchuwwa'ni issowwaal; gatteexxa munde kinni tolchimalchi hunda dunowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 4:26" />Ha'yo duuchcha tolchimalchi hana ciincesowwaal; konne tolcha tolchchina seeri mittoominke tolchi'a shiqaake horixa ha'yo ciincesamake seerishsha kaduun; konne qicin qeesichchi ardiinke hayyichixe cubbo'a tolcha tolchati cubbo biraan; hayyichchikinna cubbotixxa gattowaal alfaan.<verse eid="LEV 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 4:27" />« ‹Ardi giddii'n mitti manji haakitiki cubo huje Mageniinke seeranaa'ni mitte sa'oole balleesanjoken. <verse eid="LEV 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 4:28" />Cubbo hujeexxa ege'neenge hirba'n fayyaxxa recco cubbo biratike tolchi'a shiqishowaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 4:29" />Anga isixxanna reccotike umo'n uggowaal; tolcha tolchinamma boonchonaa'ni middi darre'n tolchake shiqaaka hore gorranammaba gorra'owwaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 4:30" />Qeesichchikinna reccotixxe munde'ni qubichcho cuupha'n ciincatika tolchimalchiinke shooliinge kasaa'n hedheeke cunnuchchuwa'ni issowwaal; gatteexxa munde tolchimalchi hunda dunowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 4:31" />Mittomiinke tolchi'a shiqammake horixxa ha'yo aa'nammashsha tenne reccoxxanna ha'yo duuchcha bukk asse aadhowwaal; konneke tolchik fooli Mageno gammachiisaake kadaashsha tolchimalchoke'n ciincesowwaal; konne qicini qeesichchi ookkone manjichchixxa cubbo biratika tolcha tolchaan; ookkone manjixxi cubbonna gattowaal hiyyendaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:27-28">Lak. 15:27-28</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LEV 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 4:32" />« ‹Cubbo baratike tolchi'a gedhebiinka tolcha shiqishoole, fayyaxxa gedhechcho shiqishowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 4:33" />Isinna gedhochchotike umi hana anga isixxa uggowwaal; tolcha tolchimalchoke'n middi darre'n ciincatika tolchi'a shiqinshammaka hore gorranammaba gorra'owwaal; <verse eid="LEV 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 4:34" />Qeesichchikinna gedhechchotixxe munde'n qubichcho cuupha'n ciincatika tolcha tolchimalchiinge shooliinge kasa'n hedheeke cunuchchuwa'ni issowwaal; gatteexxa mundenna tolchimalchi hunda dunowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 4:35" />Ookkoneechchi uduma mittoomiinke tolchi'a shiqamma horixxa ha'yo aa'ne bukki assinamashshan tenne gedhechchoxxa ha'yo duuchcha bukki asse aadhowwaal; ha'yotanna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqaake tolchuwwinni welt tolchimalchoke'n ciincesowwaal; konne qicini qeesichchi okkone manjichchi'a cubbo biratika tolcha tolchaan; okkone manjichchixxi cubbonna gattowaal hiyyendaan.<verse eid="LEV 4:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LEV 5" />
  <para style="s1">Cubbotika Tolcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 5:1" />« ‹Manji mitti barra banteessa uudeexxa yookaan laqeexxa yaane murte uunaaba dhugaa fulche kula gophoole cubbote isi'a kaddaan.<verse eid="LEV 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 5:2" />« ‹Huuni manjinna afebaangi batto'eechcho fakkennakee'e biniinchiinka, horiinka yookaan godobiki me'achchik dadaxxa rensha afebaangi tuqoole, konne asseeka dedha ege'neege hirba'n balleessate isi'a kaddaan.<verse eid="LEV 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 5:3" />« ‹Manji mitti wele manjinka batto'eeka shamina ege'nebaangi tuqoole, tuqeexxa ege'neenge hirba'n balleesate isi'a kaddaan.<verse eid="LEV 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 5:4" />« ‹Manji mitti heene yaanenna eloxxanna kadde yo'oxxa assate'e xonxommachcho belo kakatoole isi ege'na belo assoole, ege'neenge hirba'n isi balleesanjo kadaan.<verse eid="LEV 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 5:5" />« ‹Manji mitti tenne yaanuwwanaa'n mitte balleesoole aadde aagowwal. <verse eid="LEV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 5:6" />Hujeexxe cubbo'aana Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolcha iyyedagowwaal; iyyedagaachchina horekenaa'n meyyaxxa gedhechcho yookaan meyyaxxe recco kaddowaal; qeesichchikinna cubbo ookkone manjixxa biraaka tolcha tolchaan.<verse eid="LEV 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 5:7" />« ‹Isi gedhobo yookaan re'e shiqisha dande'a gophoole lame guuggenna yookaan lame shiixxaramma guuggenna, mitte cubbo biratike tolchi'a, langaxxa kinni ciincesatike tolcha kaddaashsha balleesa ifixxee tolcha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a iyyedagowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 5:8" />Isinna iyyedageexxi qeesichchoke'n uwwowwaal; qeesichchikinna mitte gorra'ebaang gooba micciireexxi cubbo biratike tolcha asse tolchowaal; <verse eid="LEV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 5:9" />Mundetenaa'n shiixxoxxa aadheex tolcha tolchimalchike qarqara'ni fixowwaal; gatteexxa munde kinni tolchimalchi hunda dunowwaal; tinninna cubbo biratike tolchan. <verse eid="LEV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 5:10" />Langaxxa guugenjo yookaan shiixxoxxa guugenjo aadheexxi ciincatika tolcha tolchinammake seerishshan ciincesowaal; konne qicin qeesichchi cubbo biratika tolcha tolchaan; balleeseeke manjixxi cubbonna gattowaal hiyyendaan.<verse eid="LEV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 5:11" />« ‹Isi lame guuggenna yookaan lame shiixarama guuggenna shiqisha dande'a gophoole, lame kiilo shaqqinshe danneexxa bulle cubbo isixxa biratike tolcha kaddaashsha shiqishowwaal; kunnina cubbo biratike tolcha kadeemaxxee'e ejeersiinxa zayite yookaan ixaana makoqqe'e. <verse eid="LEV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 5:12" />Bulle eteneenna qeesichchoke'n uwwowwaal; qeesichchi eettene bullenaa'n oobeesse aadheexxi duuchchiinxa Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqqeexxe kaddeexxa qaabachisaate'e shiqaake tolchi hana tolchimalchoke'n ciincesowwaal; kunninna cubbo biraake tolcha kadaan. <verse eid="LEV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 5:13" />Qeesichchikinna konne qicin okkone manjixxe cubboxxe gattowaali'a tolcha shiqishaan; heeni manjixxi cubbonna gattowaal hiyyendaan; gatteexxi bulle kinni midhatixxi uwwa shiqqammashsha qeesichchiinxe kadduun.› »<verse eid="LEV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Balleessate'e Shiqaaka Tolcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 5:14" />Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna Muuse, <verse eid="LEV 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 5:15" />«Manji mitti Magenokee woyyoonsineechcho balleesse cubbo hujoole, Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a muratike tolcha kadaaka hori giddii'n fayyaka labbaka gedhechcho iyyedagowwaal; yookaan ookkone gedhechchika hirikinna galmiinxe kiiloshshanni kaduun. Kunninna muratike tolchan. <verse eid="LEV 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 5:16" />Woyyoonsineecho balleesse cubbo hujemmaxxe cubbo'a uwwiyo hasissamaxxe uwwa'ni onde anga'n mitte lebe qeesichchoke'ninna uwwowaal; qeesichchikinna korbeessa okkonee manjichchiinxe cubbo biratike tolcha asse tolchowwaal; balleessa hujeeke manjixxi cubbonna gattowwaal hiyyendaan.<verse eid="LEV 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 5:17" />«Manji mitti ege'nebaang Duuchchi Woddik Goottike seerinaa'n mitte xe'iyishoole cubbote isi'a kaddaan. <verse eid="LEV 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 5:18" />Horekenaa'n fayyaka gedhechcho balleessa isixxee muratike tolcha asse iyyedagowwaal; hirikinna ege'neme seerishshanni murrowwaal; qeesichchikinna hore okkonee'e manjichcho okkonexxe balleessaa'a tolchcha tolchchowwaal; balleese manjixxi cubbonna gattowaal hiyyendaan. <verse eid="LEV 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 5:19" />Tinninna ikki manji Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n asseexxe balleesa'a cubbitike tolchan» hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LEV 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 6:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Muuse'e hiyyee qic, <verse eid="LEV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 6:2" />«Olla'a ifika sobati anee Duuchchi Woddika Gootta sobaake manjik seer konneechchi butta hedheeken: manji mitti maganeti iso'ni uggudhineechcho yookaan adhemmachi'a abidiseechi'a olla'a ifika soboole, olla'a ifika saamoole, la'o alfatee hiyye olla'a ifika dhiiboole, <verse eid="LEV 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 6:3" />yookaan baxxeexxa yaane afe'e uudebe'no hiyye dhariki kakatoole, yookaan iita hexxeexxe cubbonaa'n mitte hujoole, <verse eid="LEV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 6:4" />konne qicinni cubbo huje balleessanjo kadoole, isi moorechcho yookaan saameechcho yookaan maganne uwwee'neechcho yookaan la'o alfatee olla'a ifika dhiibeexxi yookaan ookkonee ba'ee'naa afeechcho, <verse eid="LEV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 6:5" />Yookaan dhariki kakate adhdheexxa duuchcha onde anga itti lebe karratike anni'a balleesatika tolcha tolchaammaxxa barra hiissowaal. <verse eid="LEV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 6:6" />Isinna balleesatixxe cubbotike tolchi'a hori giddii'n fayyaka gedhechcho yookaan ege'nemeeke seera'ni murreeka gedhechchiinke hirika maallaqa iyyedage Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolchake asse qeesichchoke'n uwwowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 6:7" />Qeesichchikinna okkone manjixxa cubbo biratike tolchi'a Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo tolcha tolchowaal; balleesemmake manjixxi cubbo gattowaal hiyyendaan» hiyye ajaje.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:5-8">Lak. 5:5-8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LEV 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hedheeshshan Ciincesinaaka Tolcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 6:8" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e, <verse eid="LEV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 6:9" />«Aarooni'aanna isixxe labbaxe oose'a uutatoki seeri konnechchi butta hedheeken; tolchimalchoke'n ciincatiki tolchi hashsha duuchcha turaashsha assinee'na giiratinna ha'yita'n galdowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 6:10" />Qeesichchikinna layinoti gonbe giissineeka gonfanna iimii'ni butta geltaaxxa layinotixxa seemma oddo'weexxi ciincatike tolchika bululo bukki asse'e tolchimalchiinke qarqara'ni dunowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 6:11" />Ookkoo'n seemma woldixxa fulchedhe wele oddo'weexxi bululo ookkonee olla'ii gadhdho batto'eebaake booncho'ni dunowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 6:12" />Tolchimalchoke'ni hexxeexxi giira xoxxebaang hashsha barra duuchchi wodda ha'yitowwaal; qeesechchikina gorsa gorsa haqqe itti lebowwaal; giirate'nina ciincatika tolcha giisse uggati mittoomiinke tolchixxa ha'yo ciincesowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 6:13" />Giiratinna xoxxebaang tolchimalchoke'n duuchchi wodda ha'yitowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Midhatixxa Uwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 6:14" />« ‹Midhatixxe uwwa'a muremeek seeruwwi konnechchinn butti'a hedheeken; Aaroonixxe labbaxxe oose giddii'n mitti midhatixxa uwwa tolchimalchi edo Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a midhatika tolcha shiqishowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 6:15" />Ookkoneechchi uduma qeesichchi shaqqinshe danneexxa bulle guunsse, zayitenna ixaanaa aadheexxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqeeke kadeexa qaabachisatike tolchimalchoke'n ciincesowwaal; iitta hexxeexxe ciincaki fooli Mageno gammachchiisaan. <verse eid="LEV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 6:16" />Ciincatenaa'n gatteexa uwwa Aarooninna isixxi labbaxxi oose ittaan; lebele itti lenbebaangi ra'issine woyyoonsine boonno'n Mageni ulfinniki leellammake duunkaaniinxe huddume'ni indaan. <verse eid="LEV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 6:17" />Lebele itti lenbe ra'issinabaan; qeesuwwatike qoobbo kadaashsha uwweenneken; cubbo biratike tolchishshanna balleesatik tolchisha Magenoke shiqqeexxe uwwa kaddemmaxxee'e hara woyyiteten. <verse eid="LEV 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 6:18" />Dagaake baro duuchcha'n Aaroonike miniki labbaki duuchchi Magenokee'e shiqqeexxe uwwanaa'n isi'a uwwemeeka qoobbo ita dande'aani; midhatixxi uwwa Magenokee'e uwwendeexxe kaddemmaxxee weli ise tuqaaki duuchchi woyyoomaan› » hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeessetik Sooressi Hariiremaa Wodda Uwwendaaxxa Midhatixxa Uwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 6:19" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e, <verse eid="LEV 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 6:20" />«Aarooninna isixxe labbaxxe oosenaa'n qeesetika sooreessa kadaak hariiremaa baro lame kiilo shaqqinshe danneexxa bulle barra barra'n shiqqammaxxe midhatixxe uwwaxxa qixxe Magenoke tolchake kaddaashsha iyyedagowwaal; bulle ettenee gamisa gorssa, gamisa galgala shiqishowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 6:21" />Zayiteti welti mankeexi midhatike tolchishsha she'late'n ra'issineechchin udumi'a Duuchchi Woddike Gootta gammachchiisaaxxe midhatixxe uwwa kedde shiqqowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 6:22" />Qeesichcho Aaroonixxe labbaaxxe oose giddii'n qeesetike sooreessa kade'e hariiremaak duuchchi konne seera muuxowaal; Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqeeke tolcha kademmaxxe'e mittikinna gatebaangi ciinceesemowwaali. <verse eid="LEV 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 6:23" />Qeesichchi shiqishaaxxa midhatixxa uwwa mittetanna indebaang duuchchiinxa ciincesendowaal» hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cubbotixxe Gattowaali'a Shiqaaka Tolcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 6:24" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e, <verse eid="LEV 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 6:25" />«Aarooni'ninna isixxe oose'n, ‹cubbotike tolchiki seeri, cubbo biratee tolchino'a shiqinshaaka hore ciinceesatike tolchi'a hore dullammaba tolcha tolchinamma middi darre'n gorraanowwaal. Isinna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqeeke hori giddii'n mitteke kademmaxxee hara woyyichchaken. <verse eid="LEV 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 6:26" />Horekanna tolchaaki qeesichchi Mageni ulfinniki leellammake duunkaaniinxe huddume'ni woyyichcha boonchcho'n tolchchake shiqemmake horika maala itowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 6:27" />Manjokenna kadi welichchi Magenokee shiqeeka ookkonee maala tuqoole woyyomaan; okkone horixxi munde heene seemmanna tuqqoole, seemma eettene woyyite bakka'n anshinowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 6:28" />Hooneenna maali gafemeeka faariinka miya butuchchinowwaal; Maali gafemeeki sageetotike miya kadoole soonfe ringeexxi wodi'iki anshinowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 6:29" />Qeesichchiinxi labbaxxi oose konne tolchiinka maala ittowwaal; isinna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqeeke tolcha kademmaxxee hara woyyichchaken. <verse eid="LEV 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 6:30" />Cubbo biratike seeri'a munde ookkone horixxi duunkaani giddi'a woyyitte bakka'n e'yitoole maala ookkone ita hassissabaan; duuchchinga giirate'n ciinceesinowwaal› hite kuli» hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LEV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Balleessa Biratika Tolcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 7:1" />« ‹Seera duuchchanaa'ni hara woyyichcha kadeeki giddii'n mitte kade balleessa biraree shiqaak konneechchin butti'a hedheeken: <verse eid="LEV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 7:2" />Tolchakee shiqeeka hore ciinceesatike tolchi'a shiqinshammaka hore gorraanammaba gorranowaal; mundetanna tolchimalchiinke shooliinge kasa'n fixowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 7:3" />Ha'yo duuchcha: duba, godobi giddira buqammaka mooro'o, <verse eid="LEV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 7:4" />Lame kalattuwwa, tenne kalatuwwa hananna ciinachuwwiinke qarqara'n hedheeke mooro'o, iittan tidhoti hana hedheeka saapha kalatuwwati welti fulchowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 7:5" />Tolchimalchoke'n hexxeexa ha'yo duuchcha qeesichchi Magenokee uwwendeexxe uwwa asseexxi giirate'ni ciinceesowwaal; isenna balleessatee shiqaake tolchan. <verse eid="LEV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 7:6" />Qeesetixxi labbaxi oose tolchiinka maala ittowwaal; tolchi ikki Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a hara woyyoome shiqeeke tolchanaa'n mitteke kademmaxxe'e hara woyyichchaken; tennexxee woyyicha booncho'n itowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 7:7" />« ‹Cubbo biratikinna balleessatike tolchi'a hujaaki seeri mitteken; tolchake shiqemmake horika maalanna cubbo biratika tolcha shiqishemmake qeesichchi'a uunaan; <verse eid="LEV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 7:8" />Ciincatike tolchi'a shiqemmake horika goga tolcha tolchemmake qeesichchi'a uunaan; <verse eid="LEV 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 7:9" />Giirate'n ra'issineexxe midhaxxi uwwa duuchcha, yookaan odolchote'n yookaan she'late'n ra'issineeka tolcha tolchemmake qeesichchiken; <verse eid="LEV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 7:10" />Yaane kinni duuchchiinxi raxxebaaxxi midhatixi uwwa zayiteti makendeexxe kadi makendebaaxxi Aaroonike minixxe qeese kaddemmaxxi duuchcha qixxe qoodendowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mittomiinka Tolcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 7:11" />« ‹Magenoke shiqaake mittomiinke tolchiki seeri, <verse eid="LEV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 7:12" />Manji mitti tenne uwwa Magenokee galatiinke tolcha asse shiqisho'a hasoole, tolchiinke horinni welti gamami e'yebaaxa zayiteti manke ra'issineexxa kebbo: zayite manke furdinse ra'isineexxa yookaan hephphinse ra'isine, zayite itti burreexxa yookaan shaqqinshe danneexxa bulle zayiteti manke ra'issineexxa kebbo shiqishowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 7:13" />Galatakee'e shiqishammake mittomiinke tolcha'ni lebe uwwate kaddaaxxa lebele manke ra'issineexxa kebbo shiqishowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 7:14" />Bifa bifanni shiqqeexxe kebbonaa'ni mitte mitte aadhe'e, Magenoke foyendeexxe uwwa asse shiqishaan; itti uwwanna horiinxa munde aadhe tolchinke boonchike kasa'ni mittomiinke tolcha asse fixeeke qeesichchi'a qoobboke kadduuni; <verse eid="LEV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 7:15" />Mittominke galati'a shiqeeke tolchemeeke horiki maali ettene tolchememmaxxe barra'n inde birrowaal; gate galaachchi hedhoqqen.<verse eid="LEV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 7:16" />« ‹Manji mitti shiqisha'neeki werregee'na muuxendeexe yaane'a yookaan eeyyantetixxe uwwa kaddoole duuchchingeechcho eettene shiqqeenxe barra'n indowwaal; gateekinna hedhoole langa baro indowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 7:17" />Ooko'n tolchink maali sakkaxxe barra qico'ni tureeka giirate'ni gunbowaal; <verse eid="LEV 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 7:18" />Sakka baro geyeeka mittoominke tolchika maala ayyinna itoole, iteeke manjika tolcha Mageni adhdhabaan. Tolchikinna adhdhemeeshsha laakko'emabaan; matanga batto'eeshsha laakko'emaan; okkone maalanna iteeki manji cubbote isi'a kaddaanni. <verse eid="LEV 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 7:19" />Tolchiinka maala battitte yaane tuqqeexxe kaddoole giirati gunbo malee itiyyo hasissabaan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 7:19">« ‹Aada tolchiinxe'n battitte yaane tuqebaaki manji batto'ebaaka maala itowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 7:20" />Tolchiinxe aada'n battumma bidhdhebaa manji konne Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqaake mittoomiinke tolchika maala itoole Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ardi giddii'n fulowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 7:21" />Ayyinna batto'oole Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqeeka mittoomiinke tolchika maala itoole iikki manji ifike ardi giddii'n fulowwaal› » hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mundenna Mooro'o Indabaaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 7:22" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse'e, <verse eid="LEV 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 7:23" />«Isira'eelitote hitatoqic: ‹Laliinka, gedhebiinkanna re'etika mooro'o itaaki hedhoqqen; <verse eid="LEV 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 7:24" />Reyeeke yookaani biniinchi shiyeeke horika mooro'o wele huje'a hoso malee ayyinna itoqqen. <verse eid="LEV 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 7:25" />Ciincatike tolcha kade Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqeeke horika mooro'o itaaki manji ifike ardi giddii'n fulowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 7:26" />Iittan kinni habanna hedhaaki Isira'eeliki manji booncho duuchcha'ni ci'atixxe kado horiinxa munde itoqqen; <verse eid="LEV 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 7:27" />Ayyinna munde itaaki manji duuchchi ifike ardi giddii'n fulowaal hite Isira'eelike arda'ni kuli› » hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeesichchokee'e Uwwemaaka Qoobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 7:28" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse'e: <verse eid="LEV 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 7:29" />«Isira'eelike ardi'a ayyinna mittoomiinka tolcha shiqishoole isonaa'ninni hanii'ni aadhe Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a gargariti hexxeexxe uwwa asse iyyedagowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 7:30" />Iikkin manji ciincatike tolcha asse Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqishowwaal; hore okkonka mooro'o, corme mitteba lele'misatike tolcha asse Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqishowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 7:31" />Qeesichchikinna ha'yo tolchimalchoke'n ciinceesowwaal; corme kinni Aarooni'aanna labbaxxe isixxe oose'a uwwendeexxen; <verse eid="LEV 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 7:32" />Mittoomiinke tolchi'a tolchememmake horixxi middixxa luka qeesichchoke'e uwwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 7:33" />Mittoomiinke tolchixxa mundenna mooro'o tolchemmake Aaroonixxe labbaxxe oose giddii'n middixxa luka adhowaal. <verse eid="LEV 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 7:34" />Ani mittoomike Isira'eeliki ardi tolchanaa'n coreme lele'misatixxi luka iimi'a ke'isee aadheexxi duuchchi wodda qoobo insa'neke kadaashsha qeesichcho Aarooni'aanna isixxe labbaxxe oose'a uwweenen. Kunni duuchchi woddike galdumiinke seeran. <verse eid="LEV 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 7:35" />Kunninna Mageni Aarooniinna oose isixxa labbaxxa oose qeese asseexxi hariireexxa barra Magenokee shiqaake ciincatike tolchanaa'ni qoobbo insa'neeke kade gargari fule'eken; <verse eid="LEV 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 7:36" />Eettene Hariiremeexxe barra'ni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti cormetanna middixa luka Isira'eeliki ardi qeesuwwatee uwwaashsha ajaje'een; tinnina okkonchinni kayyi'a qeesuwwatike duchchi woddike qoobbo kadaashsha asse'een hite Isira'eelike arda'ni kuli» hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 7:37" />Yoona ciincatika tolcha, midhatixxa uwwa, cubbo biratika tolcha, balleessa biratike tolcha, qeesuwwa hariirtetika tolchanna mittoomiinka tolcha muunxaake seeriki ajajuwwi konneten. <verse eid="LEV 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 7:38" />Ookkonna Siinaxxe kooba'ni qiilla gammooje'ni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse'ni konne seera uwweexxa barra Isira'eeliki ardi tolcha shiqishaashsha ajaje.<verse eid="LEV 7:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LEV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Aaroonixxanna Oose Isixxixxa Hariirensha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 29:1-37">Fula. 29:1-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 8:1" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse'e; <verse eid="LEV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 8:2" />«Aarooniinna Aaroonixxa labaaxxa oose, iittani qeetixxa seemma, hariirtaaxxa zayite, cubbo biratika jibichcha, lame gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, gamami tuqebaaxxa kebbo qorete'ni uggite iyyedagi; <verse eid="LEV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 8:3" />Okkoo'ni Isira'eelika arda ani ulfinniki leellammake duunkaanibaa e'yatixxe huddumme edo bukki assi.»<verse eid="LEV 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 8:4" />Muusenna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti isoo ajajemmashshanni asseen; ardikinna duunkaanibaa e'yatixxe huddumme edo bukki hiyye. <verse eid="LEV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 8:5" />Muusenna bukki hiyyeka arda «Tinni ta'a assaannexxi yaane Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ha'no assitinaashsha ajajeexxen» hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 8:6" />Muusenna Aarooniinna Aaroonixxa labbaxxa oose isiba'a shiqqishshe wodi'iki anshe. <verse eid="LEV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 8:7" />Aarooni'ni qeesetixxa seemma iimii'ni butta geltaaxxa oddeesse sabbatik usure, higgeeni iimi'ni butta geltaaxxa harumaaxxa seema lebe oddeesse, itti hana landetishsha oddo'winaachcho efuudite hinaachcho angatixxa oge muxxe'ek manni seesse giisse'eke sabbatinn usure; <verse eid="LEV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 8:8" />Efuudite'ni qomatibaa kiise gobeexxi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Urminna tumii'i uuddaaxxenni laakkossa saddeeta iittanni efuude uuddaaxxenni Fula. Haf. 29 uudendowwaal. Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa fedhii ege'naachcho Uriiminna Tumiimi hiyyemaachcho giddo ugge.</char></note> <verse eid="LEV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 8:9" />Umoke'ninna ruufa usurreexxi ise'ni hana Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse ajajemmashshanni Magenoke foyematika beessisa worqeti seense giissineeka kallachcha ugge.<verse eid="LEV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 8:10" />Okkoo'ninna Muuse hariirtetixxa zayite aadheexxi Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ulfinniki leellammaka seemmati giissinemmake fooqa'ninna isi giddo hedheechcho duuchcha'ni isse; konne qicinni duuchchingechcho Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe huje'a woyyonse. <verse eid="LEV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 8:11" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe hariirammaxxe zayitenaa'ni shiixxoxxa aadheexxi tolchimalchoke'ninna torbaanele fixe; ookko'ninna tolchimalchoke'ninna isike miyuwwa duuchcha'ni anga anshshe'nammaxxe qore'ninna qore ettene ugginammaka ofo'lisanjo Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a woyyonsatee hariire. <verse eid="LEV 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 8:12" />Aaroonike umo'ninna hariirtetixxa zayite cosse hariireexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottixe huje'a woyyonse qeesoonse. <verse eid="LEV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 8:13" />Okkoo'ni, Muusenna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ajajemmashshani Aaroonixxa labbaxxa oose edo sa'isse qeesumummatixxa seemma oddeesse; hidha insa'neeke'nina sabbata ka'lishe umoke'ninna ruufa ugge.<verse eid="LEV 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 8:14" />Okkonechchi uduma Muusenna cubbo biratike tolchchi'a jibichcha idage; Aarooninna labbaxxi oose isixxi jibichchiinke umo'ni hana anga isa'neexxa uggine; <verse eid="LEV 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 8:15" />Muusenna jibichcha ookkone gorra'e; qubichcho mundete'ni cuupheexxi tolchimalchiinke shooliinge kasa'ni hedheeke cunnichchuwwa'ni isseexxi gargari hedheeke booncho asse foye; ookkoo'ni gatteexxa munde tolchimalchi hunda dune; konne qicini tolchimalchiinxa cubbo biratika tolcha shiqisheexxi ookkonnee tolchimalcho woyyoonse; <verse eid="LEV 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 8:16" />Muusenna hore okkoneka godobi giddira buqammaka mooro'o duuchcha, tidhoti saapha, Lame kalattuwwa'ninna hedheeka mooro'o tolchimalchoke'n ciinceesse. <verse eid="LEV 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 8:17" />Jibichiinka goga, wele gateeka maalanna godobi giddiira aadheexxi, Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse'e ajajemmashshani olla'akenaa'ni bayyise gube.<verse eid="LEV 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 8:18" />Ookkonchi uduma Muuse ciincatike tolchi'a gedhebiinka korbeessa idage; Aarooninna labbaxi oose isixxi korbeesiinke umo'ni hana anga insa'neexxa uggite; <verse eid="LEV 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 8:19" />Muusenna korbeessa okkone gorra'e; mundetanna tolchimalchiinke shooliinge kasa'ni dune; <verse eid="LEV 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 8:20" />Korbeesiinka maalanna mikita mikitake'ni woxe fulcheexxi; mikitemmaka maala, Muusenna umo isikanna mooro'o ciinceesse. <verse eid="LEV 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 8:21" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ajajemmashshanni Muuse korbeesiinka godobi giddiranna manne ansheexxi ittan maaliki welti tolchimalcho'n ciincatike tolcha ciinceesse; kunni foolinna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachchiisaaken.<verse eid="LEV 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 8:22" />Muusenna higgeeni qeesonsatee shiqammaka langaka labbaka gedhebiinka korbeessa idage; Aarooninna labbaxi oose isixxi anga insa'neexxa gedhechchoke'ni hana uggine; <verse eid="LEV 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 8:23" />Muusenna korbeessa gorra'eexxi mundetenaa'ni aadhe Aaroonixxa middixxe manshake hundi darreke kasa'ni, middixxe angake abuguddo'ninna middixxe lekkake abuguddo'ni isse; <verse eid="LEV 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 8:24" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Aaroonixxa labbaxa oose edo shiqisheexxi middixxe manshake hundi darreke kasa'ni, middixxe angake abuguddo'ninna middixe lekkake abuguddo'ni Muusenna munde isse; gatteexxa mundenna tolchimalchiinke shooliinge kasa'ni dune. <verse eid="LEV 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 8:25" />Ha'yo, duba, godobi giddira buqammaka mooro'o duuchcha, tidhoti saapha, lame kalattuwwa'ni hedhemmaka mooro'onna middixxa luka aadhe; <verse eid="LEV 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 8:26" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo hexxeexxe qorenaa'ni gamami tuqebaaxxa mitte kebbo aadhe; zayite qushshine ra'iseneexxa kebbonna mitte hephphaka xalta adheexxi mooro'onna middixxe lukake maala'ni hana ugge; <verse eid="LEV 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 8:27" />Tenne ita duuchcha aadheexxi Aarooni'ninna isixxe labbaxxe oose'ni anga, anga uwwe; isne'nenna tenne ita Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a lele'misatike tolcha assine shiqinshe. <verse eid="LEV 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 8:28" />Ookkonchi uduma Muuse ita eettene insa'nenaa'ni aadhe; qeesonsatixxe hariirteka tolcha kadaashsha ciincatika tolchi ciinceeseemmamake tolchimalcho'n hana uggeexxi ciinceesse; kunninna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachchiisaake itatike tolchammani. <verse eid="LEV 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 8:29" />Okkoo'ninna Muuse corme aadheexxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a lele'misatike tolcha asse shiqishe; tinni qeesonsatixxe hariirte'a shiqemmake korbeesixxi corme Muuseke qoobbomman. Muusenna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ajajemmashshani duuchchinxa yaane asse.<verse eid="LEV 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 8:30" />Muusenna hariirtetixxe zayitenaa'ninna tolchimalchoke'n hexxemmaxxe mundenaa'ni shiixxoxxa aadheexxi Aarooni'ninna isixxe seemma'ni iittani Aaroonixxe labbaxxe oose'ninna isnsa'neexxe seemma duuchcha'ni fixe; konne qicini Muuse insa'neenna seemma insa'neexxa Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a woyyoonse.<verse eid="LEV 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 8:31" />Muuse, Aarooniinna labbaxxa isixxa oose hiyyee qici, «Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ulfinniki leellammake duunkaaniinxe e'yatixxe hudume edo maala gaffe; Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ‹Aaroninna oose isixxi labbaxi ittuuni› hiyye ajajemmashshani qeesonsatixxe hariirteke tolchixxe qore'ni hexxeexxe kebbonni welti itte. <verse eid="LEV 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 8:32" />Ittinee'na gatteeka maalanna kebbo giirate'ni gubbe; <verse eid="LEV 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 8:33" />Ha'no qeesonsatik seeri muuxematee'e torbaane barra adhdhaammaxxe barra itti muddaa qico'ni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ulfinniki leellammake duunkaaniinxe e'yatixxe hudumenaa'ni kexxinabaan. <verse eid="LEV 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 8:34" />Kunni telcha assineenneki cubbo ha'nooxxa biratike tolchiki seeri Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti muunxannoshsha ajajeeken; <verse eid="LEV 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 8:35" />Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ajajemmaxxa duuchcha muuxxina'ni torbaane barranna torbaane hashsha Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ulfinniki leellammake duunikaaniinxe e'yatixxe huddume'ni turtinaani; tenneenna assa gophinoole reya rertinaani; kunni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee ajajeeke seeran» hiyye. <verse eid="LEV 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 8:36" />Tennexxee Aarooninna labbaxxi isixxi oose, Muuse darree'ni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ajajeexxa duuchcha muunxe.<verse eid="LEV 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LEV 9" />
  <para style="s1">Aarooni Magenoke Shiqisheeka Tolcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 9:1" />Qeesonsatixxe saddeeteeso baro Muuse Aarooniinna oose isixxa iittani Isira'eelixxa akekanoole ye'e; <verse eid="LEV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 9:2" />Isinna Aarooni'i «Batte afebaaka jibichanna labba gedhechcho aaxxe, jibichcha cubbotixxe biraa'a shiqaake tolcha, gedhechokanna ciincatike tolcha assite Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqishi. <verse eid="LEV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 9:3" />Okkonechchi uduma Isira'eeliki ardi cubbo biratike tolchi'a kadaaka labbaka recco, ciincatike tolchi'a kadaaka batto'ebaaka wogga mitteka jabbichchanna wogga mitteka gedhebiika buruusa shiqishaashsha kuli. <verse eid="LEV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 9:4" />Iittanni mittuntetike tolchi'a kadaaka mitte jibichchanna mitte gedhebiinka buruusa idangowwaali; insa'neena zayiteti qushsheneeke midhatike tolchini welti Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolchake assine shiqinshowaal; telcho Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti insa'ne'ni leellaammaxxee konnechcho duuchcha assinowaal» hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 9:5" />Insa'nenna Muuse ajajemmachcho duuchcha duunkaani edi'a iyyedange; ardi duuchchinna Duuchchi Woddike Goottiba'a shikki hiyye uurreen. <verse eid="LEV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 9:6" />Muusenna insa'nee'e «Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ulfinni isikinni ha'no'a leellammaxxee; tenne duuchcha assitino'a Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ha'noo ajaje'eeni» hiyye. <verse eid="LEV 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 9:7" />Okkonechchi uduma Muuse Aaroonii'i «Tolchimalchiiba shikki hite atixxanna ardiinxa cubbo biratee shiqaaka tolchanna ciincatika tolcha shiqishi; konne tolcha duuchcha ardiinxa cubbo biratee Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ajajemmake seerishshanni tolcha tolchi» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:27">Ibr. 7:27</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 9:8" />Aarooninna tolchimalchiba mareexxi edise isixxa cubbo birate shiqaaka jibichcha gorra'e; <verse eid="LEV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 9:9" />Oose isixinna munde isibaa iyyedagge; isinna mundete'ni qubichchiki cuuphpha'ni tolchimalchoke'ni hedheeke cunnuchchuwwa'ni isse; gatteexxa munde tolchimalchii hunda dune; <verse eid="LEV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 9:10" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse ajajemmashshani Aarooni mooro'o, lame kalattuwa arrabinxa tidho tolchimalchoke'n ciinceesseen; <verse eid="LEV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 9:11" />Maalakanna goga kinni okkone olla'i gadho bayyise gube.<verse eid="LEV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 9:12" />Ciincatike tolchi'a shiqaaka hore gorra'e; oose isixxinna munde isibaa iyyedagge; isinna munde eettene tolchimalchiinke shooliinge kasa'ni dune. <verse eid="LEV 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 9:13" />Umokanna wele maala mikinte mikinte isiba idange; Aarooninna duuchchinga maala tolchimalchoke'n ciinceesse. <verse eid="LEV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 9:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma godobi giddiranna lukuwwa ansheexxi ciincatike tolchin booncho'ni ciinco'a'neke tolchi hana ugge ciinceesse.<verse eid="LEV 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 9:15" />Ookkoneechchi uduma qeesichchi ardiinxa uwwa shiqishe; ardiinxa cubbo biratike tolchi'a shiqemmaka labbaka recco aadhe gorra'e; isoonna ifixxa cubbo biratee tolchemmake tolchishshan tolche. <verse eid="LEV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 9:16" />Ciincatike tolchi'a tolchemmaka hore idage seera tolchiinke seerishshanni tolche. <verse eid="LEV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 9:17" />Midhatixxa uwwa shiqishe; bulletenaa'ni mitte qeerro aadheexxi tolchimalchoke'ni ciinceesse; kunninna gorsa gorsa shiqammake ciincatike tolcha'ni lebemeeke hiyyoten. <verse eid="LEV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 9:18" />Ookkonee jibichchakanna ookkonee labbaka gedhechcho gorra'eexxi ardiinke mittoomiinke tolcha asse shiqishe; oose isixxinna munde isibaa iyyedagge. Isinna munde eettene aadheexxi tolchimalchiinke shooliinge kasa'ni dune.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 3:1-11">Lew. 3:1-11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 9:19" />Aaroonixxi labbaxxi oose jibichchiinxanna gedhechchiinxa ha'yo dubatanna, godobi giddiira buqaka mooro'o, lame kalattuwwanna arabiinxa tidho aaxxeexxi, <verse eid="LEV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 9:20" />Tolchemeeke horixxe cormme hana uggite; Aarooninna mooro'o tolchimalchoke'n ciinceesse; <verse eid="LEV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 9:21" />Muuse ajajemmashshanni cormmetanna middixxa luka Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a lele'misatike tolcha asse shiqishe.<verse eid="LEV 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 9:22" />Aarooninna cubbo biratika tolcha, ciincatika tolchanna mittoominka tolcha shiqisheechchi uduma, anga isixxa ardiinba diriirisse eebbise tolchiinke boonchinaa'ni dirre.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:22-26">Lak. 6:22-26</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LEV 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 9:23" />Muusenna Aarooni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ulfinniki leellammake duunkaani giddi'a e'yine; fullaa woddanna arda eebbinse; Duuchchi Woddike Goottiiki ulfinninna arda duuchcha'ni leelle; <verse eid="LEV 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 9:24" />Dedhanga Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ergeexxi giira tolchimalchoke'ni hedhemaka tolchanna mooro'o duuchcha itte; ardikinna tenne uude wodda ilili hiyye albiki buttina tuqa qico'ni heeshshi hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 9:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LEV 10" />
  <para style="s1">Naadabinna Abihu Hunjeexa Cubbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 10:1" />Naadabinna Abihute hinaaxxi lame Aaroonixxi labbaxxi oose umo umo insa'nenge'ni mitte mitte balcho aaxxeexxi kashilo itti hana uggite; iso'ni hana ixaana uggiteexxi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti'a shiqishshe; iitta shiqinshaashsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ajaja gopheemmaxxee itti balchoke'ni aa'ne shiqinsheexxi giira seerinxemmabaan; <verse eid="LEV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 10:2" />Tennenaa'ni kexxeexxa dedhanga Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ergeexxi giira insa'ne ittee'na Duuchchi Woddik Gootti edo renne.<verse eid="LEV 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 10:3" />Muusenna Aaroonii'i hiyyee qici, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LEV 10:3">‹Ani edo shiqe ani'a ergatemaake duuchcha'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LEV 10:3">woyyumma anxa leellishanon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LEV 10:3">Arda duuchcha'ninna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LEV 10:3">ani ulfeessemannon› hiyye haaso'eek konneten» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LEV 10:3">Aarooninna cuqqi hiyyebaan.<verse eid="LEV 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 10:4" />Muusenna Uzi'eeli hinaake Aaroonike annike dayyixxa labbaxxxa oose Misha'eeliinna Elitsafanii'i ye'eexxi «Amme konne anni ha'nookike dayyixxe ooseka rensha Mageni ulfinniki leellammake seemmati giissineeke fooqixxe hulabaa'n hoyyitine olla'a konnenaa'ni bayyise» hiyye. <verse eid="LEV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 10:5" />Insa'nenna qeesummatixxa seema renshakenaa'ni fulchinebaangi Muuse ajajemmashshani okkone olla'ibaa'n fulchine.<verse eid="LEV 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 10:6" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Muuse Aaroonii'i, iittani Ali'aazaaritenna Itamaari hiyyendaaxxa lamiinxa Aroonxa oose «Yaadine umo haaxxitinoqen; seemmatanna dartinoqqen; iitta assitinoole kinni reya rertinaan; Magenikinna ardake'ni mufatee'na yo'oxxi daggaan; yaane kinni dayyuwwi ha'nooki Isira'eeliki manni Mageni ergeexxe giirani itemeeke manni'a oodha dandeetinaan. <verse eid="LEV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 10:7" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootti ajajeexxe hariirtetixxe zayiteni hariirendine Magenoke gargar foyendinemmaxxe Mageni ulfinni leellammake duunkaaniinxe e'yatixxe huddumenaa'ni kexxine me'itinoqe'e; kexxine me'itinoole reya rertinaan» hiyye; insa'nena Muuse ajajeeshshani kande.<verse eid="LEV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeesoletika Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 10:8" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Aarooni'i <verse eid="LEV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 10:9" />«Atinna atixxi oose woyinetika bulbulo yookaan wele machchositaaxxa ha'wa ha'witine Mageni ulfinni leellammake duunkaani giddi'a e'yitinoqee heqqedhdhe; ha'witine e'yitinoole rertinaan; kunni seerinna ha'noba uduma ila ha'nooxxe duuchcha'ni heqqemiyyo hasissaan. <verse eid="LEV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 10:10" />Ha'nonna Magenokee woyyoomekenna woyyomebaakixxe oddo'ni, iittani batto'ebaakixxenna batto'eekixxe oddo'ni hexxexxa gargarunte ege'niyyo hasissaan; <verse eid="LEV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 10:11" />Ani Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muusexxe anga'ni uwwenneka seera anka Isira'eelike arda duuchcha'ni barsiisse» hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 10:12" />Muuse Aarooniinna lame Aaroonixxa oose Ali'aazaarinna Itamaari, «Magenoke shiqee'na gateeke cincatike midhatike tolchanaa'ni bulle aaxxinne gamami makemebaaxxa kebbo ra'isse; isenna Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'a hara woyyittete kaddemmaxxee tolchimalchi bira itte. <verse eid="LEV 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 10:13" />Magenoke shiqaake ciincatike midhatike tolchinaa'ni ati'aanna oose atixxe uwwemeeke qoobbo kademmaxxee woyyitte bakka'ni itte. Tenne assitinaashsha Mageni anee ajaje'een.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:14-18">Lew. 6:14-18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 10:14" />Yaane kinni lele'miisatixxa cormenna iimi'a ke'isineexxa luka atixxi labbaxxinna meyyaaxxi oose ca'ichcha booncho'n itte; tinninna Isira'eeliki ardi shiqishaake mittumatike tolcha kadeemmaxxe'e kunte fulchinaaki atikenna atixxe ooseke qoobbon. <verse eid="LEV 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 10:15" />Mooro'i Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a itatike tolcha kade shiqqaa wodda lukanna cormme lele'misatike tolcha assine idangaani; kunni duuchchinna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ajajemmashani ati'aanna atixxe oose'a duuchchi woddi'a uwwemeeke qoobbo kade hedhaani» hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 10:16" />Muuse cubbo biratike tolchi'a shiqeemmaka recco hitta assineexxa qore ciinceesineexxa afe; tennexxee Muuse gatteexxa Aaroonixxa labbaxxa oose'ni Ali'aazaari'ninna Itamaari'ni mufataashsha assitemmaxxee'e, <verse eid="LEV 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 10:17" />«Cubbo biratee shiqeemmaka tolchcha mayee woyyitte bakka'ni itagophphine? Isi Duuchchi Woddikie Gootti'a hara woyyomeeki giddii'n mitteke kadeemmaxxe'e; isoonna Mageni ardinxa cubbo gattowwaali hiyyatee ha'no'a uwwe'eken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:24-26">Lew. 6:24-26</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 10:18" />Eegi munde Mageni ulfinniki leellammake seemmati giissineeke fooqi giddi'a e'ya gophpheechchini ani ha'noo ajajeneshshani shiqeeka tolcha eettene woyyitte bakka'nini ittinamman» hiyye. <verse eid="LEV 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 10:19" />Aarooninna «Sila adana cubbo biratee shiqeeka tolcha iteennele Mageni gammadaamma? Telchonna ardi cubbo biratee shiqaaka tolchanna ciincatika tolcha iyyedage'een; yaane kinni fuggoxxi ane'ni gelte gatte» hiyye hiisse. <verse eid="LEV 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 10:20" />Muusenna Aaroonika hiissichcho laqe gammade.<verse eid="LEV 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LEV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Indaaka Biniincha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 14:3-21">Fula. 14:3-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 11:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muusenna Aaroonii'i, <verse eid="LEV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 11:2" />«Isira'eeliki ardi: ‹Buttate'ni hedheeke biniinchuwwanaa'ninna horuwwanaa'ni itaaki: <verse eid="LEV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 11:3" />Faana darendeekanna hoone alalchaaka hore ita dandeetinaan.<verse eid="LEV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 11:4" />« ‹Yaane kinni alalchaakenaa'ni yookaan faana darendeekenaa'ni ittinabaake hedheeni; Gaali alalchaani; yaane kinni faana darema gopheemaxxee'e batto'eeken. <verse eid="LEV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 11:5" />Osole alalchitaan; yaane kinni faana darema gophphemmaxxee battooteexen. <verse eid="LEV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 11:6" />Hilleensi alalchaani; yaane kinni faana darema gophemaxxee ha'no'a batto'eeken. <verse eid="LEV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 11:7" />Booyyetanna ittinoqen; faana darendeexxe kaddolenna alalcha gophphammaxee battooteexxen. <verse eid="LEV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 11:8" />Kunni biniinchuwwi batto'eeke kademmaxxee ittinoqen; rensha insa'neekanna tuqqinoqen.<verse eid="LEV 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 11:9" />« ‹Abbaayate'ninna laguwwi giddo hexxaaxxa keelanna hommorcha goga affeexa qulxu'muwwa duuchcha itte; <verse eid="LEV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 11:10" />Yaane kinni wodi'i giddo hedhe keelanna hommorcha goga afebaachcho duuchcha itiyyo hasissabaan. <verse eid="LEV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 11:11" />Iitta hedheeki biniinchuwwi batto'eeke kademmaxxee ita waalini rensha isika tuqiyyo hasissabaan. <verse eid="LEV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 11:12" />Tennexxee wodi'i giddo hexxaaxxi keelanna hommorcha goga affebaaxxi dada duuchcha ha'no'a batto'eechchon.<verse eid="LEV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 11:13" />« ‹Ci'atixxe sannenaa'ni battoteexxi ha'no ittinabaaxxiri: risa, qulxu'me ittammaxxa allaate, rumichcha, <verse eid="LEV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 11:14" />Jole, jajjo, <verse eid="LEV 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 11:15" />Gargar hedheeka qoodhanduwwa, <verse eid="LEV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 11:16" />Baalguda, haanqa, qonga, daakiyyuwwa, <verse eid="LEV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 11:17" />Urungo, huummo, tuntichcha, <verse eid="LEV 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 11:18" />Daatto, sinbira, horiinxa beltanna itammaka risa, <verse eid="LEV 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 11:19" />Hageyyoole, golalooxa, Joluwwa, cirrichcho.<verse eid="LEV 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 11:20" />« ‹Keela affe lekkati me'itaaxxi shiixxaramma dada duuchcha battooteexxen; <verse eid="LEV 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 11:21" />Yaane kinni insa'ne giddii'ni shoole lekkanna keela affeexxi qeerraxxanna mikita afe xoggaachchuwwa ittinaani; <verse eid="LEV 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 11:22" />Itinaachchuwwinna gargar gargar hedheeka awwaneessuwwanna gargar gargar hedheeka koro'miisuwwa, gargar gargar hedheeka magenii fadhachcho; <verse eid="LEV 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 11:23" />Yaane kinni wele shiixxarra dada keelanna shoole lekka affeexxi battoteexxen.<verse eid="LEV 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 11:24" />« ‹Koneechchinni butti'a hedheeke biniinchika rensha tuqaaki galgali qico'ni batto'aani; <verse eid="LEV 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 11:25" />Insa'neeka renshanna fulche hunatee tuqaaki seemma borcedhowwaal; galgali qico'ninna batto'eeke kadowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 11:26" />Faana darendebaakinna alalchabaaki horinna biniinchi duuchchi ha'no'a batto'eeken; isoonna tuqaaki duuchchi batto'aani; <verse eid="LEV 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 11:27" />Shoole lekkani me'aake biniinchanaa'ni ba'linchiki me'aaki ha'no'a batto'eeken; isika renshanna tuqaaki galgali qico'ni batto'aan; <verse eid="LEV 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 11:28" />Rensha isikanna fulche hunaaki seemma isixxa borcedhowwaal; isinna galgali qico'ni batto'aani; biniinchuwwi ikki ha'no'a batto'eeken.<verse eid="LEV 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 11:29" />« ‹Buttate'ni le'mitaaxxe dadanaa'ni konnechchini butti'a hexxeexxi battoteexxen; tuqi, lama'i, gargar hexxeexxa dadda'le, <verse eid="LEV 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 11:30" />Naachchi, qoci, gaararra, wele bifaxxi dadda'le, shiixxoka naacha. <verse eid="LEV 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 11:31" />Kunni buttate'n le'maachi duuchchi giddii'n batto'eeken; insa'neenna kade rensha insa'neeka tuqaaki duuchchi galgali qico'ni batto'aan. <verse eid="LEV 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 11:32" />Heene yaanenna renshi insa'neeki tuqoole itti yaane battootaan; ikkinna haqqeti hujemeeka miyuwwa, seemma, goga yooka dooniyya fakkaattaaxxa yaanuwwanna wele yaane duuchcha renshi insa'neeki tuqoole battootaani; konneera fakkaataaki miyuwwi duuchchi rensha insa'neeka tuqoole wodi'i giddo cuunphee'naa turowwaal; galgali qico'n batto'aani. Ookoneechi uduma ca'a hiyyaan. <verse eid="LEV 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 11:33" />Insa'ne giddii'ninna mittiinkiki renshi faarinke miyi giddo iboole, miya okkone giddo hedheechchi duuchchi batto'ammaxxee faariinka miya okkonee shiwwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 11:34" />Okkone faariinke miya'ni hedheeki wodi'i indaachcho tuqoole, ita itti battootaan; ha'wunaaxe yaanenna kaddoole midde okkone faarinke miyi giddo hexxoole battotaan. <verse eid="LEV 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 11:35" />Heeni yaanenna renshi tuqeexxi duuchcha battooteexxen; laango kaddo huburi batto'eeke; ha'noonna batto'eechchishsha uude. <verse eid="LEV 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 11:36" />Wele yaane duuchcha konne biniinchiki renshi tuqeexxe'e battootolenna muumme yookaan wode'e ikki'linaaxxi bale battootabaan. <verse eid="LEV 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 11:37" />Sannete uggineexxa midha renshi tuqoole midha itti battootabaan; <verse eid="LEV 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 11:38" />Yaane kinni sanne ettene wodi'iki lashshi assineechchi uduma renshi tuqeexxe kaddoole sanne itti battootaan.<verse eid="LEV 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 11:39" />« ‹Indaake horenaa'ninna biniinchi giddii'n mitti rewoole, rensha isika tuqeeki duuchchi galgali qico'ni batto'aan. <verse eid="LEV 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 11:40" />Ayyinna indaake horikanna biniinchika rensha itoole seemma isixxa borcedhowwaal; galgali qico'ninna batto'aan; ayyinna indaake horika yookaan biniinchika rensha dukoole seemma isixxa borcedhowwaal; isinna galgali qico'ni batto'aan.<verse eid="LEV 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 11:41" />« ‹Butta shirri hita'ni godobiki mi'itaaxxa shiixaramma dada duuchcha battootemmaxxee ittinoqen; <verse eid="LEV 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 11:42" />Shirri hita'ni godobik mi'itaaxxinna shoole lekka yookaan heddo lekka affeexi dada duuchcha battootemmaxxee ittinoqqe; <verse eid="LEV 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 11:43" />Tenneranaa'ni mittetanna ittine ifi battesitinoqen; <verse eid="LEV 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 11:44" />Ani ha'nooke Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Magenon; Ani woyyichake kadennaxxe ha'nonna ifi woyyoonse; butta shirri hita'ni godobik mi'itaaxxa yaane ittine ifi battesitinoqen. <verse eid="LEV 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 11:45" />Mageno ha'nooke kadonna'a Gibtseke boginaa'ni fi'le ha'noo fulcheneki ante Duuchchi Woddike Goottan; tennexxee ani woyyichchaken; ha'nonna ifi woyyoonse.<verse eid="LEV 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 11:46" />« ‹Yoona kunni wodi'i giddo hedhaakenna buttate'ni lele'maake biniinchuwwi'anna ci'atixxe sannuwwa duuchchi'a uwwemeeke seeran; <verse eid="LEV 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 11:47" />Batto'ebakixxenna batto'eekixxe oddo'ni hexxexxa gargarunte ege'natee, iittanni indaakixxe'ninna indabaake horixxenaa biinchuwwixxe oddo'ni hexxeexxa gargarunte afatee xonxommantaashsha› » Isira'eelika arda barsiisse hiyye ajaje.<verse eid="LEV 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LEV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Dubarte Ildeechi Uduma Battumma Bidhdhatika Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 12:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Muuse'e, <verse eid="LEV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 12:2" />«Agenjo agenjoke'ni leelitammaxxi ‹dubartetixxi aada leelitee'na torbaane barra qico'ni battotammashsha, dubarte siila'wite labba belto ildoole torbaane barra qico'ni battootaan; <verse eid="LEV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 12:3" />Saddeetteeso baro belti ilemeeki jila ofo'lowaal.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:12">Dada. 17:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:21">Luq. 2:21</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 12:4" />Okkonchi udumi'a lebbe gadabi uurraaxxe sase tommenna sase barra qico'ni, Magenoke foyendeexxa mitte yaanenna tuqqoqen; tinni battumma bidhdhatixxi yanna muuxendaaxxe woyyichcha boonchibaa e'yitoqen. <verse eid="LEV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 12:5" />Iittani agenjo agenjoke'ni leelitammaxxi dubartetixxi aada leelitee'na battootamashshani, dubarte dubarra ildoole tommena shoole barra qico'ni battootaan; okkoo'ninna gadabi uurraaxxeenna battumma bidhdhatixxi yanna muuxendaaxxe jaane tommenna jaane barra turtowwaali.<verse eid="LEV 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 12:6" />« ‹Battumma bidhdhatixxi yanna muuxendeexxe yanna'ni labbake belti'aanna kadi meyyaxxe belto'a ciincatike tolchchi'a shiqaaka mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusanna cubbo biratike tolchi'a guugenjo yookaan shiixoxxa guugenjo Mageni ulfinniki leellammake duunkaaniinxe hulabaa idagge qeesichchoke'ni uutowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 12:7" />Qeesichchikinna uwwa shiqqeexxa aadheexxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo shiqishaan; cubbo biratika seera muuxaan; munde dunda'neexxe aada dubartetixxenaa'n qulloondaan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 12:7">« ‹Kunni seerinna dubarte labbaxxa yookaan meyyaxxa oose ildeechchi uduma muuxemaaken. <verse eid="LEV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 12:8" />Manjichcho gedhebiinka buruusa idaga dande'a gophphoole lame guugenjuwwa yookaan lame shiixaramma guugenjo idaggowwaal; lame giddii'ni mitte ciincatike tolchi'a mitte kinni cubbotixxe gattowwaalike tolchaan; qeesichchikinna cubbo biree'naa'a isenna battooma bidhdhitaan› » hiyye Isira'eelike ardi'a seeruwwa konne uwwe.<verse eid="LEV 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LEV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Bisiinke Dhukkubika Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 13:1" />Mageni Muusenna Aaroonii, <verse eid="LEV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 13:2" />«Ayyinna biso isike'ni miseri yookaan fissi hiyyaachchi yookaan baraarra biso isike'ni birasa'e mundo fakkaatoole qeesichcho Aaroonibaa yookaan qeesete kaddeexxe isixxe oosenaa'ni mittiinbaa iyyedangowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 13:3" />Qeesichchikinna mada eettene uudowaal; madatiba hexxeexxi orda gola'litoole, madatinna giddi'a qonfo hitoole iikki dhukkubi mundoke hiyyoten; qeesichchikinna ikki manji batto'eexxa ege'nishowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 13:4" />Yaane kinni mada ittinna gola'lite giddi'a qonfo hita gophphoole, iittanni madatixxe bakka'ni hexxeexxi orda gola'la gophphoole qeesichchi torbaane barra'a okkone manjo'ni mine iso'ni cufe turaashsha assowaal; <verse eid="LEV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 13:5" />Qeesichchikinna torbeesoxxe barra'ni higgeenna uudowwaal; uudee'naa mada itti jijjirende ba'latebaangi hexxemmashani hexxoole ta'anna madatike manjo'ni torbaane barra'a mine iso'ni cunfe turaashsha assowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 13:6" />Qeesichchikinna higgeenna torbeesoxxe barra'ni uudowwaal; uude'na mada itti qoortee'naa afoole mada itti qanxo calla kaddeexxanna manjichchi ikki batto'eebaaxxa ege'nishowwaal; manjichchikinna batto'eebaaxxa ege'nishatee seemma borccedhowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 13:7" />Yaane kinni qeesichchi uude batto'eebaaxxa ege'nisheechchi udumi'a mada itti ha'yitoole ikki manjichchi qeesichchiinbaa illeema higowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 13:8" />Qeesichchinna higgeenna uudowwaal; mada itti ba'late ha'yitoole mada itti mundoke kaddemmaxxee, mundiki batto'eeke manjo kadeexxa ege'nishowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 13:9" />«Ayyeenna mundiinki dhukkubi abidoole manjo okkone qeesichchiinba idangowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 13:10" />Qeesichchikinna mada eettene uudowwaal; bisoke'ni hedheeki miseri gola'loole, bisoke'ni iima hedheeki ordichchinna jijjireme gola'lee'na miseri ikkinna malaoole, <verse eid="LEV 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 13:11" />Isenna bisoke'ni turteexxe mundiinxe mada kaddemmaxxe qeesichchi dhukkulichchi manji ikki batto'eexxa ege'nishowwaal; batto'eexxa farri assine kulleeke kademmaxxee mine cunfee'naa hedho'a hasissabaan.<verse eid="LEV 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 13:12" />«Mundiinki dhukkubi lekkatike qe'yinaa'ni umiin qico'ni geyoole, <verse eid="LEV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 13:13" />Qeesichchi higgeenna uudowwaal; dhukkkulichchi manjika biso duuchcha biree'naa uudoole, bisi duuchchi gola'le mudeeke kadammaxxe qeesichchi manjichchi ikki batto'eebaaxxa ege'nishowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 13:14" />Yaane kinni bisoke'ni mala yaassaaxxi mada hexxoole batto'aan. <verse eid="LEV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 13:15" />Qeesichchikinna higgeena uudee'naa mada haanni hitee'naa afoole, ikki manji mundiinke dhukkubinni batto'eexxa ege'nishowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 13:16" />Mada itti fayyite higgeenna gola'litoole higgeenna qeesechchiinbaa hige maraan; <verse eid="LEV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 13:17" />Qeesichchikinna uude mada itti fayyite gola'litee'naa afoole ikki manji batto'eekebaan; qeesichchikinna manjichchi batto'eebaaxxa ege'nishaan.<verse eid="LEV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 13:18" />«Manjo mitte'ni fayyiteexxe madaki gadaneessi hedhoole, <verse eid="LEV 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 13:19" />Udumii'ni kinni ikki gadaanessi hedhemmaba miseriinsha hedheechchi fule gola'loole yookaani diimattaashsha hexxeexxi baararra mada hexxemmaba leellitoole qeesichchiinbaa marowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 13:20" />Qeesichchikinna uudaa wodda mada hexxeexxi bakka wele bisi irra giddi'a qonfo hitoole bisoke'ni hexxeexxi ordanna gola'litoole miserakenaa'ni ke'eeke mundiinke dhukkuba kademmaxxee manjichchi ikki batto'eexxa ege'nishshowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 13:21" />Yaane kinni qeesichchi uudeexxi bisoke'ni iima hexxeexxi orda gola'la gophphe wele bisinaa'ninna qonfo hita gophphoole bisiinxi bifa jijjirendemaxxee qeesichchi okkone manjo torbaane barra'a mine iso'ni cuffe turraashsha assowaal; <verse eid="LEV 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 13:22" />Madatinna ba'lata'ni me'itoole, mada iitti mundoke kaddemmaxxee ikki manji batto'eexxa qeesichchi ege'nishowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 13:23" />Yaane kinni baararratinna jijjirendebaangi ba'lata'ni me'a gophphoole miseriinke gadaaneessa kademmaxxe qeesichchi manji ikki batto'eebaaxxa ege'nishshowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 13:24" />«Giira gubbe manji hedhoole gubatemaki bisi ikki gola'loole yookaan diimmate gola'loole; <verse eid="LEV 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 13:25" />qeesichchi uudowwaal; mada hexxeeke boonchchixxi orda gola'lite itti bakka qonfo hitoole giiratixxe gubachchonaa'ni dageeke mundiinke dhukkuban; tennexxee qeesichchi ikki manji batto'eexxa ege'nishowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 13:26" />Yaane kinni mada hexxe boonchchixxi orda gola'la gophphoole ittanni madatixxi bakkanna giiddi'a qonfo hita gophphe bifatixxe jijjirenshsha calla kaddoole qeesichchi okkone manjo torbaane barra'a mine iso'ni cuffe turraashsha assowaali. <verse eid="LEV 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 13:27" />Torbeesoxxe barra'ni qeesichchi illeema hige uudowwaal; mada itti ba'latoole mundoken hiyyoten; tennexxee qeesichchi manji ikki batto'eexxa ege'nishowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 13:28" />Yaane kinni mada hexxeexxi bakka mitte jijjiranna leellisha gophphe bifatixxe jijjirensha calla kaddoole mada itti giiratixxe gubachchoke gadaneessa kademmaxxee qeesichchi manji ikki batto'ebaaxxa ege'nishowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 13:29" />«Mitte labbake'ni yookaani meyyaxxe'ni umoke'ni kadi areedake'ni mada misexxi hexxoole, <verse eid="LEV 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 13:30" />Qeesichchi mada eettene uudowwaal; mada itti giddi'a qonfo hite madate'ni hexxeexxi orda baaxxuntetiba jijjirendoolenna fillidoottoole mundoke kademmaxxee manji ikki batto'eexxa qeesichchi ege'nishowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 13:31" />Yaane kinni qeesichchi uudaa wodda mada itti giddi'a qonfo hita gophphe, madatiba hexxeexxe ordaxxi bifa kinni fayyaxxe kada gophphoole, hoqooqissaaxxe mada'a qeesichchi okkone manjo torbaane barra qico'ni mine iso'ni cuffe turraashsha assowaal; <verse eid="LEV 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 13:32" />Torbeessoxxe barra'ni higgeenna qeesichchi uudowwaal; mada itti ba'lata'ni me'a gophphoole, orda baaxxuntetibaa jijjirema gophphoolenna mada giddi'a qonfo hita gophphoole, <verse eid="LEV 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 13:33" />Ikkin manji madati qarqara hexxeexxa orda haadowwaal; qeesichchi higgeenna wele torbaane barra'a mine iso'ni cuffe turraashsha assowaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 13:34" />Torbeessoxxe barra'ni higgeenna qeesichchi mada eettene uudowwaal; mada itti ba'lata gophphe giddi'anna qonfo hita gophphoole manji ikki batto'ebaaxxa qeesichchi ege'nishshowwaal; manji ikkinna seemma isixxa borcedhowwaal; ca'ichchakenna kadaan. <verse eid="LEV 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 13:35" />Yaane kinni batto'eebaaxxa qeesichchi ege'nisheechchi uduma mada itti wirri hite ha'yitoole, <verse eid="LEV 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 13:36" />Qeesichchi illeema uudowwaal; mada itti ba'latoole orda itti baaxxoottolenna baaxxo'a gophphoole manjichchi ikki batto'ee'en. <verse eid="LEV 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 13:37" />Yaane kinni qeesichchiinxe uushsho'ni mada itti ba'lata gophphee'na fayyaxxi orda fuldoole mada itti fayyiteexxe kaddemmaxxee manjichchi ikki batto'eebaaxxa qeesichchi ege'nishowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 13:38" />«Manjo Labbakike biso'ni yookaani mayyaxxike biso'ni baararra gola'litaaxxi hexxoole, <verse eid="LEV 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 13:39" />Qeesichchi okkone manjo uudowwaal; baararra hexxeexxi bakka hara gola'litebaaxxe kadoole miidhdhama lumoka bisoke'ni geesisabaachcho kademmaxxee manji ikki batto'eekebaan.<verse eid="LEV 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 13:40" />«Mitti manjik umi ca'a hiyye mudoole itti molote kaddemmaxxee manji ikki batto'eekebaan. <verse eid="LEV 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 13:41" />Mitti manji umi edii'ninna umiinxe wirtobaa'ni umiinki ordichchi ca'a hiyyoole molete kaddemmaxxee ikki manji batto'eekebaan. <verse eid="LEV 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 13:42" />Yaane kinni molote'ni yookaan albake'ni diimmate gola'litaaxxi mada leellitoole itti mada mundiinke dhukkuban. <verse eid="LEV 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 13:43" />Qeesichchikinna uudeexxi molete'ni yookaan faaxote'ni hana leelliteexxi mada bisoke'ni fulammake mundiinxe madashsha diimmata'neeke miserixxa mada afoole, <verse eid="LEV 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 13:44" />Ikki manjinna mundiinki dhukkubi umo isike'ni hedheeke dhukkulichcha kademmaxxe batto'eeken; tennexxee batto'eexxa qeesichchi ege'nishowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 13:45" />«Konne qicinni mundiinke dhukkubinni abidemeeki manji dadaarendeexxa seemma oddo'wowaal; umokanna fi'loqen, suumetanna buqedhowwaal; okkonechchi uduma, ‹Ani batto'eenekeni! Ani batto'eenekeni› hiyya'ni raarowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 13:46" />Kunni dhukkubi okkone manjo'ni hedhe qico'ni batto'aan. Tennexxee ardakenaa'ni gargari fule olla'iin gadho hedhaani.<verse eid="LEV 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Seematike Buqunika Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 13:47" />«Gedhebiinxe ordani hujendeexxe seemma yookaan layinotixxi seemma buqundoole, <verse eid="LEV 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 13:48" />Layinotike shimala'ni yookaan gedhebiinxe ordani hujendeexxe seemma yookaan gogiki giissineexxe seemma'ni buquni leelloole, <verse eid="LEV 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 13:49" />Bifa okkone buqunixxi haanjiniinba'a yookaan diimminiinba'a gamatta'noole mittekenaa'ni weliinba'a sa'aake buquna kademmaxxee qeesichchi uudowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 13:50" />Qeesichchikinna uude ke'eechchin udumi'a seemma duuchchiinxa torbaane barra qico'ni mitte kuta'ni uggine cunfee'naa turtowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 13:51" />Torbeesso baro higgeenna uudaa wodda buquni birasa'oole, buquni ikki balleessaake kademmaxxee iitti seemmuwwa duuchcha battoteexeni; <verse eid="LEV 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 13:52" />Kunni buquninna ba'lata'ni me'aammaxxe seemmuwwa eettene giirate'ni gunbowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 13:53" />«Yaane kinni qeesichchi uudaa wodda buquni ikki ba'lata gophoole, <verse eid="LEV 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 13:54" />Seemmuwwa eettene anshine higgeenna torbaane barra qico'ni qofi ugginaashsha qeesichchi assowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 13:55" />Okkonechchi uduma Qeesichchi higgeenni uudowwaal; buquniinxi bifa jijjirema gophoole, buquni ba'late wele baanna geya gophoolenna seemmuwwa itti battoteexxenn; giddi darree'ni yookaan gadhi darree'ni buquna affeexxi seemmuwwa giirati gubendowaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 13:56" />Yaane kinni qeesichchi higgeenna uuda wodda buquni ba'lata gophoole, buquni hedhemmaxxa bakka calla seemmatenaa'ni yookaan gogiinxe seemmanaa'ni dareexxi hoyyowaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 13:57" />Buquni ikki higgeenna seemma ettene'ni leelloole, ba'lata'ni me'aake buquna kademmaxxee seematiki anni seemma eettene giirati gubowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LEV 13:58" />Seemma eettene borcinee'na buquni ba'oole higgenna borcowaal; okkonechchi uduma battootabaani.»<verse eid="LEV 13:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LEV 13:59" />Kunni seeri layinote kadi gedhebiinxe ordani giissineexxa seemma, layinotixxe seemma'ni yookaan gedhebiinxe ordani giissineexe seemma'ni, yookaan gogiki giissendeexxe heene seemma'ninna leellaaka buquna hitta uunde seemmat itti battoteexanna battootebaaxxa murra seeran.<verse eid="LEV 13:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LEV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Mundiinke Dhukkubika Battooma Bidhdhatika Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 14:1" />Magenikinna Muuse, <verse eid="LEV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 14:2" />«Manji mitti mundiinke dhukkubinaa'ni fayyoole battooma bidhdhatiki seeri konnechchin butti'a hedheeken; manji mitti battooma bidhdheexxa ege'ninshaa baro qeesichchiinba isoo shiqinshowaal:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2, </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:4">Mat. 8:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:44">Mar. 1:44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:14">Luq. 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:14">17:14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 14:3" />Qeesichchikinna olla'akenaa'ni gadhi'a fulchcheexxi uudowwaal; dhukkubikinna fayyo'oole, <verse eid="LEV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 14:4" />Manjichchikinna fayyaxxa lame ci'anna eloka foole afeeke haqichchika kutemalchcho, diimmoka shimalanna hisoophite hinaaxxe badda'aka shafa idagaashsha qeesichchi ajajowwaali. <verse eid="LEV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 14:5" />Okkonechchi uduma qeesichchinna ca'ichcha wode'e afeeke fariinke miya'ni ciichcho mitte gorranaashsha ajajowwaali; <verse eid="LEV 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 14:6" />Gatteexxa langaxxa ciichcho aadheexi eloka foole afeeke haqichchike kutemalchchini, diimoke shimalinninna hisoophite hinaaxxe badda'ake shafini mitteba sirete'ni gorranemmaxxe ciiichchoxxe munde'ni cuuphowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 14:7" />Mundetanna mundiinke dhukkubinaa'ni fayyeeke manjo'ni torbaanele fixowwaal; okkonechchi udumi'a battumma bidhdheexxa ege'nishowwaal; gorra'endebaaxxa ciichcho me'ito'a wocci assowaal.<verse eid="LEV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 14:8" />«Dhukkubakenaa'ni fayye manji seemma isixxa borcedhaan; umokanna haaxxaani; bisokanna anshedhaan; okkonechchi uduma battooma bidhdhe olla'i giddi'a e'yaani; yaane kinni torbaane barra qico'ni seemmati giissineeke fooqi isiki gadho turowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 14:9" />Torbaane barra uduma higgeenna umo, areeda, gaara iimikanna bisoke'ni weleba hexxeexxa orda duuchcha haxxeexxi seemmatanna borcedhowwaal; bisokanna anshedhowwaal; okkonechchi uduma battooma bidhdheeke kadaan.<verse eid="LEV 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 14:10" />«Saddeetixxe barra'ni fayyaka lame gedhebiinka buruusanna mitte woggaxxa meyyaxa gedhechcho idagowwaal; jaane kiilo kaddaaxxa ejersiinxe zayiteni qushshineexxa bullenna buttule mitte kaddaaxxa ejeersiinxa zayite idagowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 14:11" />Qeesichchikinna manjichchi idageexxe uwwan welti Mageni ulfinnik leellammake duunkaaniinxe hulabaa iyyemare Mageni edo shiqishaan.<verse eid="LEV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 14:12" />«Ookkoneechchi uduma qeesichchi labbake gedhebinaa'ni mitte, mitte buttule ejeersiinxe zayiteni welti balleessa biratike tolcha asse shiqishaan. Qeesichchikinna Magenoke lele'misatike tolcha asse shiqishaan. <verse eid="LEV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 14:13" />Isinna ookkone gedhecho cubbotike tolchinna ciincatika tolchi gorra'eemammake ookkene hara woyyichcha booncho'ni gorra'owwaal; kuunni cicincatik tolchinna ookkone qeesichchi'a uwweemaammashshanni kunni balleesatik tolchinna ookkone qeesichcha uwwemowwaal; kunni hara woyyoomeeken. <verse eid="LEV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 14:14" />Qeesichchikinna labbake gedhechchixxe mundenaa'ni shiixxoxxa aadheexxi battumma bidhdheexxa ege'nisha'neeke manjixxe middixxe manshshake kasa'ni, middixxe angakenna middixxe lekkake abugudduwwa'ni issowwwaal. <verse eid="LEV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 14:15" />Qeesichchikinna ejeersiinxe zayitenaa'ni shiixxoxxa aadheexxi bita'ixxe anga isixxike ba'lincha'ni cossowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 14:16" />Zayite eettenenaa'ni shiixxoxxa middixxe angaxxe qubbani cuupha'ni Magenii edo torbaanele fixowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 14:17" />Ba'lincha isike'ni hexxeexxe zayitenaa'ni shiixxoxxa aadha'n battooma bidhdheexxa ege'nisha'neeke manjichchixxe middixxe mashshake kasa'ni, middixxe angakenna middixxe lekkake abugudduwwa'n issowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 14:18" />Angate'ni gattemmaxxa zayite battooma bidhdha'neeke manjike umo'ni issowaal; konne qici'ni qeesichchi Magenii edo cubbo biraan.<verse eid="LEV 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 14:19" />«Ookkoneechchi uduma qeesichchi cubbo biratika tolcha shiqishati battooma biratika seera muuxaan; ookko'ni ciincatike tolchika hore gorra'aan; <verse eid="LEV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 14:20" />Gorra'eeka horenna midhatike tolchchini welti tolchchimalchoke'n ciinceesaani; konne qicini qeesichchi cubbo biraani; manji ikkinna battooma bidhdhaani.<verse eid="LEV 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 14:21" />«Manjichchinna konnecho duuchcha iyyedagatee dande'a gopha'noole, balleessa biratike tolchi'a kadaaka Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a lele'misatike tolcha asse mitte gedhebiinka buruusa iyyedagowwaal; isini weltinna ejeersiinxe zayiteni welti qushendeexxa lame kiilo kaddaaxxa shaqqinshe danneexxa bullenna mitte buttule ejeersiinxa zayite idagowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 14:22" />Iittani dande'e qico'ni lame guugejo yookaan lame shiixarama guugenjo, mitte cubbo biratike tolchchi'a helxene ciincesatike tolchi'a shiqishaan.<verse eid="LEV 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 14:23" />«Battooma bidhdhatiki seeri muuxemmaaxe saddeteesoxxe barra'ni konne duuchcha idage Magenii ulfinniki leellammake duunkaaniinxe hula'ni Magenii edo qeesichchoke'ni uwwaan. <verse eid="LEV 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 14:24" />Qeesichchikinna gedhechiinka buruusanna ejeersiinke haqichchixxa zayite buttulle mitte aadheexxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a lele'misatike tolcha asse shiqishaan. <verse eid="LEV 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 14:25" />Qeesichchikinna konne balleessatike tolchi'a shiqeeka gedhebiinka buruusa gorra'owwaal; mundetenaa'ni shiixxoxxa aadheexxi battooma bidhdha'neeke manjixxe middixe manshshake kasa'ni, middixxe angake'nina middixxe lekkake abugudduwwa'ni issowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 14:26" />Qeesichchi zayitetenaa'ni shiixxoxxa middixxe anga isixxe'ni cossedhaan; <verse eid="LEV 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 14:27" />Isenaa'ni shiixxoxxa middixxe angake qubichchini cuupha'ni Magenii edo torbaanele fixaan; <verse eid="LEV 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 14:28" />Ballessatike tolchixxe mundeni assemmashshani angate'ni gatteexxa zayite aadheexxi battooma bidhdha'neeke manjixxe middixxe manshsha'ni, middixxe angake'nina middixxe lekkake abuguddo'ni tuqisaan. <verse eid="LEV 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 14:29" />Magenii edo cubbo biratee qeesichchi angate'ni gatteexxa zayite battooma bidhdha'neeke manjike umo'ni dunaan. <verse eid="LEV 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 14:30" />Battooma bidhdha'neek manjinna lame shiixxaramma guugenjo yookaani lame guugenjo idagowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 14:31" />Mitte cubbo biratike tolchchi'a helxenee kinni ciincatike tolchi'a shiqishowwaal, iseni welti midhatika tolcha shiqishowwaal; qeesichchikinna battooma bidhdha'neeke manji'a Mageni edo cubbo birowwaali.»<verse eid="LEV 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 14:32" />Mundiinke dhukkubika battooma bidhdhaaki manji tolchakee shiqishiyyo hasisaaka tolcha hiyyumma isixxenaa'ni kexxeexxa dande'a gopheeke manji'a muunxaaki seeri konneten.<verse eid="LEV 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mineke'ni Leelake Buqunika Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 14:33" />Mageni Muusenna Aarooni, <verse eid="LEV 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 14:34" />«Ani ha'no'a uwwanoke boga'ni Kenaani e'yitinnaa wodda okkone boga'ni afemaake mitte mini giddo buquna uggonnole, <verse eid="LEV 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 14:35" />Ayyinna mine isike'ni buquni hedheexxa afeeki manji qeesichchiinba mare ‹mine anke'ni buquniinsha hedheechcho hedheen› hiyye kulowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 14:36" />Qeesichchikinna mine e'ye buquniinxa bifa uudebaa edi darre mini giddo hedheeka miya duuchcha gadhi'a fulchchinaashsha ajajowwaal; kada gophphoole mini giddo hedheechchi duuchchi batto'aan; okkonechchi uduma qeesichchi mine e'ye uudowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 14:37" />Buquniinxa bifa uudaa wodda gimo fufursha'ni itaake hanjaake yookaan diimmoxi boddi bodditte bifa leelitoole, <verse eid="LEV 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 14:38" />Minekenaa'ni fule torbaane barra'a cufowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 14:39" />Torbaxxe barra'ni hige higgeenna uudowwaal; buquni ba'late wele baanna geyoole, <verse eid="LEV 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 14:40" />Buquna affeexxa kino yookaan miniinxa gimo gonshshe aa'neexxi qachchinii gadho hedheeke battichcha boonchcho'ni hunnaashsha ajajowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 14:41" />Okkonechchi uduma haqqe giddixxa duuchchanna dhoqqe duuchcha soonfe qachchinii gadho hedheeke batto'eeke kora hunnaake boonchcho'ni hunnaashsha assowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 14:42" />Okkonechchi uduma edixxe kinoxxe bakka'ni wele kino hiissineexxi dhoqqe itti hana gannowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 14:43" />«Kino hoyyine, gimo soonfe ke'ne haaroxxe kinonni mine haaronsineechchi uduma higgeenna buquni leelloole, <verse eid="LEV 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 14:44" />Qeesichchi mare uudowwaal; buquni ikki ba'lata'ni wele baanna geya'ni me'a'neeke kademmaxxee mini ikki batto'eeken. <verse eid="LEV 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 14:45" />Tennexxee diigiyyo hasissaan; kinjo, haqichchonna dhoqqe gannema duuchcha qachchini gadho batto'eeke kora hunnaake boonchcho'ni hunnowwaali.<verse eid="LEV 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 14:46" />«Mine okkone cunfeechchi uduma okkone mini giddi'a e'yaaki manji hashshaa qico'ni batto'aan; <verse eid="LEV 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 14:47" />Okkone mini giddo diipheeki yookaan ita iteeki hedhoole seemma isixxa borcedhowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 14:48" />«Mine haaroba haaronsineexxi giissineechchi uduma qeesichchi mare uudaa wodda buquni ba'lateexxa leellishaaxxi yaane hedha gophphoole, buquni hara ba'eemmaxxee mini ikki battoomakenaa'ni ca'a hiyyeexxa qeesichchi ege'nishowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 14:49" />Miniinka battooma ca'a assatee lame ci'a, Libaanosike haqichchika kutemalchcho, diimmoka shimalanna hisoophite hinaake ansichchika shafa idagowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 14:50" />Ca'ichchi muumetiki wodi'i hedheeke faarinke miya'ni ci'atenaa'ni mitte gorra'owwaal; <verse eid="LEV 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 14:51" />Okkonechchi uduma Libaanosike haqichchika kutemalchcho, hisoophika shafa, diimoka shimalanna gorra'endebaaxxa ci'a gorra'endeexxe ci'axxe munde'ninna muumetike wodi'i giddo cuuphowaal; mineke'ninna torbaanele fixowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 14:52" />Konne qicini qeesichchi mine okkone ci'atixxe munden, ca'ichchi wodi'in, lubbo affeexe ci'ani, Libaanosike haqichchike kutemalchchin, hisoophike shafinninna diimoke shimalinni battoomakenaa'ni ca'a hiyyaasha assaan. <verse eid="LEV 14:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 14:53" />Okkonechchi uduma lubbo affeexxa ci'a qachchinii gadhi'a me'itaashsha wocci assaan; konne qicinni miniinxa battooma ca'a assatiki seeri muuxemaan; minikinna battoomakenaa'ni ca'a hiyyaan.»<verse eid="LEV 14:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 14:54" />Kunni mitte manjonaa'ni wele manjo'ni sa'aake mundiinke dhukkubike, <verse eid="LEV 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 14:55" />Seemmate'ninna mineke'ni fulaake buqunike, <verse eid="LEV 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 14:56" />Miseriinke, fissi hiyye bisoke'ni fulaachchikenna baararratike battooma bidhdhatike seeruwwan. <verse eid="LEV 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 14:57" />Kunni seeruwwi mitte yaane battooteexxanna battootebaaxxa muraake seeruwwan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 14:57">Kunni tare sa'aak bisink dhukubi iittanni seemmate'ninna mini hana hedhaake tare sa'aake dhukibi'a hujaake seeran.<verse eid="LEV 14:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LEV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Battoosaaka Manjuntetika Shamina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 15:1" />Mageni Muusenna Aarooni'i hiyyee qici, <verse eid="LEV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 15:2" />«Isira'eelike manni'a hitine kuldinaa qici: ‹Hoone manjona'ninna ilatik biso isikena'ni shamini fuloole iikki manji batto'eeken. <verse eid="LEV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 15:3" />Tinninna ilatike bisonaa'ni shamini uurrichchibelo fula'noolenna yookaan fula waaloolenna iikki manji batto'eeken.<verse eid="LEV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 15:4" />« ‹Iikki shamini isinaa'n fula'neek manji hanna diiphaxxi hiini ma'nanna bottotteexxe kaddaan; isi hana ofo'laaxxi hiini yaanenna battooteexxe kaddaan. <verse eid="LEV 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 15:5" />Ma'na isixxa tuqaake kado, <verse eid="LEV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 15:6" />Yookaan manjichchi ofo'leexxe heene yaane duuchcha'ni ofo'laaki manji duuchchi seemmanna biso isika anshshedhiyyo hassissaan; isinna hashshi qico'ni batto'aan.<verse eid="LEV 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 15:7" />« ‹Ilatike bisonaa'ni shamini fulaaka manjo tuqaaki manji seemmanna biso isika anshedhowwaal; hashshi qico'ninna batto'aani. <verse eid="LEV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 15:8" />Ilatike bisonaa'ni shamini fulaaki manji batto'ebaake manjo'ni hancufa tufoole, ikki hancufi tuqemmaki manji seemma borcedhe biso isika anshedhowaal; hancufi tuqemmaki manji ikkinna hashshi qico'ni batto'aan.<verse eid="LEV 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 15:9" />« ‹Ilatike bisonaa'ni shamin fulaaki manji ofo'laaki huuni koorinna batto'eeken; <verse eid="LEV 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 15:10" />Ilatike bisonaa'ni shamini fulaaki manji ofo'leeka miya duuchcha tuqaaki hashshi qico'ni batto'aan; ilatike bisinaa'ni shamini fulaaki manji ofo'leeka hoone miyanna abideeki manji seemma borcedhe bisokanna anshedhowwaal; isinna hashshi qico'ni batto'aan.<verse eid="LEV 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 15:11" />« ‹Ilatike bisonaa'ni shamini fulaaki manji anga anshedhebaangi mitte manjo tuqoole ikki manji seemma borcedhe bisokanna anshedhowwaal; hashshi qico'ninna batto'aani.<verse eid="LEV 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 15:12" />« ‹Ilatike bisonaa'ni shamini fulaaki manji tuqeeka hooneenna faariinka miya butuchche; haqichchiki hujemeeka miya duuchcha wodi'iki anshshe.<verse eid="LEV 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 15:13" />« ‹Ilatike bisonaa'ni shamini fulaaki manji dhukkubi ikki fayyeechchi uduma battooma bidhdho'a torbaane barra qico'ni turowwaal; okkonechchi uduma seemma borcedhowaal; ca'ichcha muummetike wodi'ini bisokanna anshedhowwaal; battoomakenaa'ni ca'a hiyyaan. <verse eid="LEV 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 15:14" />Saddeeteesoxxe barra'ni lame guugenjo yookaan lame shiixaramma guugenjo Magenii ulfinniki afemammake duunkaaniinxe hulabaa iyyedage Magenii edo qeesichchoke'ni uwwowwwaal; <verse eid="LEV 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 15:15" />Qeesichchikinna shiqqeexxe lame ci'uwwanaa'ni mitte cubbo biratike tolchi'a, gatteexxa mitte ciincatike tolchi'a shiqishowwaal; konne qicinni battooma biratiki seeri muuxemaan.<verse eid="LEV 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 15:16" />« ‹Manjo mittenaa'ni hortetik wodi'i fuloole, biso isika anshedhowwaal; isinna hashshi qico'ni batto'aan. <verse eid="LEV 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 15:17" />Hortetik wodi'i heene seemmanna kadi bonkichcho tuqoole borcinowwaal; itti seemmanna kadi bonkichchi hashshi qico'ni batto'aan; <verse eid="LEV 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 15:18" />Meyyaxxinna labbaki mitteba dhiinphe ke'naaxe yanna'ni lamiingi biso anshe'nowaal; hashshi qico'ni battoonaan.<verse eid="LEV 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 15:19" />« ‹Melaalle melaalletixxi aada leellitaa wodda torbaane barra qico'ni battootaan; iseenna tuqaaki ayyinna hashshi qico'ni batto'aan.<verse eid="LEV 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 15:20" />« ‹Melaalletixxi aada leelliteexxe yanna'ni melaalle ofoldaachcho kadi diiphphaachchi duuchchi batto'eeken. <verse eid="LEV 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 15:21" />Ma'na isexxanna tuqaaki duuchchi seemma isixxa borcedhe bisokanna anshedhowwaal; isinna hashshi qico'ni batto'aan; <verse eid="LEV 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 15:22" />Ofoldaachcho tuqaaki duuchchi seemma borcedhe bisokanna anshedhowwaal; hashshi qico'ni batto'aan. <verse eid="LEV 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 15:23" />Diiphphaachcho yookaan ofoldaachcho tuqaaki galgali qico'ni batto'aan.<verse eid="LEV 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 15:24" />« ‹Melaalletixxi aada leellitaaxxe yanna'ni iseni diiphaaki labbaki isinna iseshshani batto'aan; tennexxee torbaane barra qico'ni botto'eeken; isinna diiphaaxxi ma'na battooteexxeni.<verse eid="LEV 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 15:25" />« ‹Manjichcho mitte melaalletixxi aada dagge saxxammaxxa yanna saxxe yo'oxxe barra'a dunendoole yookaan aada uurritammaxxa yanna saxxe uurritebaangi dunda'noole uurrita qico'ni aaditte melaalletixxe aada kaddammashshani battooteexxen. <verse eid="LEV 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 15:26" />Tenne yanna'ni diiphphammaxxi ma'nanna kadi ofoldaaxxi yaane duuchcha battooteexxeni. <verse eid="LEV 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 15:27" />Eettene ise tuqqemmaxxa yaanuwwa tuqaaki duuchchi batto'ammaxxe seemma borcedhe bisokanna anshshedhowwaal; isinna hashshi qico'ni batto'eeken.<verse eid="LEV 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 15:28" />« ‹Munde uurritoole torbaane barra qico'ni turtowaal; okkonechchi uduma ca'a hiteexxe kaddaan. <verse eid="LEV 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 15:29" />Saddeeteesoxxe barra'ni lame guuggenjo yookaan lame shiixaramma guugenjo iyyedagge Magenii ulfinniki leellammake duunkaani edo qeesichchoke'ni uutowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 15:30" />Qeesichchikinna mitte cubbo biratike tolcha asse, helxene kinni ciincatike tolcha asse shiqishowwaal; konne qicini qeesichchi duunenda'neexxe battite yaane'a Magenii edo biraan.<verse eid="LEV 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 15:31" />« ‹Mgenikinna Muusee oddo insa'neexxe'ni hedheeka ani ulfinniki leellanaka seemmati giissine fooqo battoosine rennabaashsha Isira'eeliki ardi ifi battoosabaashsha xonxomachchiisi.› »<verse eid="LEV 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 15:32" />Kunni seeruwwi manjo mittenaa'ni fulaake manjuntetike shaminixxenna hortetike wodi'in batto'aake manjike seeruwwan. <verse eid="LEV 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 15:33" />Ittani melaalletixxe aada'ni hexxexxe dubarte'aanna, dubarte melaalletixxe aadani hexxeexe dubartenni welti diiphaake labbali'a kulaake seeran.<verse eid="LEV 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Cubbo Biratixxa Barra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 16:1" />Lame Aaroonixxi oose seeri beloxxa giira Mageni edo aaxxe shiqati rerteechchi uduma, Mageni Muuse, <verse eid="LEV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2" />«Dayyi atiki Aarooni duuchchi wodda kadebaaki ani duumanchchiki tabotiinke tuphanjo'ni leellannoxxe barra calla langaxxe woyyitte kutaba e'yaashsha kuli; konne ajaja sa'oole reyaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:19">Ibr. 6:19</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3" />Langaxxe woyyitte kutaba e'ya dande'aaki cubbo biratike tolchi'a jibbichcha mitte, ciincatike tolchi'a gedhechcho labbaka mitte shiqisheechchi uduma kada hassissaan.» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:7">Ibr. 9:7</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 16:4" />Aarooninna langaxxe woyyitte kuta giddi'a e'yeba edi darre biso anshshedhe qeesomiinxi oddo'wwaaxxi seemmuwwa: layinotixxa qeerraxxa seemmanna gonfa, sabbatanna, ruufa umoke'ni mirqedhaken. <verse eid="LEV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 16:5" />Isira'eeliki ardinna cubbo biratike tolchi'a lame korbeeyye re'e, ciincatike tolchchi'a mitte labbaka gedhechcho Aarooniba idangowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 16:6" />«Isixxanna isike mini hadixxa cubbo biratee mitte jibbichcha tolchowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 16:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma lame re'e eettene Magenii ulfinniki afemammake duunkaaniinxe huddume'ni Magenii edo shiqishowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 16:8" />Ookonna Aarooni mitte hixa ‹Magenokee› langaka ‹Azazeli'a› hiyyaaka beessisa afeexxa lame kino aadheexxi hixa ibisowwaal.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Azazeli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tenne Ibrititotixxe hiyyaxxi toggitte tika ege'nendeexebaani; mise giddo gammoojjichcha bogike durriisa kada gophabaan.</char></note> <verse eid="LEV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 16:9" />Aarooninna hixi Magenoke fulchemmaka recco cubbo biratee tolchowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 16:10" />Hixi Azazeeli'a fulemmaka recco hedhondinni hedhee'na Magenii edo shiqishe ke'eexxi ardiinxa cubbo bukki assedhe gammooje'a me'aashsha assaan» hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 16:11" />Aarooninna cubbo isixxanna isike mini hadixxa biratee jibichcha tolchowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 16:12" />Tolchimalchoke'n giira aadheexxi lame oobo kaddaaxxa eloka fishshaaka foole affeeke hixaanixxa bulle aadheexxi langaxxe woyyitte kutaba e'yowaal; <verse eid="LEV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 16:13" />Okkonna Magenii edo aadhe e'yeexxe giira'ni ixaana worowwaal; uude reyabaashshanna Taabotiinka tuphanjo ixaaniinxi wiliille buqqowaal. <verse eid="LEV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 16:14" />Jibichchiinxa munde shiixxoxxa adheexi qubichchiki cuupha'ni Taabotiinke tuphanjo'ni edi darree'ni fixowwaal; ittanni munde eettenenaa'ni aadheexxi Kakotike Taaboti edo torbaanele fixowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 16:15" />Okkonechchi uduma ardiinxa cubbo biratee recco gorra'owwaal; mundetanna langaxxe woyyitte kuta giddi'a aadhe e'yeexxi jibichchiinxa munde assemashshani Tabotiinke tuphanjo'ninna Kakotike Taaboti edo fixowwaal.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:12">Ibr. 9:12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 16:16" />Konne qicinni langaxxa woyyitte kuta Isira'eelike ardixxe battenaa'ninna cubbonaa'ni ca'a assatee battumma biratiki seeri muuxemaan; duunkaanikinna batto'eeke olla'a'ni hedhaammaxxee batte biratiki seeri iittani muuxemaan. <verse eid="LEV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 16:17" />Aarooni ifixxa, isike mini hadixxanna Isira'eelike ardixxa cubbo biratee langaxxe woyyitte kuta giddi'a e'yaa wodda ayyinna duunkaani giddo hedhoqqe; <verse eid="LEV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 16:18" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo hedheeke tolchimalchibaa fuleexxi tolchimalchokee cubbo birowwaal; jibichchiinxenaa'ninna recciinxe mundenaa'ni shiixxoxxa aadheexxi tolchimalchiinke kasa'ni hedheeke cunnuchchuwwa'ni issowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 16:19" />Mundetenaa'ni shiixxoxxa aadheexxi qubichchiki cuupha'ni tolchiin booncho'ni torbaanele fixowwaal; konne qicini Isira'eelike ardanaa'ni batte birati tolchimalcho ca'a assaani.<verse eid="LEV 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ardiinxa Cubbo Bukki Assedhe Me'aaka Recco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 16:20" />Aarooni langaxxa woyyitte kuta, Mageni ulfinniki leellammaka duunkaana, gatteexxa kutanna tolchimalchokee cubbo biratika seera muuxeechchi uduma Azazeli'a filemeeka recco aadheexi Mageni edo shiqishaan. <verse eid="LEV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 16:21" />Lame anga recciinke umo'ni uggaan; ardiinxa fuggo, cubbotana balleessa duuchcha faaci'aan; teenneeranna recciinke umo'ni uggaani; okkonechchi uduma tenne huje'a tukkesemeeke manji ookkone recco gane gammojichcha bogiba adhdhe me'aani. <verse eid="LEV 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 16:22" />Cubbo insa'neexxa duuchcha bukki assedhe me'aaka recco mitti manji hedhabaake gammoje qiilla boga'ni iyyemare wocci assaani.<verse eid="LEV 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 16:23" />«Aaroninna duunkaani giddi'a e'yowwaal; langaxxe woyyitte kutaba'a e'yebaa edi darre oddo'weemmaxxa qeesetixxa seemma fulchedhe ookkoni uggowaal;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:19">Hiz. 44:19</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 16:24" />Woyyichcha boonchcho'ninnaa biso anshedhe aaditte seemma oddo'wowaal; okko'ni fule isixxanna ardiinxa cubbo biratee ciincatika tolcha tolchowaal. <verse eid="LEV 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 16:25" />Cubbo biratee tolchemeeke horixxa ha'yo tolchimalchoke'n ciinceesowaal; <verse eid="LEV 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 16:26" />Azazeli'a filemeeka recco gane gammooje qiilli giddi'a adhdhe me'emmaki manji hige dagaa wodda olla'i giddi'a e'yeba edi darre seemma borccedhowaal; bisokanna anshedhowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 16:27" />Cubbo biratee tolchinemmakinna munde insa'neexxeni cubbo birate langaxxe woyyitte kuta giddi'a e'yinshemmaka jibichchanna recco olla'a okkone gadho fulhcine bayyinse giirati gunbowwaal; ittani goga insa'neeka, maalanna godobi giddira duuchcha gunbowwaal.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:11">Ibr. 13:11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 16:28" />Konnecho duuchcha gubeeki manji olla'i giddi'a higeba edi darre seemma isixxa borcedhowwaal; bisokanna anshedhowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cubbo Biratixxa Barra Ulfeessa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 16:29" />«Konnechchi butta hedheeka seeruwwa dagaake baro duuchcha'ni duuchchi woddixxe aada assexxine heqqexxinaani. Torbeesoki agenji e'yeeshshanni tommeesoxxe barra'ni Isira'eelik ardinna insa'neexxe oddo'ni hexxaaxi keesumma mitte yaane afo'o insa'neeke'ni manqoqe; barra ettene'ninna hujete hinaachcho hunjoqen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:26-32">Lew. 23:26-32</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 29:7-11">Lak. 29:7-11</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LEV 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 16:30" />Eettene barra battetenaa'ni ca'a hitinaashsha cubbo ha'nooxxa birraan; okkoo'ni Mageni edo batte bidhdhitineeke kaddinaan; <verse eid="LEV 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 16:31" />Eettene barra sanbatiinxe barrashsha hafuura adhdhatixxe barra kaddowaal; eettene barra'ninna ha'no ifi salphisine; isenna duuchchi woddixxe aada kaddaan. <verse eid="LEV 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 16:32" />Anniinxe bakka'ni hariireme qeesoletike sooreessa kadaaki qeesichchi woyyitte qeesetixxa seemma oddo'we cubbo biraani. <verse eid="LEV 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 16:33" />Isinna langaxxe woyyitte kutaxxa, Mageni ulfinniki leellammake duunkaaniinxa, tolchimalchiinxa, qeesetixxanna ardi duuchchiinxa cubbo biraan.<verse eid="LEV 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 16:34" />«Kunni seeruwwi duuchchi woddi'a heqqemowwaal; tinni aadanna woggate'ni mittele Isira'eelike ardiinxa cubbo duuchcha biratee muuxendowwaal.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 16:34">Konne qicini Muuse Mageni ajajeeshshani asse.<verse eid="LEV 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Tolcha Haba Shiqinshaaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 17:1" />Mageni Muuse, <verse eid="LEV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 17:2" />«Aarooni'ninna oose isixxe'ni, iittani Isira'eelike arda duuchcha'ni ‹Mageni ajajeeki ajaji konnechchin butti'a hedheeken› hite kuli; <verse eid="LEV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 17:3" />Isira'eelike ardanaa'ni ayyinna jibichcha yookaan gedhebo yookaan recco Magenoke tolchake asse olla'i giddo yookaan olla'in gadho gorra'oole, <verse eid="LEV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 17:4" />Woyyichcha booncho'ni Magenoke uwwate asse Mageni ulfinniki leellammake duunkaaniinxe huddumebaa iyyedaga gophoole, munde tola dunemmaxxee'e ifike ardi giddii'n fulowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 17:5" />«Tennexxee Isira'eelik ardi diidake'ni dulaaka hore Mageni ulfinniki leellammake duunkaaniinxe huddumebaa iyyedagowwaal; qeesichchikinna Duuchchi Woddike Gooti'a mittummatike tolcha asse tolchowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 17:6" />Qeesichchikinna duunkaani giddi'a e'yinammaxxe hulaba tolchimalchii hana munde fixowwaal; Magenoke gammachchiisaakenna fishshaake foole kadaashsha ha'yotanna ciinceesowaal; <verse eid="LEV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 17:7" />Isira'eeliki ardi adde Magenoke'ni afeexxenaa'ni bayyisaake durrisi'a hore insa'neeka diida duuchcha'ni dulati Mageno insa'neeka yaadisiyyo hasissabaan; Isira'eeliki ardi seera konne duuchchi wodda heqqedhowaali.<verse eid="LEV 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 17:8" />«Insa'ne'ninna ‹Huuninna Isira'eeliki manji yookaan ardiinxe oddo'ni hedheeki keesuntichchi ciincatika tolcha yookaan wele tolcha shiqishoole, <verse eid="LEV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 17:9" />Magenoke tolcho'a Mageni ulfinniki leellammake duunkaanibaa iyyedaga gophoole ifike ardi giddii'n fulowwaal› hiyyeen hite kuli.<verse eid="LEV 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Munde Indabaashsha Hoyya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 17:10" />«Huuni Isira'eeliki manji yookaani ardiinxe oddo'ni hedhaaki keesuntichchi munde cingitebaaka maala itoole uudee'na isinni ane'ne elabaan; okkone manjonna anke manjishsha uudabo'non.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Dada. 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-29">Lew. 7:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Lan. 12:16</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15:23</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11" />Hedho afeechchi duuchchixxi lubbo hexxeeki munde giddo kaddemmaxxe tolchimalcho'ni dunendeexxi munde duuchcha cubbo biratee kaddaashsha Mageni ajaje'een; munde hedhote kaddemmaxxe cubbo bidhdhinaachchon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:22">Ibr. 9:22</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 17:12" />Tennexxee Isira'eelike ardi'a hiyyaannexxi ha'nonaa'ni mittikinna, yookaan oddo ha'nooxxe'ni hexxaaxxe keesummanaa'ni ayyinna munde cingitebaaka maala itabaashshaten.<verse eid="LEV 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 17:13" />« ‹Huuninna Isira'eeliki manji yookaan ardiinxe oddo'ni hedhaaki keesuntichchi indaaka biniinchcha yookaani ci'a fonxore abidoole munde butta duneexxi buttina buyyowaal. <verse eid="LEV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 17:14" />Hedho afeechchi duuchchixxi lubbo hexxeeki munde giddon kaddemmaxxee Isira'eelika arda munde cingitebaaka maala itabaashsha ajajeenen; munde cingitebaaka maala itaaki duuchchi ifike ardi giddii'n fulowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 17:15" />« ‹Huuninna Isira'eeliki manji yookaan wele bogiki manji reyeeka yookaan biniinchi shiyeeke biniinchika maala itoole galgali qico'ni batto'aan; seemma borcedhe bisokanna anshedhowwaali; okkoo'ni battetenaa'ni ca'a hiyyaan; <verse eid="LEV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 17:16" />Biso anshedha gophe seemmatanna borcedha gophoole cubbote isi'a kaddaan› » hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LEV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Hoyyendeexxa Diipha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 18:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse, <verse eid="LEV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 18:2" />«Isira'eelixxe oose'a ‹Ani Mageno ha'nookeni. <verse eid="LEV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 18:3" />Hexxinemmake Gibtseke bogiki ardi yookaan ta'a dhaalchchisaanneke Kenaanike boga'ni hedha'neeki ardi assaaxxa busha yaane assitinoqe; seera insa'neekanna hordofinoqqen. <verse eid="LEV 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 18:4" />Aada anxa muuxxe; seera anka heqqe. Ani Mageno ho'nooken. <verse eid="LEV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 18:5" />Ani ha'no'a uwwannoxxa aadanna seera heqqe; tenne assitinoole hedho ha'nooxxa fayyilsitinaan; ani Magenoken› hiyyeen hite kuli» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:29">Neh. 9:29</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:9">Hiz. 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:11-13">20:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:28">Luq. 10:28</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:5">Rom. 10:5</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:12">Gel. 3:12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 18:6" />« ‹Huuni manjinna fira ifike kaddeexxe meyyaxxen welti yababuloqqen. Ani Magenoken.<verse eid="LEV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 18:7" />« ‹Ama atixxenni welti yababulde anna atika salphisoxxeni; ama atixxe kaddemmaxxe seemma isexxa faashshoxen.<verse eid="LEV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 18:8" />« ‹Langaxxe ama atixxenni yababulde anna atika salphisoxxen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8, </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:11">Lew. 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 22:30">Lew. 22:30</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 27:20">27:20</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 18:9" />« ‹Dayyo atixxenni yookaan, mine yookaan gadho ilendeexxe langake anna atikixxe beltonni yookaani langaxxe ama atixxixxe beltonni welti yababuldoxxen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:17">Lew. 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 27:22">Lew. 27:22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 18:10" />« ‹Salphataboxxoshsha oose atixxike dubarrinni yababuldoxxen.<verse eid="LEV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 18:11" />« ‹Langake annixxi yookaan langaxxe amaxxi belto ati'a dayyote kaddemaxxe iseni welti yababuldoxxen.<verse eid="LEV 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 18:12" />« ‹Anna atikixxi dayyo ati'a adaadate kaddemmaxxe isenni welti yababuldoxxen.<verse eid="LEV 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 18:13" />« ‹Ama atixxixxi dayyo ati'a lankaamate kaddemmaxxee isenni welti yababuldoxxen.<verse eid="LEV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 18:14" />« ‹Abbi atikixxi are ati'a abbote kaddemmaxxe isenni welti yababuldoxxen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:19-20">Lew. 20:19-20</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 18:15" />« ‹Belti atikixxi are beltote kaddemmaxe isenni welti yababuldoxxen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15, </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:1">Lew. 20:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LEV 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 18:16" />« ‹Dayyi atikixxi are ati'a herelchchote kaddemmaxxee isenni welti yababuldoxxen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16, </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:21">Lew. 20:21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 18:17" />« ‹Hossetexxe manjichchoxxe beltonni yookaan manjichchotixxe oosexxe oosen welti yababuldoxxen; insa'nenna shiqike fira atike kandemmaxxee cubbote ate'a kaddaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:14">Lew. 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 27:23">Lew. 27:23</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 18:18" />« ‹Are atixxi lubboti hexxee'na dayyo isexxi ise'a ginate kaddabaashsha dayyo isexxa aaxxoxeni; isenninna yababuldoxxen.<verse eid="LEV 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 18:19" />« ‹Melaalletixxe aadani hexxeexxi dubarte battooteexxe kaddemmaxxee isenni welti dhiiphphoxen.<verse eid="LEV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 18:20" />« ‹Wele manjixe areni yababulde ifi battesitoxxeni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:10">Lak. 20:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 18:21" />« ‹Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Magenika summa yowwisaboxxoshsha oose atixxenaa'ni mittetanna Moolekite hinaake dharichcha mageni'a ciincatike tolcha kaddo'a uutoxxen; ani Magenoken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:1-5">Lew. 20:1-5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 18:22" />« ‹Magenii edo jibbendeexe yaane kaddemmaxxee labbaki melaalleti welti diinphammashsha labbaken diiphphoxxen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22, </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:13">Lew. 20:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 18:23" />« ‹Labbake kade meyyaxxi huuni manjinna biniinchikinna horik diiphphe ifi battoosoqqen; iitta hexxeexxi yaane dadatika seera balleessitaaxen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:19">Fula. 22:19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:15-16">Lew. 20:15-16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 27:21">Lew. 27:21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 18:24" />« ‹Boga adde uwwemake'ni hedheeki ardi ifi battoossemashsha okkone mannixxe aada'ni galdine ifi battoossitinoqen; Mageni boga okkonenaa'ni insa'ne balleesse bira'neeki, ha'no boga okkone'ni aagginaashaten. <verse eid="LEV 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 18:25" />Balleessa isexxenaa'ni kexxeexxa bogi battoo'een; Magenikinna mufeti boga insa'neeka ganennen; bogikinna insa'nee hoo'o hiyye tuffeen. <verse eid="LEV 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 18:26" />Ajajanna seera anka saxxinoqen; ha'notenna kadi ha'nooxxe oddo'ni hedhaaki wele bogiki manni tenne batte yaanuwwanaa'ni mittetanna assoqen. <verse eid="LEV 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 18:27" />Boga okkone'ni hedha'neeki manni tenne battuwwa yaane duuchcha asse boga battoose'en. <verse eid="LEV 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 18:28" />Boga okkone'ni hedha'neeka manna bogi hoo'o hiyye tufemmashsha ha'noo hoo'o hiyye tufabaan.<verse eid="LEV 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 18:29" />« ‹Tenne batte yaanuwwa assaaki ikki manji ifike ardi giddii'n fulowaal. <verse eid="LEV 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 18:30" />Magenikinna ajaja anka duuchcha muuxxe; ha'no edi gama bogake'ni hedhemmaki manni assammaxxa battitte aada hordoffinoqen; tenne salphitte yaanuwwanaa'ni mittetanna assitine ifi batteessitinoqen; ani Mageno ha'nookeni› » hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LEV 19" />
  <para style="s1">Murtetixxanna Woyyummatika Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 19:1" />Mageni Muuse, <verse eid="LEV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 19:2" />«Isira'eelike ardi'a: ‹Ani ha'nooki Mageni woyyichchake kadennaxxee ha'nonna woyyoomme.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:44-45">Lew. 11:44-45</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:16">1 Phex. 1:16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 19:3" />« ‹Ha'nonaa'ni mitti mittiniingi anna isikanna ama isixxa ulfeesowaal. Ajajeneshshani sanbata ulfeese ani Mageno ha'nooken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8">Fula. 20:8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 5:12">Lew. 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16">16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 19:4" />« ‹Wele mageno magenonfatatiba higginoqen; yookaan sibilo miseke'ni fakke wele magenuwwiinxa giissitinoqen; ani ho'nooke Magenon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4, </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:15-16">Lew. 20:15-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:19-20">Lan. 5:19-20</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 19:5" />« ‹Mittoomiinka tolcha tolchitato wodda uwwenneka seera heqqi; tolchake'ninna ani gammadanon. <verse eid="LEV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 19:6" />Hori dulemeexxe barra'ni yookaan langa baro maala indowaal; sakka baro geyeexka giirate'ni gubbe. <verse eid="LEV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 19:7" />Sakka baro indoole batto'eeke kademmaxxee tolchi ikki anee gammachchiisaakebaan; <verse eid="LEV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 19:8" />Ookkone maalanna itaaki huuni manjinna ani'a woyyonsemeeka tufatendeexxe yaaneshsha uudemmaxxee cubbote isi'a kaddaan; isinna ifike ardi giddii'n fulowaal.<verse eid="LEV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 19:9" />« ‹Midha bukki assitinnaa wodda gabalate'ni hexxeexxa midha haandinoqqeni; haandinaa'na gatteexa deegge bukki assate udumi'a higginoqen; <verse eid="LEV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 19:10" />Woyine bukki assitato wodda daaloke'ni gateeka yookaan butta harca'eeka qocatee illeema udumi'a higgoxxen; gateeka duuchcha hiyyeeyyeeteenna keesummatee waali; ani Mageno ha'nooken.<verse eid="LEV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 19:11" />« ‹Moortinoqen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:11">« ‹Sobbinoqen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:11">« ‹Dhara haasottinoqen.<verse eid="LEV 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 19:12" />« ‹Summi ankenni kakatinoqen; Mageni ha'nokika summa diqqeesitinoqen; ani Mageno ha'nooken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:7">Fula. 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 5:11">Lew. 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:33">Mat. 5:33</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 19:13" />« ‹Olla'a atike'ni fuggoxxa assitoxxen; yookaan karra isixxa ifi'a adhdhitoxxen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:13">« ‹Rundiki hujisseteke manjiki rundi atiba mitte hashshanna galoqqen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:14-15">Lew. 24:14-15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 19:14" />« ‹Mansha laqabaaka yowwitoxxe; ille afabaaki edo gugufataashsha misechcho isi edo uggitoxxe; Mageno sodaat; ani Mageno atiken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:18">Lew. 27:18</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 19:15" />« ‹Murte uutinaa wodda addatendineekenna dhugaatike kadde; duuchchinge toggi assitine murte uwwe malee hiyyeessa hiyyuma isixxe hitine miiccinoqen; dureessa durumma isixxe hitine sodaattinoqen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:6-8">Fula. 23:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:19">Lew. 16:19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 19:16" />« ‹Ardiinxe oddo'ni mammarenda'ni summa manjiinka ballesitaaxxa odo odeessitoxxe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:16">« ‹Murteti mini edo manjo mitte reyaashsha murro'a dhara dhugaate assite kuldoxxen; ani Mageno atiken.<verse eid="LEV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 19:17" />« ‹Dayyo atika jibbitoxxen; olla'ake'ni balleessa geessisaa wodda gorsi; isinni welti balleessanjoke kaddaboxxoshsha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mat. 18:15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 19:18" />« ‹Hoone manjo'ninna halo fuldoxxxe; ayye'ninna halo abidoxxen; yaane kinni ifi eetattashshan olla'a atika eeyyi; ani Mageno atiken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:43">Mat. 5:43</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:19">19:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:39">22:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:31">Mar. 12:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:27">Luq. 10:27</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Rom. 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 5:14">Gel. 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:8">Ya'i. 2:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 19:19" />« ‹Ajaja anka heqqe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:19">« ‹Mitte hore wele hore'n horsiisoxxeni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:19">« ‹Mitte ficha'ni lame gargari hexxeexxa sanne rokkoxxen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:19">« ‹Lame gargar hexxeexxe yaaneni giissineexxa seemma oddo'witoxxen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:9-11">Lew. 22:9-11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 19:20" />« ‹Mitti manji welekee uwendeexxe garbite dubarichchon welti yababuloole, ikki uwwendemmaki manji maallaqqa uwwa gophoolenna garbitte dubarrichchonna isen yababulemmaki manjichchi mura wonxaan; yaane kinni dubarrichcho garbummatenaa'ni fula gophphemmaxxee lamiinge'ni reyotixxa murte ibinsabaan. <verse eid="LEV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 19:21" />Tenne balleessa balleesseeki manji cubbo biratee labbaka gedhechcho Mageni ulfinniki leellammake duunkaanibaa iyyedagowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 19:22" />Qeesichchikinna okkone manjixxa cubbo konne labbake gedhechchike tolchinni biraan; Magenikinna cubbo isixxa gattowwaal hiyyaani.<verse eid="LEV 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 19:23" />« ‹Kanaanike boga'ni aaggine hooneenna gumma uwwaachcho kaassinoole sase wogga qico'ni uwwaaxxa gumma ita hoyyendeexxe kaddeexxa kassi hiyye. Tenne sase wogga giddo gumma ittinoqen. <verse eid="LEV 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 19:24" />Sholgaxxe woggaxxi gumma ane Mageno galateeffatinaaxxe kaddo'a ani'a gargari hexxeexxe uwwa kadduuni. <verse eid="LEV 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 19:25" />Ondixxe wogga'ni kinni gumma ittinaan; tenne assitinoole yanna yanna'ni gumma itti ha'no'a bira saxxa'ni me'itaan; ani Mageno ha'nookeni.<verse eid="LEV 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 19:26" />« ‹Munde cingitebaaka maala ittinoqen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:26">« ‹Durrisiinxa huje hordofinoqeni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Dada. 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Lew. 7:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Lan. 12:16</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15:23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:10">18:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 19:27" />« ‹Umo ha'nookika qarqara qooxo haaxxitinoqen; areeda ho'nooka haruunsitine woxxinoqen; <verse eid="LEV 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 19:28" />Biso ha'nooke'ni niqqisaate naqqalsitinoqen; yookaani reyeeke manji'a ifi cidhdhitinoqen; ani Mageno ha'nooken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:5">Lew. 21:5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 14:1">Lew. 14:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 19:29" />« ‹Butta yabaabulletinna battummati wo'mitabaashsha miyyaxxi atixxi belto dharichcha magenuwwaa magenonfanta'ni yababullammaba marte yababuldo'a wocci assite waaldoxen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:17">Lew. 23:17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 19:30" />« ‹Sanbata ulfeesse; woyyichcha anka mine ulfeesse; ani Magenoken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:2">Lew. 26:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 19:31" />« ‹Ekedha haasosamma manna yookaani morammake mannika gorsa laqqinoqen; tenne assistinoole battootinaan; ani Mageni ha'nooke Magenon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:11">Lew. 18:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:3">1 Sam. 28:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:4">2 Moy. 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:19">Isa. 8:19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 19:32" />« ‹Geedhe lumolla daggaa'na uuddotole ofoldetebaa'ni qophphi hite kexxe ulfeessi; aneenna Mageno atika sodaati; ani Magenoken.<verse eid="LEV 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 19:33" />« ‹Boga ha'nooke'ni ha'noni wele bogiki manni hedha'noole miiccinoqen. <verse eid="LEV 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 19:34" />Gode ha'nooxxe Isira'eelike manji'a assitinammashshannii eloxxa insa'ne'anna asse. Umo ifikishsha assitine eeyye; ha'nonna konnechchi edi darre Gibtseke boga'ni keesummate kaddine hexxinemmaxxa qalli hiyye; ani Mageni ha'nooke Magenon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:21">Fula. 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:17-18">Lew. 24:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 27:19">27:19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 19:35" />« ‹Qeerriniinke mikisanjini, adhdhuuriinke mikisanjininna dunemaachchiike mikisanjini manjo miiccinoqen. <verse eid="LEV 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 19:36" />Dhugaatika mikisanjuwwa: qeerrinika, adhdhurriinkanna dunemaachchika miyyuwwa horatte; Gibtseke boginaa'ni ha'noo fulchchenneki ani Magenoken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:13-16">Lew. 25:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 20:10">Mam. 20:10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LEV 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 19:37" />« ‹Uwwenneke ajaji'aanna seeri duuchchi'a addatemme. Ani Magenoken› » hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LEV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ajajema Gopha Idaggaaxxa Mura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 20:1" />Mageni Muuse: <verse eid="LEV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 20:2" />«Isera'eelika arda ha'notenna kadi ha'nooxxe oddo'ni hedhaaki wele bogiki manji ayyinna Moleekite hinaaka mageno magenonfatatee oose isixxenaa'ni tolchakee uwwoole ardi Isira'eeliki okkone manjo kinoti cancaqe shiyowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 20:3" />Ayyi manjinna oose isixxenaa'ni mitte Moleeki'a sa'isse uwwe woyyichcha seemmati giissineeka fooqo anka batteesoolenna woyyichcha summa anka yowwisoole ikki manji uudee'na isinni ane'ni elabaan; manji ankishshanna uudabo'non. <verse eid="LEV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 20:4" />Yaane kinni ikki manji asseexxa duuchcha ardi maa ane dhibe hiyye waaloolenna iso kinoti cancaqe shiya gophphoole, <verse eid="LEV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 20:5" />Ani umo anke'ni okkone manjo'ninna mini hado isike duuchcha'ni ittani ane'ni addatema gophe Moleeki magenoonfatati isinni welti mittoomaake duuchcha'ni farra elobaaxxa idaganon; okkonechchi udumi'a ifike ardi giddii'n fulowaal.<verse eid="LEV 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 20:6" />«Huuni manjinna gorsa laqedho'a ekedha haasosamma mannanna moraake manniba maroole okkone manjo'ni mufatanon; ifike ardi giddii'n fulowal; <verse eid="LEV 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 20:7" />Ani Mageni ha'nooke Magenon; hedho ha'nooxxa ani'a gargar footine ifi woyyoonse; <verse eid="LEV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 20:8" />Seeruwwa anka saxxinoqen; ani ha'noo woyyonsanoke ha'nooke Magenon» hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 20:9" />« ‹Ayyinna anna yookaan ama yowwoole shiwwe; anna yookaani ama yowwemmaxxee reyo ifi'a mudhdheeki isonden.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:17">Lew. 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:4">Mat. 15:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:10">Mar. 7:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 20:10" />« ‹Mitti manji wele manjixxe arenni yababuloole yabaabulemmakanna yabaabuldemaxxa lamiinga shiwwe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Fula. 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:20">Lew. 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 5:18">Lew. 5:18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LEV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 20:11" />« ‹Manji mitti anna isikixxe arenni diiphoole anniinka biso saali belo gatisemmaxxe isonna manjichcho eettene shiwwe; reyotixxi murtenna uwwendeechchi balleessa insa'nexxinniteni.<verse eid="LEV 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 20:12" />« ‹Mitti manji beltiinxe arenni diiphoole lamiinga shiwwe; maalinxa firunte yabaabulati battoosinemmaxxee reyo insa'neexxe laqemmaaki insa'nenden.<verse eid="LEV 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 20:13" />« ‹Mitti labbaki labbakinni melaalleti diiphammashsha diiphoole battitte yaane assinemmaxxee lamiinga shwwe; reyo insa'neexxe laqemmaaki isna'nenden.<verse eid="LEV 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 20:14" />« ‹Mitti manji amatanna belto aadhoole assineexxe fuggoxxe huje'a sasiinga giirati gubbine shiwwe; iitta hexxeexxi yaane oddo ha'nooxe'ni kadiyyo hasissabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:17">Lew. 18:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 27:23">Lew. 27:23</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 20:15" />« ‹Manji mitti mayyaxxeni diiphammashsha meyyake horini afemoole isoonna okkone hore shiwwe.<verse eid="LEV 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 20:16" />« ‹Mitte meyyaxxi manjo labbake manjini dhiiphphamashsha labbake horini afendoole iseenna hore okkone shiwwe; reyo insa'neexe laqemmaaki insa'nenden.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:19">Fula. 22:19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:23">Lew. 18:23</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 27:21">Lew. 27:21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 20:17" />« ‹Manji mitti dayyoti yookaan anniinbaa'ni yookaani amati darree'ni dayyote kaddaaxxa aadhe isenni diiphoole, tinni shookishshaaxxe yaane kaddemmaxxe ardi giddii'n fullowaal; dayyoti welti diiphemmaxxe'e cubbote isi'a kaddaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:9">Lew. 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 27:22">Lew. 27:22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 20:18" />« ‹Manji mitti melaalletixxi aada dagge saxxebaaxxe yanna'n mayyaxini diiphoole melaalletixxe aadaka ulfinna shollinsemmaxxee lamiingi ifike ardi giddii'n fullowwaal.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:19">Lew. 18:19</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LEV 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 20:19" />« ‹Manji mitti adaadati yookaani lankaamati diiphoole maalinxa firunte diingemmaxxee lamiingi farrinaan.<verse eid="LEV 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 20:20" />« ‹Manji mitti abbiinxe arenni diiphoole abbo isika salphisemmaxxee cubbote insa'ne'a kaddaan; ilabelonna gantaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:12-14">Lew. 18:12-14</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LEV 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 20:21" />« ‹Manji mitti dayyiinxa are aadhoole, tinni battooteexxe yaane kaddaan; dayyo isika salphisemmaxxee manjichchotinna isi ila belo gantaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:16">Lew. 18:16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 20:22" />« ‹Magenikinna dhaaldinaashsha assanneki Kanaaniki bogi ha'noo hoo'o hiyye tufabaashsha seeranna aada anxa heqqe; <verse eid="LEV 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 20:23" />Ha'no edii'ni shorraanneke ardixa aada hordofinoqen; tenne yaane duuchcha assinemmaxe insa'ne jibbeenen. <verse eid="LEV 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 20:24" />Yaane kinni boga insa'neeka dhaaldinaani; malebikinna ado callini wo'mmeka boga dhaaldinaashsha uwwaanen; wele ardinaa'ni gargari higginaashsha assenneki ani Mageno ha'nooken.<verse eid="LEV 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 20:25" />« ‹Tennexxee fayyakenna batto'eeke horixxenna ca'axxe oddo'ni gargarunte ugge; ani battitteteni hiyye foye ege'nishennexxenna buttate'ni hedheeke biniinchchuwwini, ci'uwwanninna wele yaanuwwa duuchchani ifi battositinoqen; <verse eid="LEV 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 20:26" />Ani Mageni woyyichchake kadennaxxeenna ha'no anke arda kaddinaashsha arda welenaa'ni foyeennen, tennexxee ha'nonna woyyoomme.<verse eid="LEV 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 20:27" />« ‹Labbaki yookaan meyyaxxi ekedha haasossaaka yookaan moraaka kingiki cancaqine shiwwe; reyotixxi murte uwwendeeki balleessa insa'neexxeeten› » hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 20:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LEV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Qeesotake Uwwendeexxa Akeette</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 21:1" />Mageni Muuse «Ardiinxe oddonaa'ni reyeeke manjika rensha tunqe battonabaashsha Aaroonixxe ila kaddeexxe qeesole'a kuli; <verse eid="LEV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 21:2" />Firunteti shiqaakika anniinka, amatika beltiinka, beltotika, dayyiinka, <verse eid="LEV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 21:3" />Yookaan herundebaaxxe dayyoka malee, <verse eid="LEV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 21:4" />Heerumikinna aadhati firoomeeke manjika rensha tunqe ifi batteessinoqen.<verse eid="LEV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 21:5" />«Qeesoti reyeeke manji'a yaadati umo haaxxinoqen; areeda haruunsine woxxe'noqeni; alba insa'neekanna hoqe'noqen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:27-28">Lew. 19:27-28</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 14:1">Lew. 14:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 21:6" />Ciincatika tolchanna midhatixa uwwa ani'a Mageno isa'neeke shiqinshaammaxxee woyyoomowwaal; summa ankanna battoosinoqen. <verse eid="LEV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 21:7" />Qeesoti Mageno insa'neeke foyeme woyyomemmaxxee yabaabulto dubarte, yookan dubarumma belleesineexxa dubarte, yookaan gursumeecho aadhoqqe; <verse eid="LEV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 21:8" />Ardikinna qeesichchi woyyichchake kadeexxa ege'nowaal isi ani'a Mageno ha'nooke midhatika tolcha shiqisha'neeken; woyyonsaanneki ani Mageni ha'nooki woyyichchaken; <verse eid="LEV 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 21:9" />Qeesetixxi belto yababuldoole anna salphisaan; iseenna giirati gumbe shinnowaal.<verse eid="LEV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 21:10" />«Qeesotiinki sooreessi hariirtetixxe zayiten hariiremeekinna qeessummitixxa seemma oddo'wo'a woyyoomeeke kademmaxxee manji reyaa wodda yaaddo ege'nishate umo isika haaxxoqen; seemmatanna daroqqen; <verse eid="LEV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 21:11" />Hoone manjiki renshi anniinkenna kadi amatiki renshshi hedheeke miniba mare ifi batteessoqen; <verse eid="LEV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 21:12" />Anxi Mageno isikixxi qeesomiinxi woyyumma iso'ni hana hexxemmaxxee woyyichcha Mageno isikike seemmati giissineeke fooqinaa'ni fule renshi hedheeke mine'ni e'ye ifi battosoqen; ani Magenoken. <verse eid="LEV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 21:13" />Duuddo dubarricho aadhowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 21:14" />Aro'i reeyeexxa yookaan gursimeelchcho yookaan dubarrumma isexxa balleessineexxa dubarrichcho yookaan yabaabulto dubarte aadhoqqe; duuddo dubarrichcho gosa isixxenaa'ni aadhowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 21:15" />Duuddo dubarricho aadha gophoole oose isixxi battotaani; woyyonsaanneki ante Magenoken» hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 21:16" />Mageni Muuse: <verse eid="LEV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 21:17" />«Aarooni'ni ‹Sanne atixxenaa'ni kooko'ichchi huuni manjinna anee ifike Mageni'a midhatika tolcha shiqishoqqe'e; tinni aadanna dagaake baro duuchcha'n heqqendeeshshanni hexxowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 21:18" />Kooko'ichchi manji ikkinna ille ba'eeki, yookaan naafeeki, bifa yookaan dhagga ba'eeki, <verse eid="LEV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 21:19" />Anga enqemeeki yookaan lekka enqemeeki, <verse eid="LEV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 21:20" />Xukkeeki yookaan hara haru'meeki manji illetixxa dhibo yookaan gargari gargariti hexxeexxa bisiinxa dhibe afeeki yookaan meyya labbichchi ani'a Magenokee itatika tolcha shiqishoqqen. <verse eid="LEV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 21:21" />Qeesichcho Aaroonixxe sanne giddii'ni kooko'ichchi huuni manjinna ciincatika tolcha yookaan midhatixxa uwwa Mageno isike shiqisha dande'abaan. <verse eid="LEV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 21:22" />Yoona iitta hedheeki manji lamiinxe itanaa'ni woyyootteexxanna hara woyyootteexxa itatixxa uwwa ita dande'aan; <verse eid="LEV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 21:23" />Yaane kinni kooko'ichchake kademmaxxee woyyichcha golliba yookan tolchimalchiibaa shiqoqen; tenne woyyosedhenneexxa yaanuwwa battoossa hasisabaan; insa'neenna woyyosedhenneki ante Duuchchi Woddike Goottan› hite kuli» hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 21:24" />Muusenna tenne duuchcha Aarooni'ni, Aaroonixxe oose'ninna arda Isira'eelike duuchcha'ni kule.<verse eid="LEV 21:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LEV 22" />
  <para style="s1">Uwwa Mageni Adhdhaaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 22:1" />Mageni Muuse, <verse eid="LEV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 22:2" />Aarooniinna oose isixxa «Woyyichcha summa anka battoossitinabaashsha, Isira'eelixxi oose foote ani'a shiqishshaaxxa uwwa duuchcha ulfinniki aadhdhe; ani Magenoken. <verse eid="LEV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 22:3" />Isira'eelixi oose ani'a gargari foote shiqishsheexxe woyyite uwwaba qeesotiinke min hadinaa'ni ayyinna batto'eeki shiqoole Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edii'n fugusemeba'owwaal; tinni aadanna dagaake baro duuchcha'ni heqqende hexxaan; Ani Magenoken.<verse eid="LEV 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 22:4" />«Aaroonixxe ilanaa'ni huuni manjinna mundiinka dhukkuba yookaan bisokenaa'ni fulaaka shamina afeeki battooma bidhdha qico'ni heeneenna woyyitee uwwa itoqqen. Renshi tuqee'na battooteexxa yaane tuqeeki yookaan finnake kadammaki wodi'i fule shansheeki, <verse eid="LEV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 22:5" />Iittani batto'eeka biniincha yookaan batto'eeka manjo tuqaaki; <verse eid="LEV 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 22:6" />Huuni qeesichchinna tenne yaanuwwa tuqaaki hashshi qico'ni batto'aan; biso isika wodi'iki anshedhaaxxee woyyitte uwwa itoqqen. <verse eid="LEV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 22:7" />Arishsho e'yiteechchi uduma kinni battooma bidhdhammaxee isika qoobbo woyyitte midhatixxa uwwa ita dande'aan; <verse eid="LEV 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 22:8" />Reyeeka yookaan biniinchi shiyeeke horika maala itoqqen; iso itoole batto'aan; ani Magenoken.<verse eid="LEV 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 22:9" />«Qeesoti duuchchi ani uwwennexxa aadatixxa akeette heqqedhowaal; tenne assa gophoole kinni woyyichcha ajajixxe akeette'a ajajema gophemmaxxee balleessate kaddee'na reyaan; woyyonsaanneki ante Magenoken.<verse eid="LEV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 22:10" />«Woyyotteexxa uwwa ita dande'aaki qeesichchiinke mini hado kadeeke manjo callan; weli manji kinni itoqqen; qeesichchiinxe keesumma kadeeki yookaan rundake hujaaki manji itoqqen. <verse eid="LEV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 22:11" />Qeesichchi maallaqqiki hedheeki yookaan mine isike'ni ilemeeki erganji kinni qeesichchiinka qoobbo itowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 22:12" />Qeesichchoke kadebaake manjo'ni heerundeexxi qeesichchiinxi belto woyyitte uwwa ittoqen. <verse eid="LEV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 22:13" />Yaane kinni anno ildebaangi aro'i reyeexxi yookaan aro'o waalde anniinke mine'ni hexxaaxxi belto qeesichchiinxi belto oosumate'ni assitammashsha anniinka qoobbo woyyitte uwwa ittowaal; kaddolenna qeesichchiinka mini hado male weli manji woyyitte uwwa itoqqen.<verse eid="LEV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 22:14" />«Qeesichchiinke mini hado kadebaaki ayyi manji ege'nebaangi woyyotteexxa uwwa itoole eettene itaka wo'ma hiranna onde anganaa'ni mitte anga lebe qeesichchokee hiissowaali. <verse eid="LEV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 22:15" />Isira'eeliki ardi Magenokee idagaaxxa woyyitte uwwa qeesoti, <verse eid="LEV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 22:16" />ita hoyyemeeki manji ito'a uwwe battoossoqen; iitta hexxeexxi yaanne okkone manjo mura woxaashsha assitaan; uwwa duuchcha woyyoonsannoki ante Magenoken» hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 22:17" />Mageni Muuse: <verse eid="LEV 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 22:18" />Aarooniinna Isira'eelika arda duuchcha «Isira'eeliki manji yookaan Isira'eelike ardixxe oddo'ni hedhaaki keesuntichchi werreegi werreegemmaki muuxemee'na yookaan eeyyante isixxinni ciincatika tolcha shiqishoole, <verse eid="LEV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 22:19" />Tolchikinna adhdhemaashsha mitte fayyaka gedhechcho yookaan recco labbake kadowwaali. <verse eid="LEV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 22:20" />Hooneenna batto'eeka hore shiqishinoole Mageni adhdhabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20, </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:1">Lew. 17:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 22:21" />Ayyi manjinna worreegi muuxemee'na yookaan eeyyanete ifixxenni mittoomiinka tolcha Magenokee shiqishoole, Mageni edo adhdhemaashsha shiqishaaki fayyake kadowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 22:22" />Balla'a, enqemeeka yookaan naafa yookaan malaata'neexxa mada afeeka, qanxo yookaan fissi hiyyeechcho afeeka hooneenna hore Magenoke tolcha assite shiqishshoxxen; iitta hedheeka hore tolchimalchoke'n itatike tolcha assite shiqishshoxen. <verse eid="LEV 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 22:23" />Kooko'ichcha yookaan dhagga ba'eeka hore fedhi ifixxike tolcha assine shiqisha dandesissan; yaane kinn werreegemmaxxi yaane muuxendeeki manji iitta hedheeka hore tolchake asse shiqisho'a dande'abaan. <verse eid="LEV 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 22:24" />Boga atike'ni midhatte miidhendeeka yookaan afebaaka hore Magenokee tolchake assite shiqishshoxxeni.<verse eid="LEV 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 22:25" />«Wele bogike manjika hore Magenoke tolchake assite shiqishshoxen; iitta hedheeki horuwwi batto'eeshsha laakko'emammaxxee Mageni edo adhdhemabaan.»<verse eid="LEV 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 22:26" />Mageni Muuse, <verse eid="LEV 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 22:27" />«Jabbe yookaan gedhebiinxi yookaan re'etixxi beltanna ilendaa wodda torbaane barra amati turtowwaal; saddeteessoxxe barranaa'ni ke'issine Magenoke ciincatike tolcha assine shiqisha dandesissaan. <verse eid="LEV 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 22:28" />Saayya jabbeti welti, gedhechcho beltanjoti welti yookaan recco beltanjoti welti mitte barra'ni tolchitoxxen; <verse eid="LEV 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 22:29" />Magenoke galatiinka tolcha shiqishshatto wodda Mageni edo adhdhemaashsha akeette aadatixxa heqqi; <verse eid="LEV 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 22:30" />Langa bari'a galchiteboxxongi duuchchiinga tolchemeexxe barra'ninni ite biri; ani Magenoken» hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 22:31" />Mageni «Ajaja anka muuxxe; ani Magenokeni; <verse eid="LEV 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 22:32" />Woyyichcha summa anka salphisinoqen; Isira'eeliki ardi duuchchi ani woyyichchake kadennexxa ege'ne ulfeessowaal; woyyoonsanoki ante Magenoken; <verse eid="LEV 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 22:33" />Mageno ha'nooke kadonnaa'a Gibtseke boganaa'ni fulchchenneki ani Magenoken» hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 22:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LEV 23" />
  <para style="s1">Ayyaana Hitta Ulfeesinaaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 23:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse hiyyee qic, <verse eid="LEV 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 23:2" />«Isira'eelike ardi'a Woyyomeeke hite lassitatoki: ‹Ank Mageniinki ayyaani konnechchin butti'a hedheeken.<verse eid="LEV 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 23:3" />« ‹Huje hujjinaaxxi jaane barra hexxeeni; torbeessoxxi sanbatiinxi barra kinni hafuura adhdhatixxe barran. Ettene barra magenonfachchote bukki hiyye male mitte hujenna hujjinoqen; hexxinaaxxe bakka duuchcha'ni sanbati Magenokee woyyoondeexxe barran.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8-10">Fula. 20:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:12">23:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:15">31:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:21">34:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 35:2">35:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 5:12-14">Lew. 5:12-14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 23:4" />« ‹Konnechchinni butti'a hedheeka ayyanuwwa'ni Mageni edo bukki hiyyati uwwendeexxe barra'ni ulfeessitinaan.<verse eid="LEV 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sa'atikanna Kebbotika Ayyaana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 28:16-25">Lak. 28:16-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 23:5" />« ‹Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ulfesemaaki Sa'atiki ayyaani woggatike siretike agenjo'ni tommenna sholgeesoxxe barra'ni arshsho e'yitee'na siphphi siphphi hiyyaa wodda kadaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-13">Fula. 12:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:1-2">Lew. 16:1-2</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 23:6" />Tommenna ondeessoxxe barranaa'ni Duuchchi Woddik Goottik kebbotiki ayyani kadaan eettene barranaa'ni torbaane barra qico'ni gamami e'yebaaxxa kebbo ittinaan. <verse eid="LEV 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 23:7" />Tenne barruwwanaa'ni siretixxe barra'ni magenonfachchotte bukki hitinaan; barrate'ni huccitinaaxxe yaanenaa'ni tenne barra'ni mittetanna huccitinabaan. <verse eid="LEV 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 23:8" />Torbaane barra qico'ni ciincatika tolcha Magenokee shiqishshe; barratixxa huje hucca waaldine torbaxxe barra'ni magenoonfachchottee bukki hitinaan.› »<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:14-20">Fula. 12:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:15">23:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:18">34:18</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:3-8">Lew. 16:3-8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tommitte Uwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 23:9" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse hiyyee qici, <verse eid="LEV 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 23:10" />«Isira'eelike ardi'a hite haasotato qici: ‹Ani Mageni uwwaanneke boga'ni e'yitine midha hujjine bukki assitina wodda siretixxa ladde qeesichchokee uwwe; <verse eid="LEV 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 23:11" />Mageni uwwa ha'nooxxa adhdhaashsha qeesichchi ladde Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a lele'misatike tolcha asse shiqishaan. Qeesichchikinna tenne shiqishiyyo hasissaaki sanbatake'ni itti aandaaxxe barra'niten. <verse eid="LEV 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 23:12" />Lele'misatika tolcha shiqishinaaxxe barra eettene'ninni xure itteeka afebaaka wogga mitteka gedhebiinka buruusa ciincatike tolcha assitine shiqishshe. <verse eid="LEV 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 23:13" />Isinni welti ejeersiinxa zayiteni qushshineexxa lame kiilo shiqinshshe danneexxa bulle itatike tolcha assitine shiqishshe; tinninna fishshe Mageno gammachchiisaake tolcha kadaan; isinni welti mitte leetiro kaddaaka woyinetika bulbulo uwwate assitine shiqishshinaan. <verse eid="LEV 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 23:14" />Tenne uwwanna Magenoke uutinebaangi edissine haandineexxe midhanaa'ni inqaxxa yookaan ayendeexxa yookaan buulle kebbissine ittinoqen. Kunni seeri dagaake baro'ni oose ha'nooxxixxe oose duuchcha'ni heqqemowaal.<verse eid="LEV 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Midha Aasseccatika Ayyaana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 28:26-31">Lak. 28:26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 23:15" />« ‹Ladde Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a lele'misatike tolcha assitine shiqishinemmake sanbatanaa'ni ke'isitine torbaane sanbata laakko'we; <verse eid="LEV 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 23:16" />Torbeessoke sanbati uduma onde tommeessoxxe barra'ni higgeeni haaroba midhatixxa uwwa Magenokee shiqishinaan; <verse eid="LEV 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 23:17" />Mitti mittingi mini hadi lame lame kebbo lele'misatike tolcha asse Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqishowaal; mitte mittenda gamami e'yeexxa kebbo lame kiilo shiqqinshe danneexxa bulle ra'issine haaroxxe midhaxxe aasseccaa Magenokee umiinxe uwwa assitine shiqishshe. <verse eid="LEV 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 23:18" />Kebboti welti ardi fayyaka mitte woggaka torbaane gedhebiinka buruusa, mitte jibichchanna lame korbeeyye shiqishowwaal; hori kunninna midhatixxe uwwaninna woyinetike bulbulixxe uwwani welti ciinceesinaake itatike tolcha kade shiqaan; kunni giirate'ni ciinceesinaaki tolchi Mageno gammachiisaake kadaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:16">Fula. 23:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:22">34:22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:9-12">Lew. 16:9-12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 23:19" />Okkoo'ninna cubbo biratike tolchi'a mitte labbaka recco, mittoomiinke tolchi'a mitte woggaka lame gedhebiinka buruusa shiqishshe; <verse eid="LEV 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 23:20" />Qeesichchikinna umiixxe midhani ra'issineexxa kebbo lame buruusinni welti Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a lele'misatike tolcha asse shiqishaan; isenna qeesotiinke qoobbo kadaan; tinni uwwanna woyyooteexxeni. <verse eid="LEV 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 23:21" />Itti barra magenonfachchotixxe barra kaddaashsha lassitinaan; mitte hujena hujjinoqen; tinninna hexxinaake boga duuchcha'ni oose ha'nooxixxe oose'ni duuchchi woddi'a aadate kadde hexxaan.<verse eid="LEV 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 23:22" />« ‹Boga ha'nooke'ni midha bukki assitinaawodda fichchiinke kasinaa'ni haandinoqen; deegge gatteexxa bukki assatee udumi'a higginoqen; gateechcho hiyyeyyeteenna keesummatee waalle; ani Mageno ha'noken.› »<verse eid="LEV 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malagatinka Ayaana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 29:1-6">Lak. 29:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 23:23" />Mageni Muuse; <verse eid="LEV 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 23:24" />«Isira'eelike ardi'a: ‹Torbeessoke agenjo'ni agenji e'yeexxe taakkaxxe barra'ni Mageno magenoonfachchotee malagatiki kullaxe kassitixxe hafuura adhdhitinaaxxe barra kaddowaal. <verse eid="LEV 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 23:25" />Ettene barra'ni Magenoke ciinceesinaaka itatika tolcha shiqishshe malee ettene barra'ni mitte hujenna hujjinoqen.› »<verse eid="LEV 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cubbo Biratixxa Barra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 29:7-11">Lak. 29:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 23:26" />Mageni Muuse, <verse eid="LEV 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 23:27" />«Konne torbeessoke agenjo'ni tommessoxxe barra'ni ardiinxa cubbo biratika seera muuxxinaaxxe barran; ettene barra'ni Mageno magenonfatatee bukki hitinaan; eettene barra afo'o ha'nooke'ni maqqinaachchi hedhoqqen; Magenokeenna ciiceesinaaka itatika tolcha shiqishshe; <verse eid="LEV 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 23:28" />Mageno ha'nooki edo ardiinxa cubbo biratika seera muuxxinaaxxe barra kaddemmaxxee ettene barra'ni mitte hujenna hujjinoqen. <verse eid="LEV 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 23:29" />Ettene barra'ni huuni manjinna afo'o isike'ni mise yaane maqaaki hedhoole isinna ifike ardi giddii'ni fulowwaal <verse eid="LEV 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 23:30" />Ettene barra'ni huje hujaaki ayyinna hedhoole ardiinxe oddonaa'ni fulche lubbo balleessanon; <verse eid="LEV 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 23:31" />Tinni aadatixxi akeette hexxinaake booncho duuchcha'ni oose ha'noxxixxe oose'n heqqendee hexxaan. <verse eid="LEV 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 23:32" />Agenji e'yeexxe sallaneessoxxe barra'ni arishsho e'yiteexxe yannanaa'ni ke'isitine tommessoxxe barra'ni arishsho e'yitaaxxe yanna qico'ni ayyinna indaachcho afo'o isike'ni maqoqqen; tenne barra gargari hexxeexxe hafuura adhdhatixxe barra assitine heqqe.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:29-34">Lew. 16:29-34</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LEV 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fooqiinka Ayyana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 29:12-40">Lak. 29:12-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 23:33" />Magenikinna Muuse, <verse eid="LEV 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 23:34" />«Isira'eelixxe oose'a konne: ‹torbessoke agenjo'ni tommenna onddeesoxxe barranaa'ni torbaane barra Magenokee Fooqiinka ayyaana ulfeesitinaani. <verse eid="LEV 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 23:35" />Tenne barruwwanaa'ni siretixxa barra Mageno magenoonfatinaake ayyaana kado male mitte hujenna hujjinoqen; <verse eid="LEV 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 23:36" />Torbati giddo barra barra'ninni Magenoke ciincatika tolcha shiqishshinaan; saddeeteesso baro magenoonfachchotee bukki hitinaan; Magenoke ciinceesinaaxxe itaka tolcha shiqishshe; tinninna magenoonfachchotixxe barra kaddemmaxxe mitte hujenna hujjinoqen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:13-15">Lew. 16:13-15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 23:37" />« ‹Itatixxa uwwa, ciincatika tolcha, midhatixxa uwwa, tolchakanna ha'watixxa uwwa Magenokee shiqishshinaaxxe magenonfachchotixxe barra kaddaashsha Mageno ulfeesatee lassitinaaki ayyanuwwi konneraten. <verse eid="LEV 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 23:38" />Kunni ayyanuwwi sanbatake'ni itti lebeme ulfeesemaaken; konne ayyanuwwa'ni uutinaaxxi uwwa, duuchchi wodda uutinaaxxe uwwa'ni, werreegi muuxemee'na uutinaaxxe uwwa'ninna fedhi ha'nooxxenni uutinaaxe uwwa'ni itti lebende Magenokee shiqqaaxxen.<verse eid="LEV 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 23:39" />« ‹Boga ha'nooke'ni midha bukki assitinaa wodda torbeessoke agenjo'ni tommenna ondeessoxxe barranaa'ni ke'issitine konne Fooqiinka ayyaana Magenii edo torbaane barra qico'ni ulfeessitinaan; siretixxi barra gargari hexxeexxe hafuura adhdhatixxe barra kaddaan. <verse eid="LEV 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 23:40" />Ettene siretixxe barra'ni boga ha'nookixxe haqqenaa'ni elo eloxxa gumma, meexxetika shafa, lagiin qarqara hedhaake haqichchika shafa abiddine Mageno ha'nooka lummissina'ni ayyaana ulfeesate'ni kexxinaan. <verse eid="LEV 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 23:41" />Konne ayyaananna wogga wogga'nini torbeessoke agenjo'ni torbaxxe barra'ni ulfeesse; tinni oose ha'nooxixxe oose'ni duuchchi woddixxe aada kaddaan; <verse eid="LEV 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 23:42" />Torbaane barraa'a Isira'eeliki ardi duuchchi fooqake'ni ofo'laan; <verse eid="LEV 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 23:43" />Tennexxee ani Mageni Isira'eelika arda Gibtseke boganaa'ni fulchene wodda fooqa fooqilsina'ni he'naasha assennexa oose ha'nooxxixxi oose egendaan; ani Mageno ha'nooken.› »<verse eid="LEV 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 23:44" />Konne qicinni Muuse Mageno ulfeesatee heqqiyyo hasissaake ayyanuwwixxa akeette Isira'eelike arda'ni kule.<verse eid="LEV 23:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LEV 24" />
  <para style="s1">Xassake Hasissaaxa Xonxommachcho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 27:20-21">Fula. 27:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 24:1" />Mageni Muuse, <verse eid="LEV 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 24:2" />«Ani ulfinniki leellannake seemmati giissineeke fooqi giddo hedheeki xassi ifa'ni hedhaashsha assiyyotee Isira'eeliki ardi miinceexxa qullite ejeersiinxa zayite iyyedagaashsha ajaji. <verse eid="LEV 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 24:3" />Aarooni hashsha hashsha'ni ifina xassaan; ifi ikkinna ani ulfiniki leellannoke duunkaani giddo hedheeke Kakotike Taaboti edo hedheeke goli gadhi darre Magenii edo bogi soodaa qico'ni ifa'ni galaan; tinni dagaake baro duuchcha'ni heqqende hexxaaxxen. <verse eid="LEV 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 24:4" />Aarooninna xassi ca'itte worqeti giissineechcho'ni hana Magenii edo xo'ebaangi ifaashsha heqqaan.<verse eid="LEV 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Magenokee Shiqqaaxa Woyyitte Ita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 24:5" />«Tommenna lame kiilo danne shaqqinseexxa bulle aaxxe tommenna lame kebbo ra'issi; <verse eid="LEV 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 24:6" />Kebbotanna Magenii edo hexxeexxe worqe hana fanneexxe qore'ni jaane mitte dala'ni jaane wele dala'ni lame dala'ni uggi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:30">Fula. 25:30</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 24:7" />Giirate'ni gunbaaxxe Magenokee shiqqeexxe woyyitte kebbo kaddeexxa qabbaachisaashsha ca'ichcha ixaana lamiinge dala'ni uggi. <verse eid="LEV 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 24:8" />Aarooni Isira'eelike ardixxa bakka kebbo sanbata sanbata'ni duuchchi wodda Magenii edo uggaan. <verse eid="LEV 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 24:9" />Tinni Isira'eeliki ardi duuchchi wodda muuxa hasissaaxxe kakotixxe aadan. Iitti kebbonna Aaroonixxenna isixxe ooseke qoobbo kaddaan; insa'nenna eettenee kebbo hara woyyichcha booncho'ni indowwaal; kebbotinna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a hara woyyitte itatixxe uwwa kaddeexxi shiqqeechchi uduma qeesetike qoobbo kaddaan.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:4">Mat. 12:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:26">Mar. 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:4">Luq. 6:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Balleessana Mura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 24:10" />Amati darree'ni Isira'eelichcho, anniin darree'ni Gibtsichcho kadeeki manji Isira'eelike mannixxe oddo'ni mitte Isira'eelichchinni welti loleme; <verse eid="LEV 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 24:11" />Lolemeexxe yanna eettene'ni Mageno yowwammale Muuseba iyyedange; Amatiki isixxiki summinna Seeloomite hinaaxxe Daanike mininaa'ni Dibirixxe beltommani. <verse eid="LEV 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 24:12" />Mageni maa assinaaxxa kula qico'ni isoo abinde tursine. <verse eid="LEV 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 24:13" />Magenikinna Muuse: <verse eid="LEV 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 24:14" />«Okkone manjo olla'akenaa'ni gadhi'a fulchi; yowwaa wodda laqeeki manji duuchchi ikki manji balleesseexxa dhugaa kulaki mitti mittin manji okkone manjike umo'ni hana anga ugge dhugaa kulowaal; okkonechchi uduma Isira'eeliki ardi kinoti cancaqowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 24:15" />Ane Mageno yowwaaki huuni manjinna cubbote isi'a kaddaaxxa, Isira'eelike arda'ni kuli; <verse eid="LEV 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 24:16" />Mageno yowwaaka shiwwe; ardi duchchi kinoti cancaqqowwaal; Isira'elike manjo kado keesuntichchi Mageno yowwoole shiwwe.<verse eid="LEV 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 24:17" />«Manjo shiyaaka hoone manjonna shinnaashsha murte uwwe;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:12">Fula. 21:12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 24:18" />Wele manjika hore shiyeeki shiyeeke horixxe bakka'ni wele uwwowwaal; tinninna lubbotixxa bakka lubbo hiissatixxe aadan.<verse eid="LEV 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 24:19" />«Huuni manjinna wele manjo'ni miidhamma geesisoole ookkonengii miidhdhami iso geyowwaali; <verse eid="LEV 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 24:20" />Wele manjika micco enqoole enqekiki miccinna enqemowwaali; wele manjixxa ille balleeseekixxi illenna baxxowaal; isso enqoole isso isixxinna enqendowaali. Wele manjo'ni hoone miidhammanna geesisoole okkonengingi miidhammi iso'ni geyowwaal.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:20, </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:23-25">Fula. 21:23-25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:21">Lew. 19:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:38">Mat. 5:38</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 24:21" />Hore shiyeeki bakka okkone horixxe'ni hiissowaal; manjo shiyaaka kinni iso shinnowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 24:22" />Kunni seeri ha'no duuchchinge Isira'elike manni'aanna kadi ha'nooxxe oddo'ni hexxaaxxe keessumma duuchchi'a kadaaken; ani Mageno ha'nooken» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:16">Lak. 15:16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 24:23" />Muusenna tenne duuchcha ardakee haaso'e ke'ee wodda okkone manjo olla'in gadho fulchine kinjiki cancanqe shinne; konne qicini Isira'eeliki ardi Mageni Muuse ajajeeshshanni asse.<verse eid="LEV 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="LEV 25" />
  <para style="s1">Torbeessoxxa Wogga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 15:1-11">Lew. 15:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 25:1" />Mageni Muuse Siinaxxe kooba'ni, <verse eid="LEV 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 25:2" />«Isira'eelika arda: ‹Ani Mageni ha'no'a uwwannoke boga'ni geltinaa wodda torbessoxxe wogga'ni mittechchonna buttinake'ni hujjinebaangi ittani galchati Mageno ulfeesitinaan. <verse eid="LEV 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 25:3" />Jaane wogga giddo sanne rolkkitaton; woyineti hiddichcho kaassaton; midhatanna bukki assexxaton. <verse eid="LEV 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 25:4" />Torbeessoxxi wogga kinni ani'a Magenoke woyyooteexxe kaddee'na buttini hafuura adhdhaaxxe yanna kaddaan. Tenne wogga'ni midha rokkaboxxon; woyinetika hiddichchonna qeccaboxxon. <verse eid="LEV 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 25:5" />Ronkebaangi fuldeexxa midha haande aassexoxxen; qecemebaake woyinetike hiddichchinaa'ni gumma qoccoxen; itti wogga buttini hara hafuura adhdhaaxxe yannan. <verse eid="LEV 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 25:6" />Buttini hafuura adhdhaaxxe wogga'ni fuldaaxxi midha duuchchi ati'a, atike erganjuwwi'a, rundiki ati'a hujaakeenna keessumumma atiba ofo'leeke duuchchi'a itatee kaddaan. <verse eid="LEV 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 25:7" />Hore atikeenna buttate'ni afemaake biniinchuwi'a geltaaxxa midha alfitaton; buttini fulchaachchi duuchchi indaake kadaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:10-11">Fula. 23:10-11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gattowaalitixxa Wogga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 25:8" />« ‹Torbaanele torbaane laakkottotole duuchchiingi laakkosi shoole tommenna sallaneka kadaan; <verse eid="LEV 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 25:9" />Torbeessoke agenjixxe tommeesoxxe barra'ni itti aande hossaaxxe cubbo biratixxe barra'ni boga duuchcha'ni malagata ufuufaaka manjo ergi; <verse eid="LEV 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 25:10" />Konne qicini onde tomme wogga geltinoole bogi giddo hedhaake duuchchi'a garbuma fula lassitinaanii; edi wodda hirememmaki bogi annichchoke yookaan aante isixxee higaani; garbake kade ergatemaashsha gurguremeeki manjinna hado isikiba higaan. <verse eid="LEV 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 25:11" />Tenne onde tommeessoxxe wogga'ni midha rokkaboxxon; rokendebaangi fuldeexxa midha haa'mite aassexaboxxon yookaan qecemebaake woyinetike hiddichchonaa'ni gumma qocexxaboxxon. <verse eid="LEV 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 25:12" />Tenne onde tommeessoxxe wogga'ni wogga duuchcha woyyoteexxe wogga kaddaan; fichcha ha'nooka hunjebaangi ifittini fichchi uwwaachcho ittinaan.<verse eid="LEV 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 25:13" />« ‹Konnechchi edi darre gurguremeemmaki fichchuwwi tenne wogga'ni annichchokee higaan.<verse eid="LEV 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 25:14" />« ‹Tennexxee fira atike kadeeke Isira'eelichchokee fichhca gurgurtootole yookan hidhdhitotole isoo miiccoxen; <verse eid="LEV 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 25:15" />Fichchiinka hiranna ibinsaaki higgexxi karra hiissatixxi wogga daggebaangi fichchi midha uwwa qicinnite kaddaan. <verse eid="LEV 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 25:16" />Heddo wogga kaddoole hirikinna iittani lebaan; shiixxoxxe wogga kaddoole hirikinna iittani shiixxedhaan; hiriiniki ibishshinna fichchi midha uwwa qicinnite kadaan; <verse eid="LEV 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 25:17" />Mitti Isira'eelichchi wele Isira'eelichcho'ni fuggoxxa assoqqen; Mageno sodaatte; ani Mageno ha'nooken.<verse eid="LEV 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Torbeessoxxe Wogga'ni Geltaaxxa Rakko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 25:18" />« ‹Bogake'ni nage'iki hexxinaashsha Mageniika seeranna aada duuchcha ulfeesse; <verse eid="LEV 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 25:19" />Bogi geltaaxxa midha uwwaammaxxee ittinaachcho duuchcha alfitine elletinna nage'iki hexxinaan. <verse eid="LEV 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 25:20" />«Yaane kinni torbeessoxxe wogga'ni midha rokke bukki asse'nebo'nongi maa indano hitine qortinoole» <verse eid="LEV 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 25:21" />Jiyeessoxxe wogga'ni fichcha eebbisannon; tennexxee sase wogga'a kaddaaxxa midha fichchi uwwaan; <verse eid="LEV 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 25:22" />Saddeeteessoxxe wogga'ni midde sanne rokkinaa wodda ittinaaxxi edissine bukki assexxinemmaxxen; tenneeni okkone wodda bukki assexxinemmaxxa midha sallaneessoxxe woggaxxa midha bukki assitinaa qico'ni ittinaan.<verse eid="LEV 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Karra Hiissa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 25:23" />« ‹Fichcha duuchchi woddi'a sa'issitine gurgurtinoqen; fichchi duuchchi anke Mageniinke male ha'nookebaan; ha'no keesummatishsha huccitino'a calla uwweenen. <verse eid="LEV 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 25:24" />Fichcha gurgurtinaa wodda siretiki annichchi hiissedhdhaaxxa ege'ne.<verse eid="LEV 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 25:25" />« ‹Mitti Isira'elichchi hiyyoome fichcha gurguroole shiqike kadeeki firi isiki hiissedhiyyo hasissaan. <verse eid="LEV 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 25:26" />Hiissedha dande'aaki isiki shiqiki firi hedha gophoole kinni turena karra alfa wodda isinni hiissedhiyyo dande'aani. <verse eid="LEV 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 25:27" />Tenneenna assa dande'aaxxe yanna'ni higgexxe karra hiissinaaxxe wogga qico'ni hexxeexxa wogga laakko'e gataaka maallaqa hidhdhemmake manjichchi'a hiisse uwwe boga hiissedhowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 25:28" />Yaane kinni hiissedhate dandeessisaaka geyaaka maallaqa afa gophoole fichchi ikki higgexxe karra hiissatixxe wogga qico'ni okkone hidhdhemmange manjixxe anga'ni turo'a dande'aan. Eetene wogga'ni fichchi fichchiinke anni'a higaan.<verse eid="LEV 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 25:29" />« ‹Mitti manji dalla'a giissineeke qachchi giddo hedheeka mine isika gurguroole gurgureexxe barranaa'ni woggati qico'ni hiissedha dande'aan. <verse eid="LEV 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 25:30" />Yaane kinni woggati giddo hire hiissedha dande'a gophoole, hire hiissedhatixxa dande'a gophaani; minikinna hidhdhemmake manji'a yookaan sanne isixxe duuchchi woddixxe karra kade gataan; karra hiissatixxe wogga'ni midde gurguremmake higabaan. <verse eid="LEV 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 25:31" />Dalla'a giissinebaake olla'i giddo hedheeka mine gurguraaki fichcha gurgurrammaxxe aada'ni gurguraan; miniinki anni hiissedhate dande'aan; karra hiissatixxe wogga'ni mini ikki annichchoke higaan.<verse eid="LEV 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 25:32" />« ‹Kaddo malee Leewwito insa'ni he'neeke qachcha'ni hexxeexxa karra insa'neexxa heene yanna'ninna hiissedhate dandeenan. <verse eid="LEV 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 25:33" />Leewwito hexxeeke qachcha'ni ijaadhitaaki minuwwi Isira'eelike ardixxe oddo'ni insa'neexxe karra kade hedhaan. Qachchuwwa duuchcha'ni mitte Leewwichchi mine gurguroolenna hiissedhate dande'a gophoole karra hiissatixxe wogga'ni isi'a higaan; <verse eid="LEV 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 25:34" />Yaane kinni Leewwitotike qachchi qarqara hedheeki hore alla'linaaki diidi hara gurguremabaan; isinna duuchchi woddi'a karra insa'neexxe kadaan.<verse eid="LEV 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiyyeessakee Beenna Uwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 25:35" />« ‹Ati hexxete bira hedhaaki Isira'eelichchi umo ifika galcha dande'a gophoole ati bira shiqe hedhaashsha, shiqilsiteteke wele bogike manji'a assitataxxa isi'aanna hasissaaxxa duuchcha fedhi atixxini assi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 15:7-8">Lew. 15:7-8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 25:36" />Liqeesite dhala adhdhitoxxen; Mageno sodaatati Isira'eelichchi atibira hedhaashsha assi. <verse eid="LEV 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 25:37" />Liqeesitatoke maallaqi'a dhala laqqoxxen; indaachcho gurgurtato wodda hirtetake maallaqa'ni lebbe gurgurtoxxen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:25">Fula. 22:25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:19-20">Lew. 23:19-20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 25:38" />Kenaanika boga ha'no'a uwwonaanna Mageno ha'nooke kadonnaa Gibtseke boginaa'ni fulchchenneki ani Mageno ha'nookeni.<verse eid="LEV 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Garboole Garbumma Fulcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 25:39" />« ‹Ati bira hedha'neeki Isira'eeichchi gode atixxi hiyyeesake kade garbiinsha ati'a ergatemoo'a ifi gurguroole garbi hujaaxxa duuchcha hujaashsha assitoxxen. <verse eid="LEV 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 25:40" />Higgexxe onde tomme wogga qico'ni rundake huja'neeke erganjishsha ergatema'ni hedhuuni; <verse eid="LEV 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 25:41" />Eetene onde tommeessoxxe wogga'ni isinna oose isixxin welti atenaa'ni fule firi isikibaanna anni isikixxe karraba higaan. <verse eid="LEV 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 25:42" />Isira'eeliki ardi anke erganjon; Gibtseke boganna'ni fulchedhenneken; tennexxee garbake kade gurguremabaan. <verse eid="LEV 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 25:43" />Insa'neenna miiccamiki galchitoxen; yaane kinni anee Mageno sodaati.<verse eid="LEV 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 25:44" />« ‹Loola atike'ni hedhaake wele mannanaa'ni hasseteka labbakanna kadi meyyaxxa garba hidhdha dandeetaton. <verse eid="LEV 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 25:45" />Iittani ha'nooxxe oddo'ni hedhaake wele bogike mannixxa oose garbake assite hidhdha dandetaton; boga ha'nooke'ni ilndeexxa iitta hexxeexxa oose ifixxe karra assedha dandetinaan. <verse eid="LEV 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 25:46" />Insa'neenna geegiinsha oose ha'nooxxe sa'issa dandeetinaan; hedhotike baro insa'neeke duuchcha'ni ergatema'ni he'naan; Isira'eelichcho gode ha'nooxxenaa'ni ayyeenna miiccamiki galchitinoqen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:2-6">Fula. 21:2-6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 15:12-18">Lew. 15:12-18</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 25:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 25:47" />« ‹Mise giddo atixxe oddo'ni hedhaaki wele bogiki manji dureessake kadee'na Isira'elichchi gode atixxi hiyyoome okkone wele bogike manji'a yookaani isike mini hado mitte'a ifi garbake asse aago'a dande'aan. <verse eid="LEV 25:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 25:48" />Garbake kade gurguremeechchi uduma higgeeni garbumatenaa'ni fulo'a dande'aan; tennexxee dayyuwwa isikenaa'ni mitti isoo hiisso'a dande'aan; <verse eid="LEV 25:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 25:49" />Abbi yookaan abbiinki belti yookaan shiqike firinaa'ni mitti isoo hiisso'a dande'aan; geyaaka maallaqa qixxeesedhoole umo isinge'ni isi maallaqa hiisse garbumma fula dande'aan. <verse eid="LEV 25:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 25:50" />Tinninna kaddaa wodda edo hidhdheeke manjinni welti mari'atowwaal; isi ifi gurguremmaxxe wogganaa'ni daggaaxxe karra hiissisatixxe onde tomme wogga qico'ni hexxeexxa wogga laakkonowwaal; rundake hujaake manji'a uunaa qico uunde wogga laakkoneexe'ni hira fulchinowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 25:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 25:51" />Heddo wogga gatto'oole woggatike laakkosishshanni hira hiissowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 25:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 25:52" />Karra hiissinaaxxe onde tommessoxxe wogga qico'ni shiixxoxxi wogga gatto'ole gatteexxa wogga mitteba laakkonaan; woggatixxe birasa'neshanni hiissedhatika hira uwwowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 25:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 25:53" />Tinninna kadiyyo hassissaaki woggatike hiri'a hujo'a adhdheeke manjishsha hedemeeten; hujisaaki annichchinna iso miicoqqen.<verse eid="LEV 25:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 25:54" />« ‹Konne qicinni garbumma fula dande'a gophoole, daggaaxxe karra hiissecatixxe onde tommeessoxxe wogga'ni isoonna isixxa oose garbumma fulchinowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 25:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 25:55" />Isira'eeliki ardi anke erganjo kademmaxxe Isira'eelike manjo kadeeki huuni manjinna duuchchi wodda barokenaa'ni baro garbake kade gatoqqen. Isira'eelki ardi ani Gibtseke boganaa'ni fulchenneke ardani. Aninna Mageno insa'neeken.<verse eid="LEV 25:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="LEV 26" />
  <para style="s1">Ajajenshati Afendaaxa Eebba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Lan. 7:12-24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 26:1" />« ‹Magenikinna magenonfatino'a heene bifaxxa fakke giissexxinoqeni; ittani kinjiki yookaan heene yaanenninna fakke giissitine uurrilsitinoqen; ani Mageno ha'nooken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:4">Fula. 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:4">Lew. 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 5:8">Lew. 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:21-22">16:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 27:1">27:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LEV 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 26:2" />« ‹Anxa ayyaaniinxa barruwwa ulffeesse; anee magenonfatinaa boonchcho duuchcha ulfeesse; ani Magenoken.<verse eid="LEV 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 26:3" />« ‹Seera anke'ni galdinoolenna ajaja anka muuxxinoole, <verse eid="LEV 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 26:4" />Boga ha'nooka midhati, haqqe ha'nooxxi gummati wo'mitaashsha xeena yannande'ni gansisanon. <verse eid="LEV 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 26:5" />Midha misse bira saxxammaxe midha bukki assexxine aassexine birtinebaangi woyenetixxa gumma qocexxinaaxxi yanna geltaan; woyinetixxa gumma qocexxine birtinebaangi midha rorlkitinaaxxi yanna geltaan; itatee hasissaaxxa duuchcha alfitinaan; boga ha'nooke'ninna nage'iki hexxinaan.<verse eid="LEV 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 26:6" />« ‹Boga ha'nooke'ni nage'a uwwanon; ayyeenna sodaatinebaangi soda'a belo diiphphinaan; fuggoka biniinchanna boga ha'nookenaa'ni hoyyanon; konneechchi edi'a ha'no lolaaki hedhabaan. <verse eid="LEV 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 26:7" />Naapha ha'nooka injifattinaan; bagedikinna heddo naapha ha'nooka birtinaan; <verse eid="LEV 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 26:8" />Ondi ha'nooki dhibba naapha injifataan; dhibbi ha'nooki tomme kuma naapha injifattinaan; naaphi ha'nookinna bogedoke'ni mudaan.<verse eid="LEV 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 26:9" />« ‹Ha'noobaanna elleti wirri hiyyanon; sanne ha'nooxxa bira sa'issanon; kako anxanna itti jaabeessannoni. <verse eid="LEV 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 26:10" />Sa'e sanixxa midha ittinaa'naani karnixxa haaroxxa aassate edixxa fulchitinaan. <verse eid="LEV 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 26:11" />Anina galduma anka ha'nooxxe oddo'ni assedhannoni; ha'noonna jibbabo'noni. <verse eid="LEV 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 26:12" />Aninna ha'nonni welti hedhannon; Mageno ha'nooke kadannoni; ha'nona arda anke kaddinaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 Qor. 6:16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 26:13" />Langaxxa garbake kaddinabaashsha Gibtseke boga'ni hexxinemmaxxe garbummanaa'n fulchenneki ani Mageno ha'nooken; ha'nonaa'ni garbumma hoyye wele manni'a hirendinebaangi ifi dandetine galdinaahshsha asseennen.<verse eid="LEV 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ajajema Gopha Idaggaaxxa Mura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 28:15-68">Lan. 28:15-68</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 26:14" />« ‹Mageni kinni anee laqa gophphine ajaja anka muuxa gophphinoole, mufeti gananon; <verse eid="LEV 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 26:15" />Ajaja anka muuxa gophphinoole, seera anka tuffatinoole, kako ha'noni aagennaxxa diigginoolenna aada anxa jibbitinoole, <verse eid="LEV 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 26:16" />Hara lumoka alayyo, huqqa, ille balleesse biso butti'a hiissaaka eebbinjiinka dhukkuba idaganonn; naaphi ha'nooki itaaxxa sanne tolanga rokkinaan. <verse eid="LEV 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 26:17" />Mufeti ha'noobaa wirri hiyyanonn; naaphi ha'nooki lole ha'noo injifataan; ha'no jibbammakinna ha'no galchaani; ayyinna ha'no shorrebaangi baqatinaan.<verse eid="LEV 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 26:18" />« ‹Tinni duuchchanna kaddee'na midde ani'a ajajema gophphinoole xixichcho idaganoka torbaane anga caala bira sa'issannoni. <verse eid="LEV 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 26:19" />Hunna anfeene hitine hollitina'neeka ha'noo salphisannoni; iimatenaa'ni xeeni ganabaashsha assannoni; buttatanna bagge sibiliinsha jabaattaashsha assannoni. <verse eid="LEV 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 26:20" />Butta midha, haqqe gumma uuta'nebaangee tola elootinaan.<verse eid="LEV 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 26:21" />« ‹Ane gibati itti me'itinoolenna anxa laqa gophphina'noole cubbo ha'nooxxishshanni torbaane anga lebe farra ha'no'ni idagannon. <verse eid="LEV 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 26:22" />Ha'nooxxe oddo'ni fuggoka biniincha ergannon; biniinchuwikinna oose ha'nooxxa shiyaan; hore ha'nookanna biraan; ha'nonaa'ni shiixxoki manji calli gatammaxxee manji gophemee'naa ori duuchchi cuuggo'aani.<verse eid="LEV 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 26:23" />« ‹Kunni xixichchi duuchchi ha'no'ni geyeechchi udumi'aanna anxa laqa gibbine ittani anee gibate'ni jabaattinoole, <verse eid="LEV 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 26:24" />Ha'no'ni idagenake sa'emmake xixichchi irra ta'a torbaane anga caala lebe jaba qicini xixannoni. <verse eid="LEV 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 26:25" />Aninni welti aagginemmaxxa kako diigginemmaxxee ha'no xixatee bagedo ergannon; qachchake'ninna bukki hitinoole fayyabaaka dhukkuba ha'nooxxe oddo'ni ibisannon; naapha ha'nookeenna anga uutinaan. <verse eid="LEV 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 26:26" />Ita alfitinabaashsha assee'naa, tomme melaalle affeexxa midha duuchcha mitte she'la ra'issitaan; itatanna qunse shiqinshaan; ha'nonna ittine godditinabaan.<verse eid="LEV 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 26:27" />« ‹Tinni duuchcha kaddee'naa ane gibate'ni itti jabaattinoolenna ani'a ajajema gibbinoole, <verse eid="LEV 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 26:28" />Ha'no'ni mufeti ke'annon; sa'emmake xixichchinaa'ni torbaane anga itti caaleeka xixichcho ha'no'ni idaganon. <verse eid="LEV 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 26:29" />Solo'iinxe bira sa'nenaa'ni kexxeexxa oose ifinxa itate'ni kexxinaani. <verse eid="LEV 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 26:30" />Kooba koobate'ni affinemmaka magenonfachchotika boonchcho ballesanon; hixaanni gubeemmammachcho duuchcha diigannon; hara ha'noo jibbe rensha ha'nookanna ibbeexxe magenonfatinammaxxe fakkuwa'ni hana hunannon; <verse eid="LEV 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 26:31" />Qachcha ha'nookanna diige birannon; magenonfachchotika boonchuwwa ha'nooka diiganonni; tolchuwwa ha'nookanna adhdhabo'noni. <verse eid="LEV 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 26:32" />Boga ha'nookanna hara balleessannoni; naaphi dage abideekinna ha'nooke bogixxa ba'ne uude soda'ati roqoonsaan. <verse eid="LEV 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 26:33" />Ha'no'ni bagedi ibaashsha asse wele boga'ni ha'noo xeerannoni; bogi ha'nooki manji gophemee'naa cuuggo'aani; qachchuwwi ha'nookinaa diigeme ba'aan; <verse eid="LEV 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 26:34" />Ha'no naapha ha'nookike boga'ni hexxinaa wodda duuchcha bogi ha'nooki duwwike kademmaxxee sanbata anka ulfeessaan; okkonechchi uduma bogi hafuura adhdhe gammadaan. <verse eid="LEV 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 26:35" />Ha'no hexxinemma wodda hafuura adhdhebaaki bogi ta'a ha'no hexxinebaaxxe yanna'ni hafuura adhdhaan.<verse eid="LEV 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 26:36" />« ‹Bogake'ni gatemmaka duuchcha diidallo shafa ibissemmakika shokkinna laqaashshanni alanne barabara hine baqantaashsha assannon; lolake'ni naaphi shorraa'na baqantamma woddishsha baqantaan; mitti naaphinna insa'ne bira hedhebaangi gugufante inbaan; <verse eid="LEV 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 26:37" />Ayyinna shorrebaangi naaphakenaa'ni baqantammashsha mitti mitteke'ni gugufate ibaan; hoone naaphanna uurritine lolatee dandetinabaan. <verse eid="LEV 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 26:38" />Wele ardixe oddo'ni rertine muddineaan; naapha ha'nookiki bogi liqiinse'na okko gattinaan. <verse eid="LEV 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 26:39" />Naaphi ha'nookike boga'ni reyotenaa'ni shiixxoki gattinaaki ha'nooxxenna edike ha'nooke annuwwixxe cubbonni yaayyitine gattinaan.<verse eid="LEV 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 26:40" />« ‹Yaane kinni sanne ha'nooxi cubbo isna'neexxa, ittanni ane'ni jallantemmaxxanna anee gibemmake annuwwa insa'neekixxe cubbo'a aadde aangaan; <verse eid="LEV 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 26:41" />Insa'ne gibe naapha insa'neekike boga'ni shorremmashsha assenneni; kaddolenna ila ha'nooxxi ifi salphissenna cubbo isexxe mura woxxoole, <verse eid="LEV 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 26:42" />Ya'iqoobinni, Yisaaqinninna Abirihaaminni welti aagenexxa kako kassi hiyyannon; boga uwwanno hiyye uwwennexxa adde haaronsanon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:7-8">Dada. 17:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:3-4">26:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:13-14">28:13-14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 26:43" />Arda isika gophe duwwi hedheeki bogi hafuura adhdhe gammadaan; insa'nenna aada anxa adhdha gonphemmaxxeena seera anka ulfeessa gonphemmaxxe cubbo insa'neexxenaa'ni kexxeexxa cubbo insa'neexxe hasissaaxxa mura wonxaan. <verse eid="LEV 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 26:44" />Kaddo male naapha insa'neekike boga'ni he'nee'na midde insa'nee hune waalabo'non yookaan birabo'non; insa'nee biraannele insa'ne'a aagennexxa kako muuxati qico'ni heqqannabaan; ani Mageno insa'neekeni; <verse eid="LEV 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 26:45" />Yaane kinni Mageno insa'neeke kadonnaa'a Gibtseke boganaa'ni fulchennechchi udumi'a annuwwa insa'neekee aagennexxa kako kassi hiyyannon; ani Magenoken› » hiyye.<verse eid="LEV 26:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 26:46" />Mageni isixxe oddo'ninna Isira'eelike ardixxe oddo'ni Muuse darree'ni Siinaxxe kooba'ni uwweeki seerinna aada tenneten.<verse eid="LEV 26:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="LEV 27" />
  <para style="s1">Magenoke Uunaaxe Uwwaka Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 27:1" />Mageni Muuse, <verse eid="LEV 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 27:2" />«Isira'eelika arda, manji mitti Magenoke werreega werreegee'na itti yaane kaddaa wodda werreegemmaki manji manjo uwwo'a werrego'ole manjo gatilsatika hira ati hitatoshsha kedee'na <verse eid="LEV 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 27:3" />Woyyichcha galmike mikisanjixxe qixxe'ni lame tomme wogganaa'ni jaane tomme wogga geyaake labbake manji'a jaane dhibba giraama geyaaka birretika sibiljo uunowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 27:4" />Lame tommenaa'ni jaane tomme wogga qico'ni hexxeexxe meyyaxxee sase tomme giraama kadaaka birretika sibiljo uunowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 27:5" />Onde woggana'ani lame tomme wogga qico'ni hedheeke labbake manji'a lame tomme giraama kadaaka birretike sibiljo uuwnowwaal; iittanni tenne wogga'ni hexxeexxe mayyaxxee sase giraama kadaaka birretike sibiljo uunowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 27:6" />Mitte agenjinaa'ni onde wogga kadaake labbake manji'a onde giraama kadaaka birretika sibiljo, iittanni tenne wogga'ni hexxeexxe meyyaxxee sase giraama kadaaka birretika sibiljo uunowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 27:7" />Wogga isixxi jaane tomme iima kadaake labbake manji'a tommenna onde giraama kadaaka birretika sibiljo, ittani wogga isexxi jaane tomme iima kaddaaxxe meyyaxxee tomme girrama kadaaka birretika sibiljo uunowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 27:8" />«Werreegemmaki manjichchi konne qico uwwattee dande'a gophoole werreege uwwemmaka manjo qeesichchiinba iyyedagowwaal; qeesichchikinna werregemmaki manji uwwo'a dande'aa qico uudeexxi uwwaashsha assowaal.<verse eid="LEV 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 27:9" />«Werregemeeki hori Magenoke tolcha kadaake hore kadoole gatilsatika hira uunabaan; Magenoke shiqqeexxi uwwa duuchcha Magenokee gargari foyendeexxe kaddaan. <verse eid="LEV 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 27:10" />Manjichchikinna ookkone horixxe bakka'ni wele shiqisho'a hasissabaani; bakka ookkone horixxa wele idagoole lamiingi hori Magenokee gargari foyemeeke kadowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 27:11" />Werreegemeeki hori Magenoke tolchake kade shiqabaake hore kadoole manjichchikinna hore ookkone qeesichchiinba iyyedagowwaal; <verse eid="LEV 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 27:12" />Qeesichchikinna horiinxa mayunte elokenna elobaake kadeexxa uude hira murowwaal; iikki hirinna qeesichchi mureeshshanni kadaan; <verse eid="LEV 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 27:13" />Horiinki anninna hore ookkone ifi'a gatilso'a hasoole dhibbake'ni lame tomme anga hirake'ni lebowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 27:14" />«Mitti manji mine isika Magenokee gargari hedhe tolcha asse uwwoole qeesichchi miniixxa ellenna elobaake kadeexxa uude hira murowwaal; iikki hirinna qeesichchi mureeshshan kadaan. <verse eid="LEV 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 27:15" />Miniinki anni ookkone mine ifi'a gatilso'a hasoole kinni hira muremeeke'ni dhibbake'ni lame tomme anga lebowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 27:16" />«Mitti manji fichchakenaa'ni kute Magenokee gargari foyendeexxe uwwa asse uwwoole hirikinna fichcha okkone'ni fuldaaxxe midhaxxe qixxe'ni murrowaal; mitte kiilo so'i'a onde tomme birretika sibiljo uwwowaal. <verse eid="LEV 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 27:17" />Fichchakanna karra hiissinammaxxee onde tommessoxxi wogga saxxeeshani hirbange'ni uwwa'noole wo'ma hira uwwowaali. <verse eid="LEV 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 27:18" />Fichcha uwwe'eki karra hiisse'namaxi onde tommesoxxi wogga saxxee'na tukki hiyyeete kadoole kinni qeesichchi daggaaxxe karra hiisse'nammaxxe wogga qico'ni gatteexxa yanna uudati hira hanii'ni xe'inshaashsha assaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:18, </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:4">Lak. 18:4</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 27:19" />Fichcha uwwemmaki manjichchi ifi'a gatilso'a hasoole hirake'ni dhibbake'ni lame tomme lebeexxi uwwowwaal. <verse eid="LEV 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 27:20" />Fichchiinki annichchi Magenokee uwwee'na hira ibinseeka uwwe ifi'a gatilseba edi darre wele manji'a fichchi iikki gurguremoole hiisse ifi'a gatilssa dande'abaan; <verse eid="LEV 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 27:21" />Kunni annichcho siretike higabaaki fichchi higgexxe karra hiissedhatixxe onde tommeessoxxe wogga'n Magenokee gargariti foyendeexxe karra kadee gataan; fichchikinna qeesichchiinke qoobbo kadaan.<verse eid="LEV 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 27:22" />«Mitti manji wele manjonaa'ni hireeka fichcha Magenokee gargari foyendeexxe uwwa asse shiqishoole, <verse eid="LEV 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 27:23" />Qeesichchikinna qo'nise uude higgexxe karra hiissecatixxe onde tommessoxxe wogga qico'ni hedheeka hira murowwaal; manjichchikinna eettene barra'ni hira fichchiinka uwwowaali; maallaqikinna Mageniinxe huje'a gargari foyemeeke kadaan. <verse eid="LEV 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 27:24" />Karra hiissecatixxe onde tommessoxxe wogga'ni sirete'ni fichcha gurguremmake fichchiinke anni'a yookaan fira isike higaan.<verse eid="LEV 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 27:25" />«Hira duuchcha ibinsaaki woyyichcha Mageniinke galmike mikisanjishsha kadaan.<verse eid="LEV 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 27:26" />«Edise ilemaaki hori sirende'ni Mageniinke kademmaxxee ayyinna eeyyuntetixxe uwwa asse shiqisho'a dande'abaan; jabbetenna kadi gedhebiinxinna re'etixxi beltanna sirende'ni Magenokee gargari foyendeexxen; <verse eid="LEV 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 27:27" />Tolchakee kadabaake horika edise ilemeeka kinni ege'nemeeke hira'ni dhibbake'ni lame tomme anga lenbe illeema hidhdha dandeenaan; horiinki anni hidhdhe ifi'a gatilsa gopha'noole wele manji'a kadaake hira'ni gurgurowwaal.<verse eid="LEV 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 27:28" />«Manji mitti ifika manjo kadi hore yookaan fichcha iittanni hedheeshshanni Mageniinxe huje'a hara woyyichcha asseechchin uduma hara gurguro'aanna kadi hidhdhe ifi'a gatilso'a dande'abaan; <verse eid="LEV 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 27:29" />Reyaashsha murte sa'isineeka manjo hiissine hira uune gatisiyyo hara hasissabaan; iiitta hedheeke manji'a royo hasissaani.<verse eid="LEV 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 27:30" />«Fichchi fulchaaxxi midha kadi gumma tommekenaa'ni mitte anga Magenokee gargari foyendeexxen. <verse eid="LEV 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 27:31" />Heene midhanaa'ninna kadi gummanaa'ni hisse ifi'a gatilso'a hasaaki manji ege'nemeeke hira'ni dhibbake'ni lame tomme anga lebe gatilsa dande'aan. <verse eid="LEV 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 27:32" />Minike horenaa'ni tommekenaa'ni mitte anga Mageniinken; hori laakko'emaa wodda tommekenaa'ni mitti Magenoke uwwemeeken. <verse eid="LEV 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 27:33" />Horiinki anni hore bifa bifa'ni foyaa wodda batto'eeka fayyakenaa'ni foyoqqen; isixxe bakka'ninna wele fulchoqei. Mitte horixxe bakka'ni wele hore fulchoole kinni lamiingi hori Magenokee foyemeeke kadowwaal; illemanna hira uuwwee'naa higoqqe» hite kulli hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Lak. 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 14:22-29">Lew. 14:22-29</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LEV 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 27:34" />Muuse Isira'eelike ardi'a kulaashsha Siinaxxe kooba'ni Mageni Muuse'ni uwweeki ajaji konneten.<verse eid="LEV 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 27" />
</usx>